# game/chapter1.rpyc:87
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9ab6e64b_1:

    # "I’m sniffling, crouched on the ground like a crushed bug, or maybe a worm."
    "我抽噎着蜷在地上，像一只被踩扁的虫子——也许是条蚯蚓。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:88
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_0bc7c7c9_1:

    # "My knees hurt, and my eyes sting from sobbing so much."
    "膝盖疼得厉害，眼睛也哭得又酸又涩。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:89
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_edf63506_1:

    # "Why is everybody so mean to me?"
    "为什么大家都要这样欺负我？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:90
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d78ecc60_1:

    # "I didn’t do anything wrong — or, at least, I don’t think I did."
    "我明明什么都没做错——至少，我自己觉得没有。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:91
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_652bcd18_1:

    # "My parents always told me that honesty is the best policy, but it never seems to work for me."
    "爸爸妈妈总说，做人要诚实。可这句话放在我身上，好像从来都行不通。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:92
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7794b64e_1:

    # "When I’m honest, it always upsets people. Then, they turn against me, and things like this happen."
    "只要我说实话，别人就会生气，然后合起伙来对付我……最后总会变成这样。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:93
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e9bdad66_1:

    # "My knee is bleeding. It oozes bright red, like the petals of a rose."
    "膝盖流血了。鲜红的血一点点渗出来，像玫瑰的花瓣。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:94
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_94dc0958_1:

    # "It hurts."
    "好疼。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:95
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9447fb96_1:

    # "The way they all look at me hurts."
    "他们看我的眼神，也一样刺得我生疼。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:96
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b533ba3e_1:

    # "I want them to stop staring at me."
    "别再盯着我了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:97
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_dc48b047_1:

    # "I want them to go away."
    "快点走开吧。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:98
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c7ea69d4_1:

    # "I look down at the ground, at the dirt and the rocks, my hands clenched into fists. I can’t stop myself from trembling."
    "我低头看着脚下的泥土和碎石，双手攥得死紧，身体却怎么也止不住颤抖。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:99
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b7d6b9da_1:

    # "I sit there, withering under their gaze, enduring their scornful looks and their wicked words, and then..."
    "我只能坐在那里，在一道道轻蔑的目光和恶毒的话语中缩成一团。就在这时……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:106
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6ab778d3_1:

    # W "Hey! You leave Niene alone! She didn’t do anythin’ wrong. You’re pathetic, picking on her because she won’t roll over and take your abuse! What’s wrong with you, anyway?!"
    W "喂！不许欺负妮妮！她什么都没做错。就因为她不肯任你们摆布，你们就一起欺负她？真够没出息的！你们到底有什么毛病？！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:107
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_45cb3e0a_1:

    # W "Now, go away! Scram! Shoo! Don’t let me catch you botherin’ Nienke again! If you do, you’ll be in for a whole world of hurt!"
    W "现在，给我滚！走开！以后别让我再撞见你们找妮恩克的麻烦！否则有你们好受的！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:108
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7eec772d_1:

    # "They appear before me: much taller than I am, with eyes full of fire."
    "那个人挡在我面前，比我高出许多，双眼燃着怒火。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:109
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7453f5c2_1:

    # "They stare down the bullies, scowling, and they all scarper."
    "那人沉着脸瞪住几个恶霸，吓得他们一哄而散。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:110
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_bee35dee_1:

    # "The bully boys have gone, leaving me alone with my saviour."
    "那群欺负人的男孩都跑了，只留下我和救了我的人。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:111
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d5d4239a_1:

    # "They smile at me, then say..."
    "那人朝我笑了笑，开口说道……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:112
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_368e5447_1:

    # W "Hey there, princess. Are you alright?"
    W "好啦，小公主。没事吧？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:113
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_26351e43_1:

    # Nienke "I, um... I don’t..."
    Nienke "我、呃……我不知道……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:114
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b10a1f04_1:

    # "I sniffle. Even more tears bead in my eyes, and I wipe them away roughly with the back of my arm."
    "我吸了吸鼻子，眼眶里又涌出泪水。我抬起胳膊，胡乱把眼泪擦掉。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:115
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_44005291_1:

    # Nienke "I-I don’t know why they’re always so cruel to me! Wh-What did I even do wrong?"
    Nienke "我、我不知道他们为什么总要这样欺负我！我、我到底做错了什么？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:116
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_edee8b56_1:

    # Nienke "Why are they like this...?!"
    Nienke "他们为什么要这样……？！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:117
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_370ba0a1_1:

    # W "Hey there..."
    W "好了，好了……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:118
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6c278f1e_1:

    # "My saviour looks down at me, their expression gentle. Gently, they pat me on the head, then say..."
    "救了我的人垂眼看着我，神情柔和下来。那只手轻轻摸了摸我的头，然后说道……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:119
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_60db5316_1:

    # W "It’s alright. You don’t need to worry about them. I’m here."
    W "没事了。别管他们，有我在呢。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:120
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f608b00c_1:

    # Nienke "Y-You won’t leave me, will you? You promise you’ll stay by my side?"
    Nienke "你、你不会离开我的，对不对？你答应我，会一直陪着我吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:121
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_0345cf59_1:

    # W "Well, of course I won’t leave you! Why would I, when I care about you so much? You’re my best friend, Niene!"
    W "我当然不会离开你！我这么在乎你，怎么可能丢下你嘛？你可是我最好的朋友，妮妮！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:122
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7a339329_1:

    # W "I love you a lot, so I’m gonna look out for you. I swear."
    W "我最喜欢你了，所以我会一直保护你。我发誓。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:123
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_fc75390d_1:

    # Nienke "Y-You really mean it?"
    Nienke "真、真的吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:124
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a6c98352_1:

    # W "’Course I mean it. Have you ever known me to go back on my word?"
    W "当然是真的。我什么时候说话不算数过？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:125
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_44816bb9_1:

    # W "I said it once before, and I’ll say it again. I’m not gonna abandon you. We’ll always be together."
    W "我以前说过，现在再说一次。我绝不会丢下你。我们永远都会在一起。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:126
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d843fd62_1:

    # W "I promise."
    W "我保证。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:143
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e576250c_1:

    # Engelmund "Mreow...!"
    Engelmund "喵呜……！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:145
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_47b7ac39_1:

    # Nienke "Hey, stop it..."
    Nienke "喂，别闹了……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:147
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_cb78bc86_1:

    # Engelmund "Mrrr!"
    Engelmund "呜喵！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:149
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_da88a659_1:

    # Nienke "Engelmund, please. Cut it out..."
    Nienke "恩格尔蒙德，求你了。别闹……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:151
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_95e1aa27_1:

    # Engelmund "Mreeeeeow!"
    Engelmund "喵——呜！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:153
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1f6818f8_1:

    # Nienke "H-Hey! I-I already told you to—"
    Nienke "喂、喂！我、我都说了让你——"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:155
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2859668a_1:

    # Nienke "O-Ow...!"
    Nienke "好、好痛……！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:159
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ffd249c7_1:

    # "I cry out in pain, my eyes snapping open, as I feel a sharp sensation raking across my right cheek."
    "右脸颊猛地传来一阵锐痛，像有什么东西狠狠划过。我痛呼一声，倏地睁开眼睛。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:160
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f3c8788c_1:

    # "Did Engelmund just scratch me...?"
    "恩格尔蒙德刚才……挠我了？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:174
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_0c2a1ecc_1:

    # "I blink, looking up, and I’m met with a curious meowing and an inquisitive tilting of the head."
    "我眨眨眼，抬头望去。迎接我的是一声好奇的猫叫，还有一颗疑惑地歪向一边的脑袋。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:175
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_46446817_1:

    # "Engelmund is sitting on my chest: a white fluffy puffball that looks like a sentient mound of cotton."
    "恩格尔蒙德正坐在我胸口。白白软软的一大团，活像一团成了精的棉花。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:176
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_037ecef6_1:

    # "He’s so round, it’s actually hard to tell at a glance that he’s a cat."
    "他圆得过分，乍一看甚至很难认出这是一只猫。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:177
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c343b79b_1:

    # "I would say that he’s my cat, but I don’t know if Engelmund belongs to anybody. He’s pretty proud, for being so rotund, and he used to live on the streets before I took him in."
    "要说他是我养的猫，倒也没错。不过，恩格尔蒙德到底算不算属于谁，还真不好说。别看他胖成这样，架子可大得很。被我收养之前，他一直在街头流浪。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:178
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5494bf88_1:

    # "He was a stray when our paths first crossed: this sad, skinny thing with the most pathetically tragic look on his feline face you can imagine."
    "我们第一次相遇时，他还是只瘦巴巴的流浪猫，一张猫脸可怜得让人心酸。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:179
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_0ef2f7aa_1:

    # "His white fur was all matted, and his paws and tail were dark with dirt."
    "白毛全都打了结，爪子和尾巴也脏得发黑。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:180
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_236e208d_1:

    # "He hadn’t eaten in a while, and you could see his ribs through his fur. Even his tail looked emaciated."
    "他很久没吃东西了，隔着毛都看得出肋骨，连尾巴都瘦得不像话。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:181
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_03fee1ef_1:

    # "I hadn’t known it was possible for a cat’s tail to look skinny, but Engelmund’s did. He was in a bad way, but I was able to help him."
    "我以前从没想过，猫的尾巴也能瘦成那样，可他就是这样。他当时的状况很糟，幸好我能帮上忙。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:182
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5d873953_1:

    # "I brought him back home, and I begged my parents if we could keep him."
    "我把他带回家，求爸爸妈妈让我们留下他。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:183
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_bac47c99_1:

    # Nienke "{i}Please, Mummy! Please, Daddy! She’s all sad and skinny, and she’s so bony! She’s sick!{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}求求你，妈妈！求求你，爸爸！她好可怜，瘦得只剩骨头了！她都生病了！{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:184
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d1e9d5ca_1:

    # Nienke "{i}If we throw her back onto the streets, she’ll die! We have to look after her! She needs us — and don’t you think she’s cute?{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}要是把她丢回街上，她会死的！我们得照顾她！她需要我们呀——而且，你们不觉得她很可爱吗？{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:185
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_36ef46e5_1:

    # "...I think that’s how my pleas went, at least."
    "……至少，我记得自己当时是这么求他们的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:186
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d1c4369e_1:

    # "I really was young when I found Engelmund, because I still called my parents ‘Mummy’ and ‘Daddy’..."
    "捡到恩格尔蒙德时，我真的还很小，喊起“妈妈”“爸爸”来，还是一副奶声奶气的样子……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:187
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_bf57e0a2_1:

    # "And I wasn’t the most observant girl either, even though people think elves are especially discerning."
    "而且，虽说大家都觉得精灵眼光敏锐，我那时候却实在算不上细心。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:188
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_aaab02a0_1:

    # "I was convinced, you see, that Engelmund was a girl. I couldn’t imagine that anything that cute and soft and fluffy could ever be a boy."
    "因为我坚信，恩格尔蒙德一定是女孩子。我根本想象不出，这么可爱、这么柔软、这么毛茸茸的小东西，怎么可能是男孩子。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:189
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2fbfb0ee_1:

    # "It didn’t make sense to me: not when all of the boys I’d known at that point were the loud, brash, abrasive types at school, who teased me about my pointed ears and who tried to trip me in the hallways..."
    "这实在说不通。毕竟，当时我认识的男孩子，全是学校里那种吵吵闹闹、粗鲁讨厌的家伙。他们拿我的尖耳朵取笑，还会在走廊里故意绊我……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:190
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ecfd9f95_1:

    # "So I had a bit of a surprise when my parents took Engelmund in, and they gave him his first bath."
    "所以，爸爸妈妈收留了恩格尔蒙德，第一次给他洗澡时，我可是吃了一惊。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:191
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1628fcc0_1:

    # "My parents didn’t actually want to take Engelmund in at first, given they live and work above a café. They actually wanted to take him to a shelter at first."
    "其实，爸爸妈妈一开始并不想留下他。我们家住在咖啡馆楼上，他们平时还得忙店里的事，所以起初打算把他送到收容所。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:192
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b91c2411_1:

    # Elowenn "{i}Don’t fret so much, Nienke. I know you like him, but your father and I both have to look after the café.{/i}"
    Elowenn "{i}别这么着急，妮恩克。我知道你喜欢他，可我和爸爸都得照看咖啡馆。{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:193
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_0501349a_1:

    # Elowenn "{i}We’ll be out all day, and you’ll be at school. I don’t think it would be fair to leave this poor cat here unsupervised for hours at a time. I’m afraid he’ll be bored...{/i}"
    Elowenn "{i}我们白天不在家，你也要上学。让这可怜的小家伙独自待上好几个小时，连个照看的人都没有，恐怕不太好。他会闷坏的……{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:194
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9aec06b3_1:

    # Elowenn "{i}And he has quite the fiery temper, too. I don’t want him clawing at the furniture, or toppling any of my figures.{/i}"
    Elowenn "{i}而且，他的脾气还挺大。我可不想让他把家具挠坏，或是打翻我的小摆件。{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:195
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1f8b758b_1:

    # Elowenn "{i}Why don’t we take him to a shelter? I’m sure he’ll find somebody who wants to adopt him. Alpenrose has no shortage of old dears who are looking for a bit of companionship.{/i}"
    Elowenn "{i}不如送他去收容所吧？肯定有人愿意领养他的。阿尔彭罗瑟有不少老人，都想找个伴儿呢。{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:196
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f4cd0468_1:

    # "That was what my mother said, and I don’t think she was being unreasonable. If we had taken Engelmund to the shelter, I’m sure he would have been able to charm somebody..."
    "妈妈当时就是这么说的，我也不觉得她没有道理。如果把恩格尔蒙德送去收容所，他一定能讨到谁的欢心……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:197
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7cdf8219_1:

    # "But the mere thought of being parted from him, after I’d found him on the roadside, his white fur grey and his eyes full of fear, was inconceivable."
    "可一想到我在路边捡到他时，那身发灰的白毛，还有那双满是恐惧的眼睛，我就怎么也接受不了要和他分开。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:198
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_adb28945_1:

    # "I refused to let him go. I cried and I begged and I pleaded, and I promised that I would do my best to look after him."
    "我死活不肯把他送走，又哭又求，保证自己一定会尽全力照顾他。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:199
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e832ff5a_1:

    # Nienke "{i}I’ll take really really extra special good care of him, Mummy, I promise! I’ll do everything for him, so please, can we keep him?{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}妈妈，我保证会把他照顾得特别、特别、特别好！他的事全都交给我！求求你，让我们留下他吧？{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:200
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ed7531e3_1:

    # Nienke "{i}Please, please, please, please, please?!{/i}"
    Nienke "{i}求你了，求你了，求你了，求你了，求你了嘛！{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:201
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6f2c8640_1:

    # "I kept up a steady string of pleas throughout the next few days, and I even got my best friend, Cornelia, to help me."
    "接下来的几天，我一直缠着他们央求，甚至把最好的朋友科妮莉娅也拉来帮忙。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:202
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_51bb838f_1:

    # "We decided to stage a protest, constructing our own makeshift signs with poster boards in the art room after school."
    "我们决定举行抗议。放学后，我们留在美术教室，用海报纸做起了标语牌。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:203
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_768901c6_1:

    # "We made a lot of these signs — A CAT IS FOR LIFE and DON’T ABBANDON (sic) HIM — and WHERE IS YOUR HEART??? — and we staged a little protest outside Fleur de Lys, my parents’ café."
    "我们做了好多牌子，上面写着“养猫就要养一辈子”“不许抛气他”，还有“你们的良心呢？？？”。然后，我们就在爸妈开的百合花咖啡馆门前，搞了一场小小的抗议。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:204
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_81727ca7_1:

    # "Cornelia and I started chanting and waving our makeshift signs, and a few of the customers happened to see us at work, including the elderly Mrs van Dijk."
    "我和科妮莉娅一边喊口号，一边挥舞自制的牌子，被几位客人撞见了，其中就有上了年纪的范戴克太太。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:205
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_68f45d7d_1:

    # "She asked us what all of the fuss was about, and I told her I was ‘doing a protest’."
    "她问我们闹这么大动静是在干什么，我告诉她，我正在“举行抗议”。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:206
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_35cede9b_1:

    # "I felt very adult when I said that, even though I was still a little kid, and Mrs van Dijk seemed to find this very funny."
    "明明还是个小孩子，说这话时却觉得自己特别像个大人。范戴克太太似乎觉得有趣极了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:207
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7acba9ea_1:

    # "She offered to join in the protest, even though she was an elderly woman with a bad back and aching knees, because it was ‘for a good cause’."
    "虽然她年纪大了，腰不好，膝盖也疼，却主动说要加入我们，因为这是“在做好事”。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:208
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_75b2ef01_1:

    # "She took one of my signs — DON’T ABBANDON HIM — and though she raised an eyebrow at the typographical error, she still brandished it proudly."
    "她拿起那块“不许抛气他”的牌子。看到错别字时，她挑了挑眉，却还是神气地把牌子举了起来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:209
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c5890417_1:

    # "We must have made a curious sight, two little girls and one elderly woman marching outside the street, so we drew quite a lot of attention."
    "两个小女孩和一位老太太沿街抗议，这场面肯定挺稀奇，惹得不少人围观。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:210
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ccf3a406_1:

    # "A few more people asked what we were doing — some of Mrs van Dijk’s friends from the bingo hall, and Cornelia’s older brother, Fritz — and we were able to draw in quite a crowd."
    "又有几个人过来问我们在做什么——有范戴克太太在宾果游戏厅认识的朋友，还有科妮莉娅的哥哥弗里茨——渐渐地，我们身边还真聚起了一小群人。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:211
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2733c218_1:

    # "We got about seven people protesting until my mother eventually gave in my demands."
    "抗议的人差不多凑到七个时，妈妈终于答应了我的要求。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:212
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5c1d5212_1:

    # Elowenn "{i}If you love the cat that much, Nienke, then of course we can keep him. I wouldn’t want to rain on your parade...{/i}"
    Elowenn "{i}妮恩克，既然你这么喜欢这只猫，我们当然可以留下他。我也不想扫你的兴……{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:213
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7f7a2c42_1:

    # Elowenn "{i}But we do need to think of some way we can look after him while we’re at the café. I don’t want to leave him unsupervised.{/i}"
    Elowenn "{i}不过，我们还得想个办法，保证我们在店里忙的时候，也有人照顾他。我可不想把他独自丢在家里。{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:214
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_af6208d9_1:

    # "...Well, the rest of this story is pretty uninteresting."
    "……嗯，之后的事就没什么意思了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:215
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e8b90ffb_1:

    # "There was some back and forth, until Fritz offered to check in on our newest family member a couple of times a day while I was at school and my parents were at work."
    "我们商量来商量去，最后弗里茨主动提出，在我上学、爸妈工作的时候，每天过来几趟，看看这位新加入的家庭成员。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:216
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e59c5d1b_1:

    # "Fritz is quite a bit older than Cornelia, and at the time, he’d just finished with school."
    "弗里茨比科妮莉娅大不少，那时刚刚中学毕业。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:217
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f8e7a0a2_1:

    # "He didn’t get the grades needed to go to his university of choice, so he’d been studying to retake his exams, all while picking up odd-jobs around the village: trimming hedges and mowing lawns and what have you."
    "他的成绩没达到心仪大学的录取要求，所以一边复习，准备重考，一边在村里打些零工，修修树篱、剪剪草坪之类的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:218
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c3f0c42f_1:

    # "Fritz was able to fit checking up on our cat into his schedule, so things worked out in the end."
    "他能抽空来照看我们的猫，这件事总算圆满解决了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:219
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9430b9bf_1:

    # "We only needed Fritz to check on our cat for the first month or so after we took him in anyway, mostly to check he was recovering after his sojourn on the streets."
    "其实，也只需要麻烦弗里茨照看最初那一个月左右，主要是确认这只流浪多时的小猫正在慢慢恢复。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:220
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_712b32d5_1:

    # "He was quite weak during those early days, and he needed some coaxing to eat..."
    "刚来时，他身体虚弱，连吃点东西都得哄……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:221
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a97fae7f_1:

    # "But now, more than a decade later, we have the opposite problem."
    "可如今，十多年过去，我们却碰上了完全相反的难题。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:222
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_0e2fc49e_1:

    # "Engelmund (who got his name from Mrs van Dijk, actually) does almost nothing but eat. He’s obsessed with food."
    "恩格尔蒙德——顺带一提，这名字其实是范戴克太太起的——几乎除了吃，什么也不干。他满脑子都只有吃。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:223
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_bb55dc4a_1:

    # "He was a twiggy, emaciated creature when we first found him, but he’s filled out a lot since then."
    "刚捡到他时，他瘦得像根柴火棍，后来却越养越圆。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:224
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2d617372_1:

    # "He’s positively roly-poly: so round you could probably push him down the stairs and it wouldn’t hurt him. In fact, I bet he’d bounce after hitting the floor."
    "现在简直胖成了一个球，圆得好像从楼梯上滚下去都不会受伤。我敢说，他落地时没准还能弹起来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:225
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7e36be18_1:

    # "Engelmund isn’t picky about what he eats, either. He’s a cat with wide tastes, and a voracious appetite."
    "恩格尔蒙德还不挑食，什么都爱尝一口，胃口更是大得惊人。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:226
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_91dc50f6_1:

    # "He’ll eat his wet cat food — tuna and chicken as his favourites — but he’ll also eat people food with impunity: meatballs, apple pie, rusks, and more."
    "他吃猫罐头——最爱金枪鱼和鸡肉——也毫不客气地吃我们人吃的东西：肉丸、苹果派、烤面包干，什么都不放过。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:227
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d84ecfb9_1:

    # "One of Engelmund’s favourite dishes is actually butter cake."
    "其中，他尤其喜欢黄油蛋糕。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:228
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_db63f09d_1:

    # "My mother’s butter cake is delicious — it’s one of the most popular items on the menu at Fleur de Lys — and Engelmund seems to agree, the way he scarfs my mother’s butter cake down."
    "妈妈的黄油蛋糕很好吃，是百合花咖啡馆最受欢迎的点心之一。看恩格尔蒙德每次狼吞虎咽的样子，显然他也这么认为。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:229
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_cd34f52b_1:

    # "Engelmund especially likes it when my mother adds raisins to her butter cake, though I’m more of a candied ginger person myself."
    "他最喜欢妈妈在蛋糕里加葡萄干，不过我自己更偏爱糖渍姜。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:231
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_23704731_1:

    # Engelmund "Mreeeeow!"
    Engelmund "喵——呜！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:232
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_58d7f500_1:

    # "But I guess now isn’t the time to ponder my favourite foods."
    "不过，现在好像不是琢磨自己爱吃什么的时候。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:233
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_41085877_1:

    # "It’s kind of hard to breathe with him sitting on me like this."
    "他这样压在我身上，实在让人喘不过气。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:234
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_0e416085_1:

    # "I reach up blearily, my dreams sticking to me, then press my palm atop Engelmund’s head."
    "我迷迷糊糊地抬起手，意识还陷在梦里，把手掌放在恩格尔蒙德头顶。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:235
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6ff91ffc_1:

    # "I give him a stroke and mumble a distracted “Good morning.”"
    "我摸摸他，心不在焉地嘟囔了一句“早安”。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:236
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_dbd9f185_1:

    # "Well. I try to say ‘good morning’, but what comes out of my mouth is actually closer to..."
    "好吧。我是想说“早安”，但真正说出口的却更像是……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:237
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_3e2b164e_1:

    # Nienke "Good morn— {sc=4}pfft?{/sc}"
    Nienke "早——{sc=4}噗呸？{/sc}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:238
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_fcd032ea_1:

    # "It takes me a couple of seconds to realise that I have some hair in my mouth, and another second to spit it out."
    "过了几秒，我才发现嘴里进了猫毛，又费了一秒把它吐出去。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:239
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1909c6ff_1:

    # "I wince, then glance back up at Engelmund."
    "我皱起脸，重新抬眼看向恩格尔蒙德。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:240
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a0995b18_1:

    # "He purrs once more and, geez. Is it just me, or does he sound amused? That kind of stings, and I pout."
    "他又呼噜了一声。真是的……是我的错觉吗？怎么听起来还挺得意？有点受伤的我撅起了嘴。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:241
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b0cc0283_1:

    # Nienke "Yeah, yeah. Rub it in..."
    Nienke "好，好。你就尽管笑我吧……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:242
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2d844008_1:

    # "I give Engelmund another stroke, then say..."
    "我又摸了摸恩格尔蒙德，说……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:243
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_59d065e8_1:

    # Nienke "Can you get off me? You’re crushing me."
    Nienke "能不能从我身上下去？你都快压扁我了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:245
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_863ab12d_1:

    # Engelmund "Mrr?"
    Engelmund "喵？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:246
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_bde321e5_1:

    # Nienke "That’s what I said. You’ve gotten so heavy..."
    Nienke "说的就是你。怎么变得这么沉……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:248
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9ddabf80_2:

    # Engelmund "Mreow!"
    Engelmund "喵呜！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:260
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_93cdeff0_1:

    # "I shift, and Engelmund finally obeys me. He moves from my lap, all twenty fluffy pounds of him, and sits by the foot of my bed, blinking."
    "我挪了挪身子，恩格尔蒙德终于听话了。那一身足有二十磅重的毛团离开我的腿，坐到床脚，眨巴着眼睛。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:262
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_61fab8d9_1:

    # "He’s looking at me expectantly, his ears twitching. I know he’s waiting for me to get up and feed him, but I don’t move: not just yet."
    "他满怀期待地望着我，耳朵一动一动的。我知道，他在等我起床喂他。可我还没有动，至少，现在还不想。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:263
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1abcf382_1:

    # "I’m still thinking about my dream, though I can’t remember all of the details. What was it about?"
    "我还在想刚才的梦，却记不清其中的细节了。我到底梦见了什么？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:265
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7c0b6a52_1:

    # "I rack my brain, struggling to remember..."
    "我绞尽脑汁，想把它记起来……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:270
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9ddabf80_3:

    # Engelmund "Mreow!"
    Engelmund "喵呜！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:272
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8f252285_1:

    # "But Engelmund purrs disapprovingly, and it brings me back to my senses."
    "可恩格尔蒙德不满地叫了一声，把我拉回现实。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:273
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8a415993_1:

    # "Why am I getting so hung up on a dream? There’s no point dwelling on it. I’ve already forgotten it."
    "我为什么这么在意一个梦？再想也没什么意义。我已经忘了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:278
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d95db9b3_1:

    # "Some people say that elves have prophetic dreams, but these comments usually come from people who don’t know anything about us."
    "有人说，精灵会做预知梦。不过说这种话的人，通常对我们一无所知。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:279
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2afd4769_1:

    # "They act like we’re mysterious and impossible to understand, but I don’t think we’re too different from regular humans."
    "他们把我们说得神秘莫测，可我不觉得我们和普通人类有多大区别。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:281
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9cae0153_1:

    # "My best (and only) friend Cornelia used to say I was too ordinary, even. She said I cared too much about my studies, and I needed to learn to loosen up."
    "我最好的——也是唯一的——朋友科妮莉娅，甚至说过我太普通了。她说我把学习看得太重，应该学着放松一点。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:282
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2f5317f1_1:

    # "She told me that I spent too much time indoors, and I was practically welded to my textbooks."
    "她还说，我整天窝在屋里，简直像和课本粘在了一起。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:283
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_fe6f946f_1:

    # Cornelia "{i}You need to live a little more, Niene! You can’t hole away indoors all the time, reading! It isn’t healthy!{/i}"
    Cornelia "{i}妮妮，你也得好好享受生活呀！哪能整天躲在屋里看书？这样对身体不好！{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:285
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_4ec8a2b3_1:

    # "I used to pout at her insistences that we go outside more and get some fresh air, but she might have been right."
    "以前她总拉着我出去走走、呼吸新鲜空气，我还会不高兴。不过，她也许说得没错。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:287
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_21482a11_1:

    # "My grades might have outstripped Cornelia’s, but she’s the one who wound up going to university in Utrecht."
    "我的成绩或许比科妮莉娅好，可最后去乌得勒支读大学的人，却是她。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:288
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_91abe1b8_1:

    # "I, meanwhile, am still in Alpenrose, just as I have been for years."
    "而我仍然待在阿尔彭罗瑟。这些年来，一直如此。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:290
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_0a9891ad_1:

    # "I’m already twenty, but my life has barely progressed at all. I still live with my parents, in this same quaint little house above their humble café, Fleur de Lys."
    "我已经二十岁了，人生却几乎没有往前走过。我还是和父母住在一起，住在他们那间小咖啡馆——百合花——楼上，那栋一成不变的古朴小屋里。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:292
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e1cb24e9_1:

    # "I fantasised about going to university myself, but these dreams feel pretty distant now."
    "我也曾憧憬过上大学，可如今，那些梦想已经很遥远了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:293
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_fddb46c1_1:

    # "In the end, it didn’t matter how much I studied. I’m still here."
    "到头来，无论我多努力读书，都没有用。我还是留在这里。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:295
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d3fa5e61_1:

    # "I can have all of the intense, vivid dreams I like, but it won’t change reality."
    "无论我做多少鲜明而强烈的梦，都改变不了现实。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:296
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5eef43ab_1:

    # "It won’t change a single thing. I’m afraid that my parents are never going to let me leave Alpenrose. I’ll be stuck here until the day I die, and there’s absolutely nothing I can do about it."
    "什么都改变不了。恐怕爸爸妈妈永远都不会让我离开阿尔彭罗瑟。我会一直困在这里，直到死去，而我对此无能为力。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:298
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e1456788_1:

    # "...Wow. Talk about cheerful."
    "……哇。还真是乐观得不得了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:299
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_41c7daa7_1:

    # "I’m such a bundle of sunshine, I’ll have to be careful. Otherwise, I might end up blinding myself, and then I really would be in a pickle."
    "我这么阳光灿烂，可得小心点。万一把自己的眼睛晃瞎了，那可就真麻烦了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:301
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_3e130a4b_1:

    # "How in the world would I be able to read Cornelia’s letters then?"
    "到时候，我还怎么看科妮莉娅的信呢？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:315
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_62c64204_1:

    # "I shake away my early morning malaise as best I can, then prepare myself for the day ahead."
    "我尽量甩掉一大早就冒出来的低落情绪，开始准备迎接新的一天。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:316
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f24eb124_1:

    # "I change out of my nightclothes, brush my hair, then join my parents in the kitchen with Engelmund at my heels."
    "换下睡衣，梳好头发，我来到厨房和爸妈会合，恩格尔蒙德紧紧跟在脚边。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:317
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_fa4c98a4_1:

    # "My parents both greet me with bright smiles."
    "爸妈都笑容满面地向我打招呼。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:318
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a687e3aa_1:

    # "My father is sat at the breakfast table, a plate of pancakes piled before him and a paper in his hands, while my mother is standing by the stove with a skillet."
    "爸爸坐在餐桌旁，面前堆着一盘煎饼，手里拿着报纸。妈妈则握着平底锅，站在炉子前。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:319
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_58b95462_1:

    # "She looks at me over her shoulder, her hair tied in a braid, as she says..."
    "她把头发编成辫子，回过头来看我，说道……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:323
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8218af4e_1:

    # Elowen "Good morning, dear. Do you want some pancakes too?"
    Elowen "早安，宝贝。你也要吃煎饼吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:324
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_00e0b345_1:

    # "I’m not sure why my mother is bothering to ask. She should already know the answer to that."
    "真不知道妈妈为什么还要问。答案不是明摆着的吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:325
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8d603f7b_1:

    # "I don’t think there’s a single person alive who can resist my mother’s apple pancakes."
    "我不相信这世上有人能抵挡得住妈妈做的苹果煎饼。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:326
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_cd2ecba7_1:

    # "I nod my head, and my mother giggles in delight."
    "我点点头，妈妈高兴地笑出了声。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:327
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c0b5e28f_1:

    # "My mother’s getting on in years, but you wouldn’t think that to look at her."
    "妈妈也渐渐上了年纪，可光看外表，完全看不出来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:328
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_66b7a5df_1:

    # "Elves are known for our longevity, and we live longer than ordinary humans do. While the lifespan of a human tends to be around eighty years or so, we elves can live to almost twice that."
    "我们精灵向来以长寿著称，寿命比普通人类长。人类一般能活到八十岁左右，而精灵差不多能活到那个年岁的两倍。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:329
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_72b9ed55_1:

    # "I’ve even heard that our elven ancestors could live for much longer than we can. The elves of old — high elves, they’re called — could live until they were five hundred; six hundred; sometimes until they were almost one thousand."
    "我还听说，我们精灵的祖先寿命远比现在长。那些古老的精灵——也就是所谓的高等精灵——能活到五百岁、六百岁，有时甚至接近一千岁。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:330
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_cda0b7c5_1:

    # "It’s been almost a millennia since these storied days, however, and elves can’t live that long anymore."
    "不过，那些传说中的岁月已经过去了将近一千年。如今的精灵，已经活不了那么久了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:331
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_16c5dd9f_1:

    # "I’ve heard people say that we elves diluted our own bloodline by mating with humans, and that’s why we can no longer live for half a century..."
    "有人说，是我们精灵和人类通婚，稀释了自己的血脉，才再也活不到五十岁……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:332
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_924ada7c_1:

    # "But one hundred and fifty years sounds like a decent lifespan to me."
    "不过，在我看来，一百五十岁已经足够长寿了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:333
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6a5c025a_1:

    # "My mother is only in her forties, but you wouldn’t know it to look at her. She doesn’t have any wrinkles, and she could easily be mistaken for my older sister."
    "妈妈才四十多岁，可一点也看不出来。脸上一丝皱纹都没有，别人很容易把她当成我的姐姐。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:334
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ab112352_1:

    # "My father’s in a similar state. He looks a good decade younger than Cornelia’s grizzled, bearded father, Laurens, though my father has aged a little after his mishap a couple of years prior."
    "爸爸也差不多。科妮莉娅的父亲劳伦斯胡子花白，爸爸看起来至少比他年轻十岁。不过，几年前那场意外，还是让爸爸显得老了一点。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:335
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c57248dd_1:

    # "He tripped over Engelmund on the stairs, and broke his right leg."
    "他在楼梯上被恩格尔蒙德绊倒，摔断了右腿。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:336
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ae9a81e8_1:

    # "He was able to recover in due course, but he’s been walking with a limp ever since."
    "腿后来是养好了，可从那以后，他走路就一直有点跛。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:337
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a0862ccb_1:

    # "My father doesn’t have any wrinkles either, and he has long hair: a rarity amongst the men in Alpenrose."
    "爸爸脸上也没有皱纹，还留着长发。在阿尔彭罗瑟的男人里，这可不多见。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:338
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_130120fa_1:

    # "My parents definitely stand out amongst Alpenrose’s citizens, and so do I."
    "爸妈在村里确实很显眼，我也一样。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:339
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_10280895_1:

    # "We were the subject of many curious stares when we first came to this village, though I think the people of Alpenrose have since gotten used to us..."
    "刚搬来时，我们不知惹来了多少好奇的目光。不过，村里的人如今应该已经习惯我们了……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:340
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8cf5fe03_1:

    # "Or, at least, I hope they have."
    "至少，我希望如此。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:341
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_32993cfc_1:

    # "That’s what I choose to believe, at least. Otherwise, it would be difficult for me to continue working at Fleur de Lys, serving all of these humans."
    "反正，我宁愿这么相信。不然，要我继续在百合花咖啡馆里招待这些人类客人，可就太难了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:350
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_abaa1757_1:

    # "Speaking of serving, my mother is in full waitress mode, though the café hasn’t even opened yet."
    "说起招待，咖啡馆明明还没开门，妈妈却已经进入服务员的状态了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:351
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e4bd69ae_1:

    # "She plates up a couple of thick, fluffy apple pancakes for me, then slides them over to me with a smile."
    "她把两张厚实蓬松的苹果煎饼装进盘子，微笑着推到我面前。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:352
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_58caae87_1:

    # Elowen "Here you are, dear. There’s sugar on the table, if you want any, and butter..."
    Elowen "给，宝贝。想放糖的话，桌上有，黄油也有……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:353
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_00b9081a_1:

    # Elowen "But, before you dig in, maybe you should tell me how you’re doing. Did you have a good night’s sleep?"
    Elowen "不过，吃之前，先跟妈妈说说你怎么样？昨晚睡得好吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:355
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_efe81d06_1:

    # Nienke "Why do you ask?"
    Nienke "怎么突然问这个？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:356
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_448f23b7_1:

    # Elowen "I’m just worried, that’s all. You look rather weary!"
    Elowen "就是有点担心你。看你一脸没精神的样子！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:358
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8885ed95_1:

    # "Urgh. Is it really {i}that{/i} obvious?"
    "唉。有{i}那么{/i}明显吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:360
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5145aef8_1:

    # "I don’t think I had a bad night’s sleep, but I’d hesitate to call it pleasant. I had a lot of strange dreams, and I didn’t get much rest as a result."
    "昨晚倒也不算睡得很差，但要说睡得好，我可说不出口。做了一堆奇怪的梦，根本没怎么休息好。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:362
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d26d4995_1:

    # "I feel pretty tired, and it doesn’t help that Engelmund woke me up by swiping at me with his paw."
    "我已经够累了，恩格尔蒙德还一爪子把我挠醒，真是雪上加霜。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:363
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1e77a916_1:

    # "I suppose I should be used to that already, since Engelmund has been waking me up like that for years, but geez. You’d think he could give it a rest every once in a while."
    "他这么叫我起床，也叫了这么多年，我早该习惯了。可真是的，偶尔放我一马不行吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:365
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_262fabdc_1:

    # Nienke "I’m alright, I guess. I’m just a bit..."
    Nienke "还好吧。我只是有点……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:367
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_80bd01b1_1:

    # "{i}Yawn.{/i}"
    "{i}哈啊——{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:368
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c0d70d43_1:

    # Nienke "Tired."
    Nienke "困。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:370
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a67b1b37_1:

    # Emiel "Ha! I thought you might have been, when you stumbled into the kitchen — but not to worry."
    Emiel "哈！看你晃晃悠悠地进厨房，我就猜到了。不过不用担心。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:371
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_eaca73a0_1:

    # Emiel "I’m sure your mother’s pancakes will perk you right up. They’re delicious, just like always!"
    Emiel "吃了你妈妈的煎饼，肯定立刻就精神了。还是一如既往地好吃！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:372
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e995d74a_1:

    # Emiel "Now, why don’t you start? Dig in, dear. I don’t want them to go cold!"
    Emiel "快吃吧，宝贝。放凉了可就不好了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:374
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5ad82e05_1:

    # Nienke "Right..."
    Nienke "嗯……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:375
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9d75cf28_1:

    # "I examine my plate of apple pancakes for a while."
    "我盯着盘里的苹果煎饼看了一会儿。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:383
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e514270e_1:

    # "My mother makes apple pancakes for breakfast whenever she can find the time because they’re one of my father’s favourite dishes."
    "只要腾得出时间，妈妈就会做苹果煎饼当早餐，因为这是爸爸最爱吃的东西之一。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:384
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ad79d5c7_1:

    # "My father prefers warm, nourishing, slightly stodgy food: especially when it’s sweet."
    "爸爸偏爱热乎、管饱、稍微厚重一点的食物。要是甜的，那就更好了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:385
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2ae83e44_1:

    # "He has a bigger sweet tooth than most of the girls back in the lyceum did, I swear, and they were always stopping by Astrolabe when it first opened for French toast and sundaes."
    "我敢说，他比我们高中里大部分女孩子还爱吃甜食。星盘咖啡馆刚开业时，那些女孩可没少跑去吃法式吐司和圣代。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:386
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_75c0a120_1:

    # "My father’s not a big sundae person, but he does like French toast. It’s probably one of his favourite dishes, right next to apple pancakes."
    "爸爸倒不怎么爱吃圣代，但很喜欢法式吐司。除了苹果煎饼，那大概就是他的最爱了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:387
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_38698c72_1:

    # "He prefers French toast, however, when made by my mother’s expert hands."
    "不过，他最喜欢的，还是妈妈亲手做的法式吐司。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:388
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_3c0ab276_1:

    # "My father’s a big connoisseur of breakfast foods in general — pain au chocolats and pancakes and waffles and scones — but he likes my mother’s food over everything else."
    "爸爸对早餐其实颇有研究——巧克力可颂、煎饼、华夫饼、司康，他都喜欢——但无论什么，都比不上妈妈做的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:389
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ad3cf7f5_1:

    # "My mother’s a very accomplished chef, which is in part why my parents opened Fleur de Lys in the first place."
    "妈妈厨艺很好，这也是爸妈当初开百合花咖啡馆的原因之一。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:390
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b5008819_1:

    # "My father handles the business side of things while my mother does most of the baking, with some additional help from Dad."
    "爸爸负责经营，烘焙则主要由妈妈负责，爸爸也会搭把手。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:391
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_81286166_1:

    # "I, meanwhile, do the serving."
    "至于我，就负责招待客人。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:392
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d01fc637_1:

    # "We have a few other waitresses, like a whey-faced girl called Willemijn, but for the most part, ours is a family run business."
    "我们还雇了几个女服务员，比如有个脸色苍白的女孩叫威廉敏。不过，大体上，这仍是一家家庭经营的咖啡馆。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:393
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_223dae86_1:

    # "Our lives are hectic, and we’re often busy, but it’s a cosy sort of existence."
    "日子忙忙碌碌，常常不得闲，却也自有一份温馨。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:394
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9b09d99d_1:

    # "I enjoy living above Fleur de Lys (for the most part, at least), and I like working with my parents..."
    "我喜欢住在百合花咖啡馆楼上——至少，大部分时候喜欢——也喜欢和爸妈一起工作……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:395
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e506039b_1:

    # "And I especially love my mother’s food."
    "尤其喜欢妈妈做的饭。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:396
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_29846c45_1:

    # "In a way, I think I’m like my father. I can’t get enough of her pancakes either."
    "这一点，我大概挺像爸爸。我也怎么都吃不腻她做的煎饼。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:397
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_02f26243_1:

    # "My mother cooks them for a little too long in the pan, so they get all crispy on the outside."
    "妈妈会把煎饼在锅里多煎一会儿，让外面变得脆脆的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:398
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_03f03727_1:

    # "She likes to cover them with a copious amount of cinnamon, too, so they taste faintly tangy, and the apples ladled on top of the pancakes are soft and mushy and stewed in sugar."
    "她还喜欢撒上大量肉桂粉，吃起来带一点辛香；浇在饼上的苹果则用糖炖得软软烂烂。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:399
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_942a7ba5_1:

    # "I chew on my pancakes happily, some of my former fatigue melting away, while my mother regards me from across the table."
    "我心满意足地嚼着煎饼，先前的疲惫也慢慢消散了些。妈妈坐在桌子对面，看着我。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:408
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6b11eebb_1:

    # Elowen "By the way, dear, a letter arrived for you this morning. Do you want to take a look at it?"
    Elowen "对了，宝贝，今天早上收到一封你的信。要看看吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:410
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c06f78a7_2:

    # Nienke "What letter?"
    Nienke "什么信？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:412
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_00fa4c2e_1:

    # "Well. I’m asking, but I’m pretty sure I know who it is already. There’s only one person who writes to me."
    "虽然这么问，但我心里已经有数了。会给我写信的，只有一个人。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:413
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_023ffcbf_1:

    # Elowen "I think it’s from Cornelia. Her name’s not on the envelope, but I recognise her handwriting."
    Elowen "应该是科妮莉娅寄来的。信封上没写名字，不过我认得她的字迹。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:414
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_4f8604f8_1:

    # Elowen "It’s very loopy, and she’s still dotting her Is with hearts."
    Elowen "弯弯绕绕的，连字母 i 上面的小点都还画成爱心呢。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:415
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6156cb92_1:

    # Elowen "Do you want to wait until you’ve finished with your breakfast, or should I hand it over right now?"
    Elowen "你是想吃完早饭再看，还是我现在就给你？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:417
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ef9415da_1:

    # Nienke "Oh, it’s fine. I’ll read it now, if you don’t mind...?"
    Nienke "啊，没关系。我现在就看，可以吗……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:418
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d1fe2b5e_1:

    # Emiel "Oh, you girls!"
    Emiel "哎呀，你们这些女孩子！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:419
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6594e7b0_1:

    # "My father chuckles as I accept the envelope from my mother."
    "我从妈妈手里接过信封，爸爸笑了起来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:420
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d8f4979e_1:

    # Emiel "You two are like conjoined twins. Even now, with Cornelia all the way in Utrecht, you still prioritise her over everything."
    Emiel "你们俩简直像连体婴。科妮莉娅都远在乌得勒支了，你还是把她的事放在第一位。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:421
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_74f47e8c_1:

    # Emiel "You might as well be joined at the hip!"
    Emiel "真是恨不得长在一起！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:423
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_56ed99b7_1:

    # "I know my father’s just joking, but sometimes, it really does feel like it. Cornelia always was my best friend, and she might have been more to me than just that."
    "我知道爸爸只是在开玩笑，可有时候，确实有那种感觉。科妮莉娅一直是我最好的朋友，对我而言，也许还不止如此。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:424
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b64d75a2_1:

    # "At times, she felt like my sister: my scrappy older sister who stood up for me when the mean boys back in primary school tried to throw my book bag into the fountain, or they made fun of my pointed ears."
    "有时，她更像我的姐姐。一个好强、不服输的姐姐。小学里那些坏男孩想把我的书包扔进喷泉，或是取笑我的尖耳朵时，她都会挺身而出。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:425
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e4414ec2_1:

    # "Nobody else seemed to care what happened to me — not my classmates, nor even any of my teachers, who seemed to find me a handful — but Cornelia did."
    "其他人似乎根本不在乎我遭遇了什么。同学不在乎，连老师都觉得我是个麻烦。可科妮莉娅在乎。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:426
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_fe2d045f_1:

    # "She always came to my defence."
    "她总会站出来维护我。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:427
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_213d2f17_1:

    # "She protected me like nobody else did..."
    "她给了我别人从未给过的保护……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:432
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_eaa2d723_1:

    # "Or did she?"
    "真的是这样吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:434
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ac62e30a_1:

    # "Once again, I’m reminded of my dream. A fragment of it, clear and sparkling like broken glass, flickers across the forefront of my memory..."
    "那个梦又浮上心头。一片清亮的梦境碎片，像碎玻璃一样，在记忆最前方闪了一下……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:436
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_cadfd2cc_1:

    # "But I try to push it to one side."
    "可我努力把它抛到一边。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:437
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_39f77305_1:

    # "There’s no point ruminating over my dreams now, not when I have a letter from Cornelia to read."
    "现在可不是琢磨梦境的时候。科妮莉娅的信还等着我看呢。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:439
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ae654bf0_1:

    # "Her letters are few and far between now, but her handwriting is unique, like my mother said, and I recognise it at once."
    "她如今寄信的次数越来越少了。不过，就像妈妈说的，她的字迹很有特点，我一眼就认得出来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:443
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f48b8709_1:

    # "Her letters sway to one side, almost like drunken sailors, and she makes her Os and Es especially round."
    "那些字母东倒西歪，像喝醉的水手，而 O 和 E 又写得特别圆。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:444
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_79570962_1:

    # "She has a habit, too, of dotting her lowercase Is with hearts: something which used to annoy our old teachers."
    "她还有个习惯，喜欢把小写 i 上面的点画成爱心。以前的老师们常常为此生气。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:445
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8a181a57_1:

    # "Cornelia was forever being rebuked for her writing practices — “You always prioritise style over substance. That is so like you, Cornelia van der Berg!” — but she’s stubborn, and these regular scoldings were never enough to make her stop."
    "她老是因为写字的问题挨训——“只顾好看，不顾内容。科妮莉娅·范德贝格，这可太像你了！”——可她性子倔得很，骂多少次也没用。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:446
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6aec7042_1:

    # "Cornelia’s been at university for two years now — well, almost two years — and it looks like she still hasn’t kicked her bad habits."
    "科妮莉娅上大学已经两年了——嗯，差不多两年——看来这坏习惯还是没改。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:448
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d764bdb2_1:

    # "She’s addressed the letter to me — {i}My dear Nienke Faber,{/i} it says, the I in my name decorated with Cornelia’s customary heart — and the sight of it is enough to make me smile."
    "信是写给我的。开头是{i}亲爱的妮恩克·法贝尔：{/i}，我名字里的 i 上，一如既往地画着一颗爱心。光是看见这行字，就足以让我微笑起来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:449
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6873c200_1:

    # "I might not have seen Cornelia in months, but it doesn’t look like she’s changed all that much after all."
    "虽然好几个月没见，科妮莉娅看来还是没怎么变。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:451
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2c830815_1:

    # "I slice the envelope open eagerly, then remove the paper from the envelope."
    "我迫不及待地拆开信封，抽出里面的信纸。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:464
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_09d2064c_1:

    # "The envelope itself is uninteresting: a plain, workmanlike brown. The letter itself, however, is more decorative, since Cornelia has covered it in stickers."
    "信封没什么特别，就是朴素实用的棕色。信纸可就花哨多了，科妮莉娅在上面贴满了贴纸。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:465
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_908f77ac_1:

    # "Cornelia’s a pretty big fan of stickers. She’s collected them for years, ever since she was a kid, and she has a huge binder full of her favourites."
    "科妮莉娅特别喜欢贴纸，从小就开始收集。她有一本厚厚的收藏册，里面全是她的心头好。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:466
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c19ee55e_1:

    # "Cornelia left a bunch of her old things in Alpenrose when she moved to Utrecht for university — old clothes, her old journals, and her old toys — but she did wind up bringing her hefty sticker collection along with her."
    "去乌得勒支上大学时，她把不少旧东西都留在了阿尔彭罗瑟——旧衣服、旧日记、旧玩具——却还是把那一大本沉甸甸的贴纸带走了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:467
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_54e4af79_1:

    # "She’s decorated every single letter she’s sent me from university with a wide variety of stickers: some holographic, others glittery, yet more elaborate and artistic."
    "她从大学寄给我的每一封信，都贴着各式各样的贴纸：有镭射的，有闪亮亮的，也有精细得像幅小画的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:468
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ec1367f8_1:

    # "Some of her stickers feature flowers, others birds, and she has a lot of old-fashioned Victorian stickers with gothic angels and little girls wearing ruched pinafores."
    "有的画着花，有的画着鸟。她还有许多维多利亚风格的复古贴纸，上面是哥特风的天使，或是穿着褶边围裙的小女孩。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:469
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7b57e168_1:

    # "She has stickers depicting food items, shapes and symbols, and all sorts of animals, though her favourite are nautical-themed: seashells, lighthouses, starfish, and the like."
    "食物、图案、符号，各种动物，她都收集。不过最喜欢的还是海洋主题：贝壳、灯塔、海星之类的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:470
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a93621b0_1:

    # "Cornelia has decorated this particular letter with a slew of stickers: mostly fluffy rabbits and red ribbons."
    "这封信上也贴了不少，主要是毛茸茸的兔子和红丝带。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:471
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a70aa9e1_1:

    # "Her handwriting, meanwhile, is as round and welcoming as ever."
    "而她的字迹，还是那么圆润，看着就让人亲切。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:472
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_41a24bad_1:

    # "In her letter, she tells me what she’s been doing at university lately: about her recent trip to Bredeorde Castle, and her plans to go camping once the term ends with her new friends."
    "信里，她告诉我最近在大学都做了些什么：前不久去了布雷德奥德城堡，打算学期结束后和新朋友一起露营。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:473
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5ca61069_1:

    # "She sounds very excited about it all: so much so that, if she was relaying all of this to me in person, I’m sure she’d be stumbling across her own words."
    "她听起来兴奋极了。如果是当面讲给我听，恐怕连话都要说不利索。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:474
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_74cd21a5_1:

    # "It’s a little hard to get one’s tone of voice across during a letter since it’s a purely written form of communication, but Cornelia manages it."
    "书信毕竟只有文字，想把说话时的语气也传达出来并不容易，可科妮莉娅做到了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:475
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_667f7c87_1:

    # "Cornelia’s excitement practically radiates from the page. It’s visible in the way her words start to slant together; in the ways her Os and Es become steadily more cramped as her hand hurries along the page to get all of her thoughts out."
    "她的兴奋简直要从纸上冒出来。字越写越歪，挤在一起，O 和 E 也越缩越小——仿佛手里的笔在纸上飞跑，生怕来不及把满脑子的想法写下来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:476
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_23cef213_1:

    # "Her letter is pretty short, and it totals to about 5 brief, breathless paragraphs."
    "信不算长，只有五个简短的段落，读起来却像听她一口气说完，连气都顾不上喘。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:480
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_3a087350_1:

    # "I’m relieved, of course, that Cornelia’s enjoying herself, but I feel strangely bereft when I’ve finished reading it."
    "她过得开心，我当然放心。可读完信，心里却莫名地空了一块。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:481
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_169f944e_1:

    # "It’s nice of Cornelia to write to me, of course, and I do appreciate that she’s thinking about me."
    "她愿意写信给我，自然是好事。她还惦记着我，我也很感激。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:482
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_761490e6_1:

    # "All of the stickers are a cute touch, and I even recognise a few of them. I know that orange and white striped clownfish by the bottom, where she’s signed off her name, is one of her favourites from her whole collection."
    "那些贴纸都很可爱，其中几张我还认得。比如署名旁、信纸底部那条橙白相间的小丑鱼，就是她整本收藏里最喜欢的贴纸之一。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:483
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c8c7d88b_1:

    # "I feel flattered she spared Bubble on me, and I know I’ll take good care of her letter. I already have plans to take it up to my room later, to lay it down in my velvet-lined box full of Cornelia’s past correspondences..."
    "她竟然舍得把“泡泡”送给我，真让我受宠若惊。这封信我一定会好好保存。我已经想好了，待会儿就带回房间，放进那只铺着绒布、装满科妮莉娅旧信的盒子里……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:487
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ba390728_1:

    # "But right now, it’s hard to feel too happy for her."
    "可现在，我却很难真心替她高兴起来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:488
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6734b11b_1:

    # "I can’t rid this nagging, persistent feeling of jealousy that’s eating away at me."
    "那股挥之不去的嫉妒，一点点啃噬着我，怎么也甩不掉。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:489
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7dd49de4_1:

    # "I did worry, in the beginning, if Cornelia would settle into university at all: especially when she was so hesitant about leaving Alpenrose behind."
    "最初，我确实担心她能不能适应大学生活。尤其是，她当时那么舍不得离开阿尔彭罗瑟。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:490
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a8525370_1:

    # "We had a lot of sleepovers before the date of her departure, where Cornelia would worry whether she was making the right decision, and if she could really bear to leave this village behind."
    "临走前，我们经常在彼此家里过夜。她总担心自己是不是做错了决定，是不是真的舍得离开这个村子。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:502
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d10ab441_1:

    # Cornelia "{i}I know it’s small, and there’s not very much here, but it’s where I grew up. This place will always be my home — and it’s where you live, too.{/i}"
    Cornelia "{i}这里是很小，也没什么东西，可我是在这里长大的。这里永远是我的家——而且，你也住在这里呀。{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:503
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_fcfac0f4_1:

    # Cornelia "{i}You’re still my best friend, Niene, no matter what, and I don’t want to leave you. I’ll miss you a lot!{/i}"
    Cornelia "{i}不管怎样，你都是我最好的朋友，妮妮。我不想丢下你，我一定会很想你的！{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:504
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8099a677_1:

    # "That’s what Cornelia said, and I don’t think she was lying to me: not intentionally, at least."
    "科妮莉娅当时就是这么说的。我不觉得她在骗我，至少，她不是有意骗我。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:505
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c97863cd_1:

    # "I’m sure she was genuinely uneasy about leaving in the beginning — and it came across in her letters, too."
    "一开始，她肯定真的很不安。连寄来的信里，都看得出来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:511
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_df76c6b1_1:

    # "The first few letters she wrote to me last September, when she’d first enrolled at university, were rather hesitant."
    "去年九月，刚入学时寄来的头几封信，字里行间都透着犹豫。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:512
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5f52dfdd_1:

    # "She sounded unusually concerned and unsure of herself: afraid that she wouldn’t be able to fit in at university, or that she wouldn’t be able to make any new friends."
    "她少有地变得忧心忡忡，对自己没什么把握，害怕适应不了大学，害怕交不到新朋友。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:513
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_903110d7_1:

    # "Alpenrose is a teeny-tiny village which borders Belgium, and its population is little more than 2,000."
    "阿尔彭罗瑟是个挨着比利时边境的小村庄，人口不过两千出头。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:514
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_22bfda7d_1:

    # "It’s a quaint village, and it’s quite pretty: decidedly old-fashioned, with its cobblestoned streets and pastel houses."
    "村子古朴又漂亮，鹅卵石铺的街道，淡彩色的小房子，处处透着老式韵味。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:515
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_12fd0a71_1:

    # "I’m fond of it, but it must be hard to get accustomed to life in a city like Utrecht after living in Alpenrose for so long."
    "我很喜欢这里。不过，在阿尔彭罗瑟住了那么久，要适应乌得勒支那样的城市，想必很不容易。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:516
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_4c25c6d5_1:

    # "I could tell that Cornelia was struggling in the beginning, so I tried to support her."
    "我看得出她起初过得很艰难，便努力支持她。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:517
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6f34165f_1:

    # "I took my time to reply to every single one of her letters. I wrote lengthy missives about how strong she was, and how determined, and how I was sure she would be able to overcome any challenges."
    "她每寄来一封信，我都会认真回复。我写下长长的信，告诉她，她有多坚强、多有毅力，我相信她一定能克服任何困难。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:518
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d84fdd58_1:

    # "{i}It’ll be alright, Ceejse,{/i} I told her. {i}You’re a nice person, and you’re a lot of fun to talk to. You just need to be yourself. I’m sure you’ll be able to make a lot of friends in time!{/i}"
    "我告诉她：{i}会没事的，小茜。{/i}{i}你这么好，和你聊天又这么开心，只要做你自己就好。慢慢来，你一定能交到很多朋友的！{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:519
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2516a140_1:

    # "I did my best to reassure her — though admittedly, part of me (quite a big part, actually) couldn’t help but be jealous."
    "我尽力安慰她——不过得承认，心里总有一部分——其实，是挺大的一部分——忍不住嫉妒。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:520
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f98b81d9_1:

    # "I wanted to go to university too, just like Cornelia, so I could live away from my parents..."
    "我也想和她一样去读大学，离开父母，独自生活……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:521
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6f711181_1:

    # "But that never happened. My father had his accident, and they needed my help to run the café — and anyway, I’m not sure if my parents would want me to go too far afield. They’ve always been pretty protective."
    "可最后没能如愿。爸爸出了意外，他们需要我帮忙照看咖啡馆。而且，就算没有那场意外，爸妈愿不愿意让我走那么远，也很难说。他们一直把我护得很紧。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:522
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9d5f0b7a_1:

    # "I tried to live vicariously through Cornelia’s weekly letters, devouring her tales about classes and her new friends and all of her professors..."
    "我试着从她每周寄来的信里，借一点她的生活。关于课堂、新朋友和教授们的故事，我读得如饥似渴……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:524
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_404ed2ea_1:

    # "But Cornelia eventually began to settle in, and when she did, her letters dwindled."
    "可她终于适应了大学生活以后，寄来的信也渐渐少了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:525
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_3b87ca1d_1:

    # "She stopped writing as often as she did. Sometimes, she would go a full month without writing to me, and her letters became shorter as time wore on."
    "她不再那么频繁地写信。有时整整一个月都没有消息，信的篇幅也越来越短。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:526
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_08ea594f_1:

    # "I used to look forward to Cornelia’s letters, but I feel a little less enthused about them now."
    "以前我总是盼着她的信，可如今，那份期待已经淡了些。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:528
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_475e9322_1:

    # "Her letters have become very perfunctory, and she’s been using a lot of paper talking about her new best friend: some dark-haired, dark-eyed girl called Esche, who doesn’t sound anything like me."
    "她的信变得很敷衍，却花了许多篇幅讲她新交的好朋友：一个黑发黑眼的女孩，叫埃舍，听起来和我一点也不像。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:529
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8015860b_1:

    # "It’s nice that Cornelia’s having fun, and I do wish her the best..."
    "科妮莉娅过得快乐是好事，我也希望她一切都好……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:531
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_bced0e70_1:

    # "But I think I found Cornelia’s letters more enjoyable shortly after she had moved to Utrecht, when she was still trying to gather her bearings and she didn’t know anybody."
    "可是，她刚搬去乌得勒支，人生地不熟、还在摸索怎么生活的时候，那些信似乎更让我喜欢。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:532
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c5788bb8_1:

    # "It’s been almost two years now, however, and I’m afraid that Cornelia has moved on."
    "如今，快两年了。恐怕科妮莉娅已经走向了新生活。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:533
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_caa1c7ab_1:

    # "She has her new friends now, and she seems to be enjoying her time at university. I’m worried she’s enjoying it more than she ever enjoyed talking to me."
    "她有了新朋友，也很享受大学生活。我害怕，那比以前和我聊天更让她开心。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:534
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_74194231_1:

    # "I wish I could join Cornelia in Utrecht, but what would be the point?"
    "我也想去乌得勒支陪她，可去了又有什么意义？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:535
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_3d7afb0d_1:

    # "She’s already moved ahead with her life, and I’m afraid I can’t catch up now."
    "她的人生已经往前走了，恐怕我现在再也追不上。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:536
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ce66f186_1:

    # "While Cornelia is in Utrecht, studying ancient history, I’m here in Alpenrose, stuck squarely in the present."
    "科妮莉娅在乌得勒支研究古代历史，我却在阿尔彭罗瑟，困在一成不变的当下。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:548
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_cb6ac12a_1:

    # "I still live in my parents’ home. I sleep in the same bed I have since I was a young girl, in the same room which is painted soft, gentle pastels: baby blues and precious pinks."
    "我还住在父母家，睡在从小睡到大的床上，守着同一间刷成浅蓝和粉红、柔柔淡淡的房间。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:549
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c09a794e_1:

    # "I wake up early, as I always did when I attended the lyceum, and I eat breakfast with my parents: my mother’s apple pancakes, or my father’s ham and mushroom omelettes."
    "我仍像上高中时一样早起，和爸妈一起吃早餐，吃妈妈的苹果煎饼，或是爸爸的火腿蘑菇蛋饼。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:550
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_75e24ef6_1:

    # "I help my parents with the chores, and I help my parents at the café. I spend most of my days at Fleur de Lys, working — apart from Sundays, that is, because the café’s closed then."
    "我帮爸妈做家务，也帮他们照看咖啡馆。大部分日子都在百合花工作——除了周日，因为那天店里休息。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:552
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9eea713b_1:

    # "I’m still living in the same old village I was as a young girl, stuck doing the same things. It almost feels like I’m trapped in some sort of time loop."
    "我还住在小时候那个村子，反复做着同样的事。有时简直觉得，自己被困进了某种时间循环。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:553
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_785755bd_1:

    # "I love both of my parents, but living with them feels stifling. I’m already twenty, and I would like a bit more freedom."
    "我爱爸爸妈妈，可一直和他们住在一起，让我喘不过气。我已经二十岁了，也想多一点自由。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:555
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_0f3837da_1:

    # "I wish I had what Cornelia has..."
    "我希望自己也能拥有科妮莉娅拥有的一切……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:556
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6a3b3097_1:

    # "But I know from experience that wishing won’t make anything come true."
    "可经历早就告诉我，光是希望，什么也实现不了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:557
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_687abde7_1:

    # "I can’t have what I want simply by yearning for it. I don’t live in a fairytale."
    "不是足够渴望，就能得到想要的东西。我又不是活在童话里。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:559
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8d8d5bc4_1:

    # "I sigh, then set Cornelia’s letter aside."
    "我叹了口气，把科妮莉娅的信放到一边。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:560
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_738e9897_1:

    # "Usually, I reread her letters thrice over, but this time, I’m not in the mood to take in her cheery remarks about how much fun she’s having, and how wonderful Esche is, and what her plans are for the summer."
    "平时，她的信我至少要反复读三遍。这次却实在没心情，看她兴高采烈地讲自己过得多开心、埃舍多好、暑假又有什么安排。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:562
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_13f44573_1:

    # "I’m just going to make myself miserable — or more miserable than I am already."
    "只会让自己难受——或者说，比现在更难受。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:564
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6c48a6de_1:

    # "I turn my attention to my breakfast, meaning to swallow another mouthful of apple pancake, when..."
    "我重新把注意力放回早餐，正想再吃一口苹果煎饼，就听见……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:568
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f0fec42f_1:

    # Elowen "Oh, and that’s not all, Nienke! We had another letter in the post too!"
    Elowen "啊，对了，妮恩克！还不止这一封呢，我们还收到了一封信！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:570
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f7d1c6b0_2:

    # Nienke "Oh...?"
    Nienke "咦……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:571
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_588852b6_1:

    # "Now, that’s a surprise."
    "这倒真让我意外。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:573
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c06f78a7_3:

    # Nienke "What letter?"
    Nienke "什么信？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:582
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_80e3c087_1:

    # "We don’t get all that many letters here, other than my (ever-more infrequent) correspondences from Cornelia, and the odd water bill."
    "除了科妮莉娅寄来的——而且越来越少的——信，和偶尔几张水费账单，我们平时收不到多少信件。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:583
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8f3335cc_1:

    # "My parents largely keep to themselves, and I suppose I’ve followed suit. I’m not the most social of people in general, and I didn’t have any friends at the lyceum other than Cornelia."
    "爸妈很少和人来往，我大概也随了他们。本来就不擅长交际，高中时除了科妮莉娅，也没有别的朋友。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:584
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_49347ae0_1:

    # "I can’t imagine anybody else who would be writing to us save for her. I don’t have any other friends."
    "我想不出，除了她，还有谁会给我们写信。我又没有其他朋友。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:585
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8bfbb09c_1:

    # "It seems more likely my mother’s holding a bill in her hands, then — but if that is a bill, why bother announcing it to me?"
    "所以，妈妈拿着的多半是账单吧？可如果只是账单，为什么还要特地告诉我？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:594
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ee2c6626_1:

    # Elowen "This letter is from the Asphodels, dear: Marieke Asphodel specifically."
    Elowen "宝贝，是阿斯福德尔家寄来的。准确地说，是玛丽克·阿斯福德尔寄的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:596
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c0d0192e_1:

    # Elowen "You remember Marieke, don’t you?"
    Elowen "你还记得玛丽克吧？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:597
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_02377a80_1:

    # Emiel "And Bastian! He’s a real stand-up chap. We used to go on a lot of trips back in the day, to look up at the stars."
    Emiel "还有巴斯蒂安！他可是个大好人。以前，我们经常一起出去看星星。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:599
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f90bc461_1:

    # Emiel "He was only an amateur astronomer, mind, but I’ve not met anybody before or since who knows more about the stars than he does."
    Emiel "虽然只是业余天文爱好者，可论起对星星的了解，我从前到现在都没见过谁比得上他。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:600
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_acf6b026_1:

    # Emiel "I always used to joke about it. I called him a bastion of knowledge, haha. Do you get it?"
    Emiel "我以前总拿他开玩笑，说他是知识的“巴士”，满肚子都是学问，哈哈。懂了吧？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:601
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6c68b7d7_1:

    # Elowen "Yes, yes, dear. I get it, and I’m sure that Nienke does as well. You have made that joke at least one hundred times."
    Elowen "懂了，懂了，亲爱的。妮恩克肯定也懂了。这个笑话你至少讲过一百次了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:603
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c026bade_1:

    # Emiel "What? Oh, c’mon, Elowen! You have to admit, it’s funny! It’s one of my better puns!"
    Emiel "什么？哎呀，艾洛温！你得承认，这确实挺好笑吧？这可是我比较拿得出手的谐音笑话了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:604
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d2462659_1:

    # Elowen "Which says more than you might think about the quality of your usual jokes..."
    Elowen "这倒让我更不敢恭维你平时那些笑话了……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:605
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b968f5bb_1:

    # "My mother shudders, then looks back at me."
    "妈妈打了个寒战，又看向我。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:606
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_76caa5f9_1:

    # Elowen "Don’t those names sound familiar, dear? You do remember the Asphodels, don’t you — and their daughter, Merel?"
    Elowen "宝贝，这些名字听着不耳熟吗？阿斯福德尔一家，还有他们的女儿梅蕾尔，你总还记得吧？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:607
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_96f6546e_1:

    # Elowen "The two of you used to be quite close! You used to play together all the time!"
    Elowen "你们两个以前可亲了，整天一起玩！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:609
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9ded9125_1:

    # Nienke "We did...?"
    Nienke "是吗……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:610
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_43e69e62_1:

    # Emiel "Yes, you did. You were always together, like a couple of twins. You used to get so pouty when I told you to stop playing with Merel and come in for your dinner!"
    Emiel "是啊，形影不离，像对双胞胎。每次叫你别玩了，和梅蕾尔道别回来吃饭，你都要不高兴！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:611
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_533459a8_1:

    # Elowen "Oh, she did, didn’t she? She always used to jut out her lower lip, hehe. I thought it was quite cute."
    Elowen "可不是嘛！小嘴总撅得老高，呵呵。我倒觉得挺可爱。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:612
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8f244f6f_1:

    # Elowen "It was definitely more charming than when you do it, dear."
    Elowen "至少，比你撅嘴的时候可爱多了，亲爱的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:613
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_40de4940_1:

    # Emiel "Eh? And what’s wrong with the way I look, Elowen?"
    Emiel "咦？艾洛温，我那样有什么问题？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:614
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7d4afe00_1:

    # Elowen "Oh, let me count the ways..."
    Elowen "哎呀，那可得慢慢数了……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:616
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_721df331_1:

    # "My parents begin to chatter amongst themselves, their voices light and irreverent, cheery pitter-patter, while I frown."
    "爸妈你一句我一句地打趣，轻轻快快，笑语不断。我却皱着眉头。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:617
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e7a4e641_1:

    # "My parents are talking about these so-called Asphodels as though it’s a matter of course that I would know them, but I can’t picture them."
    "他们提起这所谓的阿斯福德尔一家，仿佛我理所当然应该认识。可我脑海里完全浮不出他们的模样。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:619
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_dc19c8d8_1:

    # "I have no idea who Marieke and Bastian are, much less this Merel."
    "玛丽克和巴斯蒂安是谁，我一无所知。梅蕾尔就更不用说了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:621
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2bf1cb01_1:

    # Nienke "Are you sure I used to know this family...?"
    Nienke "你们确定，我以前认识这一家人……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:622
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8835819f_1:

    # Elowen "Of course I am, dear. They’re good friends of ours. You’ve met them before yourself, though this would have been..."
    Elowen "当然了，宝贝。他们是我们的好朋友。你也见过的，不过，那已经是……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:623
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_24153b60_1:

    # Elowen "Hmm. How long ago was it, dear?"
    Elowen "唔，多久以前了，亲爱的？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:624
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ab5c9be7_1:

    # Emiel "I think it would have been about fifteen — no, sixteen years ago now, darling."
    Emiel "我想有十五——不，十六年了吧，亲爱的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:625
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5fbf4cb2_1:

    # Elowen "Ah, yes! That sounds about right!"
    Elowen "啊，对！差不多就是那个时候！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:626
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ac19268f_1:

    # Elowen "You definitely know them, dear. I know you were a very little girl back then, but doesn’t the name ring any bells?"
    Elowen "你肯定认识他们，宝贝。我知道你那时很小，可听到名字，就一点印象也没有吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:628
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2dd9e02a_1:

    # Nienke "Hmm..."
    Nienke "嗯……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:629
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7d26292e_1:

    # "The name Asphodel does sound vaguely familiar, I guess, but..."
    "阿斯福德尔这个姓，好像是有那么一点耳熟，可……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:631
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5c5352a5_1:

    # Nienke "...Sorry, but I don’t remember. If I last saw them sixteen years ago, I’d have been four or five during our last meeting, I guess...?"
    Nienke "……抱歉，我不记得了。如果上次见他们已经是十六年前，那时我才四五岁吧……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:632
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6c7cd224_1:

    # Elowen "Yes, that’s right!"
    Elowen "没错！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:634
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ae4f7f87_1:

    # Nienke "Then it’s no wonder I can’t remember. That’s much too long ago — and anyway, I can’t recall a lot from before we moved to Alpenrose anyway."
    Nienke "那我不记得也很正常。这都过去多久了。而且，搬来阿尔彭罗瑟之前的事，我本来就记不清。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:635
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_63a075f2_1:

    # Nienke "Meeting the Asphodels might well have happened in a different reality."
    Nienke "认识阿斯福德尔一家这件事，对我来说简直像发生在另一个世界。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:636
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5418fa03_1:

    # Emiel "Well, maybe it did. Our world was very different back then. Our lives have altered a good deal since those dark days."
    Emiel "嗯，也许确实如此。那时的世界和现在很不一样。熬过那段艰难的日子后，我们的生活改变了很多。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:637
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1ea4a003_1:

    # Emiel "Perhaps it’s for the best if you don’t really remember, dear. You were sick for a long time, after all."
    Emiel "宝贝，想不起来也许反倒是好事。毕竟，你那时病了那么久。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:639
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f5024bef_1:

    # Nienke "...Right."
    Nienke "……嗯。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:641
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f6f32a8b_1:

    # "That’s why we moved to Alpenrose in the first place: my sickness."
    "我们当初就是因为我生病，才搬来阿尔彭罗瑟的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:649
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f2797259_1:

    # "This was such a long time ago, I don’t remember much about that, either — and my parents don’t really like talking about it. I think it upsets them."
    "那已经是很久以前的事，我也没多少记忆。爸妈又不喜欢谈起，似乎一提就会难过。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:650
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2aebc4ec_1:

    # "I can scarcely recall anything from before my fifth birthday, before the move to Alpenrose, and I think my mysterious, semi-remembered sickness is to blame."
    "五岁之前，也就是搬来这里之前的事，我几乎什么都想不起来。我想，这都怪那场连记忆都模糊不清的怪病。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:651
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8f1236d5_1:

    # "I have vague memories of lying in a bed, my face flushed and my brow damp with sweat. I can remember shivering, my teeth chattering together, though my skin was sweat-slick and I was uncomfortably hot."
    "我隐约记得，自己躺在床上，脸颊烧得通红，额头全是汗。明明热得难受，浑身汗湿，却仍不停发抖，牙齿打战。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:652
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c8e3d6ba_1:

    # "I was so sick, the physicians my parents summoned worried I wasn’t long for this world. They all thought that my days were numbered, and I was doomed to wither away and die..."
    "我病得太重，爸妈请来的医生都担心我活不久了。他们觉得我时日无多，只会一天天衰弱下去，直到死去……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:653
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_3a61f4ab_1:

    # "But I defied everybody’s expectations."
    "可我出乎了所有人的意料。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:654
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_37ba10a7_1:

    # "I was able to make a full recovery: one which bordered on the miraculous."
    "我彻底康复了，几乎可以说是个奇迹。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:655
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_eb5da92d_1:

    # "I overcame my infirmity, and now I’m as hale and healthy as any elf..."
    "我熬过了那场病，如今和任何精灵一样健康……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:656
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_09044a9f_1:

    # "Though that might be a bit of an exaggeration. I seem to catch every illness available when the weather shifts, and the sky turns steely grey."
    "不过，这么说可能有点夸张。天气一变，天空转成铁灰色，我好像什么病都能轮流得一遍。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:657
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b9863676_1:

    # "I’ve missed a lot of school holed up in my bed, shivering..."
    "我曾因为缩在床上发抖，缺过不少课……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:658
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c81b7275_1:

    # "But I’ve not had any near brushes with death since then."
    "但那以后，至少再没有险些丧命。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:659
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_00c76fcf_1:

    # "I was able to make a full recovery (well, more or less), but I didn’t emerge wholly unscathed. I didn’t lose my life, but I did lose a lot of my memories before the fever took hold of my brain."
    "我恢复了健康——嗯，差不多吧——却也不是毫发无损。命是保住了，可高烧侵袭头脑之前的许多记忆，却失去了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:660
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b889e5b3_1:

    # "It feels like all of my memories were seared away, like old photographs in a fire. They’re charred at the edges, and when I try to pick at them, they crumble away into ashes."
    "那些记忆仿佛被烧过，像丢进火里的旧照片，边缘焦黑。一伸手去碰，便碎成灰烬。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:661
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8aa87772_1:

    # "I’ve long since learned there’s no point trying to probe my mind for any long-forgotten memories. Any attempts to do so only make my head hurt."
    "很早以前我就明白，拼命搜寻那些遗忘的记忆，也没有意义。试来试去，只会头疼。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:662
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_61b86398_1:

    # "I’ve never been able to glean any more information about my life before Alpenrose, and my parents don’t really like talking about it."
    "来到阿尔彭罗瑟之前，我究竟过着什么样的生活，我始终没能多知道一点，爸妈也不愿谈。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:663
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_43c4ced5_1:

    # "I know they regard my sickness as one of the worst things which ever happened to them. I think it upset them even more than it did me, because I was so weak I was barely aware of what was happening to me."
    "我知道，那场病是他们人生中最痛苦的遭遇之一。或许他们比我还难受。毕竟，那时的我虚弱得几乎不知道自己身上发生了什么。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:671
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e2224771_1:

    # "My life before my sickness is something of a mystery. My parents haven’t told me much about my childhood either: maybe because they’re worried about upsetting me."
    "生病前的人生像个谜。爸妈也很少告诉我小时候的事，也许是担心让我难过。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:672
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6b948b1b_1:

    # "It’s unexpected, therefore, to hear my parents talking about my childhood at all, and the days before we moved to Alpenrose."
    "所以，忽然听到他们谈起我的童年，谈起搬来这里之前的日子，实在很意外。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:674
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8fb029b6_1:

    # "I’d like to recall at least a scrap of this so-called Asphodel family, but..."
    "我也想努力记起一点阿斯福德尔一家的事，可……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:675
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e91d0f4f_1:

    # Elowen "Well, not to worry. It’s fine if you can’t remember. Nobody expects you to recall events which occurred when you were a small child, dear. You really were little at the time."
    Elowen "好了，别着急。想不起来也没关系，宝贝。没人指望你连那么小的时候发生的事都记得。你那时真的太小了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:676
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_00f9f8d9_1:

    # Elowen "Why, your father often struggles to remember things which happened only last week!"
    Elowen "你爸爸连上星期的事，都经常想不起来呢！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:678
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_86a34e58_1:

    # Emiel "Hey! I resent that, Elowen! What did I do to deserve that?"
    Emiel "喂！艾洛温，这我可不服！我又怎么得罪你了？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:680
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_0f0151ef_1:

    # Elowen "You know what you did, dear..."
    Elowen "亲爱的，你自己做过什么，心里清楚……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:681
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5bfa1509_1:

    # Elowen "Or, at least, you {i}should,{/i} provided you haven’t forgotten!"
    Elowen "至少，你{i}应该{/i}清楚，前提是你还没忘！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:682
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_92e11256_1:

    # Elowen "You really do have an awful memory. You’re always leaving your glasses around the house. Don’t you remember that I found them in the pantry that one time?"
    Elowen "你这记性实在太差了，眼镜总是到处乱丢。还记得吗？有一回我竟然在食品储藏室里找到了它！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:683
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d9785e2a_1:

    # Nienke "What were Dad’s glasses doing in the pantry?"
    Nienke "爸爸的眼镜怎么会在储藏室里？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:684
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a9e55d96_1:

    # Elowen "That’s a very good question! I’d like to know that myself, but your father doesn’t seem to know."
    Elowen "问得好！我也很想知道，可你爸爸自己好像都不知道。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:685
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_50704181_1:

    # Emiel "Well, you know how it is. I’m a busy man, Elowen. I can’t be expected to remember everything!"
    Emiel "唉，你也知道，艾洛温，我忙得很，总不能指望我什么都记得！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:686
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_bf5c43e4_1:

    # Elowen "You always say that."
    Elowen "你每次都这么说。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:688
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_05a63f29_1:

    # Elowen "I swear, you’d lose your own head if it wasn’t attached so firmly to your neck."
    Elowen "我看哪，要不是脑袋牢牢长在脖子上，你连脑袋都能弄丢。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:689
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2bc309c5_1:

    # Elowen "Nienke was such a nice, agreeable child, I hardly ever had to worry about her—"
    Elowen "妮恩克小时候那么乖，那么听话，几乎没让我操过心——"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:691
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9bb2169c_1:

    # "Apart from my near brush with death, I suppose, which left both my mother and my father agonised."
    "除了那次差点死掉吧。那时，他们两个可都急坏了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:692
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a748e12a_1:

    # Elowen "—but I spend much more time fussing about you! I don’t know what you’d do without me!"
    Elowen "——倒是你，让我操的心多得多！没了我，你可怎么办呀！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:694
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_00a27f36_1:

    # Emiel "Well, you’re not the only one. Neither do I."
    Emiel "嗯，你不知道，我也不知道。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:695
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_155b3800_1:

    # Emiel "That’s why I married you, Elowen. I couldn’t imagine a life without you."
    Emiel "所以我才娶了你，艾洛温。我根本想象不出，没有你的日子该怎么过。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:696
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d4831b73_1:

    # Elowen "Oh, you!"
    Elowen "哎呀，你这人！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:697
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_81cbfc10_1:

    # "My mother laughs lightly, waving a hand in my father’s direction."
    "妈妈轻轻笑起来，朝爸爸摆了摆手。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:698
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c457b4ec_1:

    # Elowen "You can be such a charmer sometimes, even if you do have the memory of an old man..."
    Elowen "有时候倒真会说好听的。虽然记性差得像个老头……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:699
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_31ee0bbd_1:

    # Emiel "Hey!"
    Emiel "喂！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:700
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6e45ab5d_1:

    # Elowen "But, back to business..."
    Elowen "好了，说正事……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:701
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c86c6373_1:

    # Elowen "I’m sure you’re very curious about the Asphodels, Nienke—"
    Elowen "妮恩克，你肯定很好奇阿斯福德尔一家的事——"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:702
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9a8b796c_1:

    # "Not really, since I can’t remember them, but I choose to keep quiet about that."
    "其实没有。毕竟我根本不记得他们。不过，这话还是不说了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:703
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b3b0ddae_1:

    # Elowen "—but you needn’t wonder for too long. You might not remember them, but perhaps your memory will be jogged when you see Merel."
    Elowen "——但也不用琢磨太久。现在想不起来，等见到梅蕾尔，说不定就能记起来了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:705
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ac61b15f_1:

    # Nienke "What do you mean, when I see her?"
    Nienke "什么叫“等见到她”？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:707
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ceeb849d_1:

    # Elowen "It’s in the letter Marieke sent, dear. She wrote to let us know that Merel will be coming to live with us during the summer holidays."
    Elowen "玛丽克信里写了呀，宝贝。她是来告诉我们，梅蕾尔暑假要来我们家住。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:709
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f7d1c6b0_3:

    # Nienke "Oh...?"
    Nienke "咦……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:710
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1ca27626_1:

    # "I was just about to take a sip of my honey lemon tea, but my mother’s announcement makes me pause."
    "我正准备喝一口蜂蜜柠檬茶，听到妈妈这句话，动作顿住了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:712
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5f953675_1:

    # Nienke "And did they decide this already, without your input?"
    Nienke "他们没问过你们，就已经决定好了？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:713
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_73ceec59_1:

    # Emiel "Well, we have been friends with the Asphodels for many years, and we {i}do{/i} owe them a favour."
    Emiel "嗯，我们和阿斯福德尔一家是多年的朋友，而且{i}确实{/i}欠他们一个人情。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:714
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f14d1363_1:

    # Emiel "They helped us quite a lot, back in the day, so I’ve no qualms with letting young Merel stay here..."
    Emiel "以前，他们帮过我们很多忙。所以，让小梅蕾尔来住，我当然没意见……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:715
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_08d77655_1:

    # Emiel "Though I suppose she won’t be so young anymore!"
    Emiel "不过，她现在应该也不小了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:716
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6e0a8c98_1:

    # Elowen "I presume not."
    Elowen "那是自然。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:717
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a9da8639_1:

    # Elowen "Merel is a few years older than you, Nienke. You both used to play together, when you still lived in Mors Paravail."
    Elowen "妮恩克，梅蕾尔比你大几岁。以前还住在莫尔斯·帕拉维尔时，你们常在一起玩。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:718
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_dd27067d_1:

    # Elowen "She was always getting into some sort of mischief, and she used to drag you along on her little adventures. Do you remember that at all?"
    Elowen "她总在捣蛋，还爱拉着你一起到处探险。这些你还有印象吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:720
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e6660696_1:

    # "I try to rack my mind but, as is always the case when I dwell on my past for too long, my head starts to hurt."
    "我拼命回想，可和每次追忆往事太久时一样，头又开始疼了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:722
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f24f1c5d_1:

    # "No, I don’t remember. There’s a few faint, hazy silhouettes in the corner of my mind, but they don’t form any particular shapes."
    "没有，我想不起来。脑海角落里只有几个浅淡模糊的影子，拼不成任何清晰的模样。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:723
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_08ceef1c_1:

    # "I can’t even begin to imagine what this Merel might look like..."
    "我甚至无法想象，这个梅蕾尔长什么样……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:734
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a8d0c5dd_1:

    # W "{i}...ey! You leave — alone...!{/i}"
    W "{i}……喂！不许……欺负……！{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:735
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f656b65f_1:

    # "Though I think I can remember her voice. There’s a snatch of a memory there, half-formed, but..."
    "不过，她的声音，我好像还记得。那儿藏着一小片不成形的记忆，可……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:749
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_579a00cd_1:

    # Elowen "Well, never mind. I’m sure you’ll remember her when she comes to stay!"
    Elowen "好了，没关系。等她来了，你肯定就能记起她！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:751
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6a767a6d_1:

    # Nienke "So, you’ve already accepted her invitation?"
    Nienke "所以，你们已经答应她要过来的事了？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:752
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_97be6a04_1:

    # Elowen "I’m planning to accept it. I’ve been wondering about dear little Merel..."
    Elowen "我正准备答应。我也一直惦记着亲爱的小梅蕾尔……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:754
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c1954aa6_1:

    # Elowen "Though she was never all that little, come to think of it. She used to tower over you, Nienke, dear!"
    Elowen "不过仔细想想，她从来都不算“小”。宝贝，她以前可比你高多了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:756
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7e01e29f_1:

    # "Well, that’s not a big surprise. A lot of people tower over me."
    "这倒不奇怪。比我高很多的人，多着呢。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:757
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a7b44724_1:

    # "I might be an elf, but I’m not exactly willowy. I have quite short legs, as it happens."
    "虽说我是精灵，可身材一点也不修长。事实上，我的腿还挺短。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:759
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_dc9c07cf_1:

    # "I feel like I don’t fit the common stereotype of an elf that much, even if I do have very long hair."
    "哪怕头发留得很长，我也觉得自己和大家想象中的精灵不怎么一样。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:760
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_bc91203a_1:

    # "I’m busy pondering this as my dad says..."
    "我正想着这些，爸爸开口了……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:761
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_41f739f4_1:

    # Emiel "Do you know where the envelopes are, Elowen, dear? I need to dash off a response."
    Emiel "亲爱的，艾洛温，你知道信封在哪儿吗？我得赶紧回一封信。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:763
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_db49d5b0_1:

    # Elowen "They’ve not moved from the top drawer in the study, dear, which is where they’ve been for the last fifteen years."
    Elowen "一直在书房最上面的抽屉里，亲爱的。十五年来都放在那里，没动过。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:764
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_bee64abd_1:

    # Elowen "You should know I don’t move things around arbitrarily. I believe that everything has its own place: even small, seemingly insignificant things, like envelopes."
    Elowen "你该知道，我从不会无缘无故乱挪东西。我觉得每样东西都该有自己的位置，哪怕只是信封这样不起眼的小东西。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:765
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a277fd11_1:

    # Elowen "How you don’t know this already is beyond me!"
    Elowen "你怎么到现在都还记不住呢！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:766
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_26a46b2e_1:

    # Emiel "Well, I have a lot on my mind. Don’t forget: I’m the one who handles all of the accounts!"
    Emiel "唉，我脑子里要操心的事可多了。别忘了，账可全是我在管！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:767
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7225fe8d_1:

    # Elowen "You do, yes..."
    Elowen "是啊，确实……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:768
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_cafe1711_1:

    # Elowen "And it’s a wonder you can keep on top of that, your memory being what it is."
    Elowen "你这种记性，居然还能把账管好，也真不容易。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:769
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c644a7a3_1:

    # "My mother sighs, then shakes her head."
    "妈妈叹了口气，摇摇头。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:770
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_abad97bb_1:

    # Elowen "Oh well. I can always fetch the stationery for you, if you want it..."
    Elowen "算了。你要的话，我替你把纸笔拿来就是……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:771
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d108e4fd_1:

    # Elowen "Though it might be better if I wrote this letter. It can be quite hard to decipher your writing sometimes..."
    Elowen "不过，还是我来写吧。你的字有时候实在难认……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:772
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_42082d0d_1:

    # Emiel "Hahaha. Well, that’s true. Bastian always did joke that, with handwriting like mine, I could be a doctor!"
    Emiel "哈哈哈，那倒是。巴斯蒂安就老开玩笑，说凭我这手字，当个医生绰绰有余！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:774
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_93623618_1:

    # "My parents chatter away, both of them discussing Merel’s upcoming visit like it’s a given."
    "爸妈聊个不停，说起梅蕾尔要来的事，仿佛已经板上钉钉。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:776
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5dc585bc_1:

    # "I, meanwhile, start to squirm uncomfortably in my seat."
    "而我坐在椅子上，开始不自在地扭动身体。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:777
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_19de20ae_1:

    # "My pancakes sit heavily in my stomach, just like stones."
    "煎饼沉甸甸地坠在胃里，像压了几块石头。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:779
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_db64b567_1:

    # "The knowledge that there are other elves out there is a surprise in and of itself, given I’ve never seen any before: not in Alpenrose, at least."
    "光是知道还有别的精灵存在，就已经让我很吃惊了。毕竟，我从没见过其他精灵，至少在阿尔彭罗瑟没见过。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:780
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d93a4589_1:

    # "I didn’t think that elves were all that common, and now my parents are telling me that I’m about to wind up spending all summer with a forgotten childhood friend?"
    "我一直觉得精灵很少见，现在爸妈却告诉我，我要和一个完全忘记了的儿时好友共度整个暑假？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:782
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e617b8d4_1:

    # "I would ask why they didn’t tell me about the Asphodels sooner, even if they only just received this letter."
    "就算今天才收到这封信，我也很想问，他们为什么不早点告诉我阿斯福德尔一家的事。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:783
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_79ceb641_1:

    # "It’s hard not to feel left out, and I’m also starting to worry."
    "我很难不觉得自己被蒙在鼓里，心里也越来越不安。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:785
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_40c444ed_1:

    # Nienke "Will I really get on with Merel...?"
    Nienke "我真的能和梅蕾尔相处得好吗……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:786
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1dd80e51_1:

    # Emiel "Oh, I’m sure of it! You were such good friends, when you were both young girls. I don’t see why that will have changed."
    Emiel "那当然！你们小时候可是好朋友。现在又能有什么不同呢？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:788
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e02b83b9_1:

    # Nienke "It’s changed, Dad, because I don’t remember this Merel at all. We might have been friends—"
    Nienke "当然不同，爸爸。我根本不记得这个梅蕾尔。我们也许曾经是朋友——"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:789
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1e78e321_1:

    # Emiel "Best friends, even!"
    Emiel "是最好的朋友！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:791
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_fcebddb0_1:

    # Nienke "Right. Best friends, if you insist, but Ceesje is my best friend now. I don’t know Merel at all."
    Nienke "好，你非要这么说，那就是最好的朋友。但我现在最好的朋友是小茜。我根本不了解梅蕾尔。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:793
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5553875a_1:

    # Nienke "We might both be elves, but there’s no guarantee she’ll like me..."
    Nienke "就算我们都是精灵，也不代表她一定会喜欢我……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:795
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1efcd806_1:

    # Nienke "And our house isn’t very big, either. Where will she sleep?"
    Nienke "而且，我们家也不大。她要睡哪儿？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:796
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8b7452b6_1:

    # Elowen "Well..."
    Elowen "这个嘛……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:797
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6b4ae32b_1:

    # "My mother tucks a strand of her purple hair behind one elegantly pointed ear."
    "妈妈把一缕紫发掖到尖尖的耳朵后面，动作优雅。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:798
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e7f394db_1:

    # "She glances at my father, who looks back at her in turn."
    "她看向爸爸，爸爸也回看着她。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:800
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c61fd3ca_1:

    # "Then, her smile takes on a somewhat furtive edge as she says..."
    "随后，她的笑容里多了一点心虚，开口说道……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:801
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_883d293e_1:

    # Elowen "I know you value your privacy, dear, but there’s only so much space in the house. We don’t have any spare bedrooms..."
    Elowen "宝贝，我知道你很重视自己的空间。可家里就这么大，也没有多余的卧室……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:802
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_fc5a4219_1:

    # Elowen "So, I was hoping you would be gracious enough to let Merel stay with you, in your room!"
    Elowen "所以，我想请你大方一点，让梅蕾尔和你住一个房间！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:804
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c6c733f5_1:

    # "...Right."
    "……果然。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:805
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d606b15a_1:

    # "I expected as much, but I still wince."
    "早就猜到了，可我还是忍不住皱起了脸。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:807
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1681b0cc_1:

    # Nienke "So, I’ll have to let a stranger stay with me all summer?"
    Nienke "所以，我得让一个陌生人跟我一起住上整个暑假？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:808
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1a5aa23d_1:

    # Elowen "Oh, no, no, no! It won’t be all summer, dear! She’ll only be here for a week — and she isn’t a stranger. You’re friends!"
    Elowen "不，不，不！宝贝，不是整个暑假！她只来一个星期。而且她不是陌生人，你们是朋友呀！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:809
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_faaf5f08_1:

    # Emiel "Best friends, remember?"
    Emiel "最好的朋友，记得吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:811
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_62f3f9c2_1:

    # Nienke "Yes, you keep saying that, but it’s no good. I still can’t recall the first thing about her."
    Nienke "嗯，你们已经说了好多遍了。可说再多也没用，我对她还是一点印象都没有。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:813
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8167b8f2_1:

    # "I can’t recall a second thing about this Merel either, or a third, or a fourth."
    "这个梅蕾尔的一切，我从头到尾都想不起来，一件也想不起来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:814
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2a4bcfd4_1:

    # "She’s a complete mystery to me, and I have no desire to unravel her."
    "她对我来说彻底是个谜，而我一点也不想去解。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:828
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_584d7623_1:

    # "The rest of the day passes me by in something of a haze."
    "这一天剩下的时间，我过得恍恍惚惚。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:829
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6cd82228_1:

    # "I spend most of it thinking about Merel, not that I can recall all that much about her."
    "大部分时候都在想梅蕾尔，尽管根本记不起她多少事。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:830
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_85c6f8b8_1:

    # "Though she’s supposedly an old friend of mine, there’s a blank in my mind when I try to recall her. It doesn’t matter how hard I strain my brain. There’s nothing there."
    "都说她是我的老朋友，可只要试着回想，脑子里就是一片空白。无论多么用力，什么都没有。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:831
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c38449b6_1:

    # "I’ve never met anybody from my old home, Mors Paravail, before, so I’ve never really thought about the elves I left behind. Only now am I beginning to wonder."
    "我从没遇见过来自故乡莫尔斯·帕拉维尔的人，所以也从没认真想过，那些被我留在身后的精灵。直到现在，我才开始好奇。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:832
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_967ea418_1:

    # "I muse about Merel as I help my parents prepare the café for the day ahead, mopping down the floor and the tabletops."
    "帮爸妈打扫地板、擦拭桌面，准备开店时，我在想梅蕾尔。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:833
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a30f6237_1:

    # "I muse about Merel as I change into my uniform, and as the first few customers begin to trickle in for breakfast."
    "换上制服，迎来第一批吃早餐的客人时，我还是在想梅蕾尔。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:834
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_60e5d6fb_1:

    # "I’m the only waitress working today, but there aren’t all that many customers. I’m just about able to keep up, but my head is in the clouds."
    "今天只有我一个服务员，不过客人不算多，还勉强忙得过来。只是，我的心早就飞远了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:835
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_3f28e6d1_1:

    # "I wander around in a haze, lost in my own musings, when..."
    "我恍恍惚惚地走来走去，沉在自己的思绪里，直到……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:847
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e0e338ca_1:

    # VD "Nienke! Watch what you’re doing, you clumsy thing!"
    VD "妮恩克！看看你在做什么，毛手毛脚的！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:849
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e2880d45_1:

    # Nienke "Oh!"
    Nienke "啊！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:850
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5b43040e_1:

    # "I gasp."
    "我倒吸了一口气。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:851
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c25b9d69_1:

    # "I was in the middle of serving Mrs van Dijk with her customary cup of Darjeeling and slice of poppyseed cake, but my mind was miles and miles away."
    "我正在给范戴克太太端她惯常点的大吉岭茶和罂粟籽蛋糕，脑子却早就跑到了十万八千里外。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:853
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9d1eef93_1:

    # "My hand shakes without my knowledge, and though the Darjeeling remains inside its cup, the slice of poppyseed cake isn’t so lucky."
    "手什么时候抖了一下，我都不知道。茶倒是好好待在杯里，可蛋糕就没这么幸运了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:854
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_69eb9eec_1:

    # "It must have slid off the plate when I meant to set it down on the table, because it’s now resting squarely in Mrs van Dijk’s lap."
    "大概是放盘子时滑了下去吧，那块蛋糕现在正稳稳地躺在范戴克太太腿上。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:855
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1e1e0086_1:

    # "It looks like the cake fell apart when it fell, scattering crumbs everywhere."
    "落下时似乎还摔散了，碎屑撒得到处都是。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:857
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a79b5214_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk’s lap is covered with cakey remnants..."
    "她腿上沾满了蛋糕碎……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:858
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e0a57ac6_1:

    # "But if it’s any consolation, Mrs van Dijk {i}is{/i} wearing all black."
    "不过，真要找点安慰的话，她今天穿的{i}确实{/i}是全黑。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:859
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_14e6f42f_1:

    # "She tends to wear black exclusively, actually, save for the jewelled rings which adorn her choppy fingers."
    "其实，除了粗短手指上那些宝石戒指，她几乎只穿黑色。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:861
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_53167c94_1:

    # "I’ve heard that she used to wear other clothes when she was younger, and her husband was still alive, but I’ve not known Mrs van Dijk without wearing one of her severe black dresses."
    "听说她年轻时，丈夫还在世，也穿过别的颜色。不过自我认识她以来，她总是穿着一身庄重严肃的黑裙。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:871
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d9f1ed4a_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk’s husband, Edgar, died before I moved to Alpenrose. She’s been a widower for almost two decades, though she wears it with class and pride."
    "我搬到阿尔彭罗瑟之前，她的丈夫埃德加就去世了。她守寡快二十年，却始终活得体面又骄傲。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:872
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b9c36b03_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk might have started to wear all black as a means of remembering her dearly departed (and obviously beloved) husband, but now I think she does it as a fashion statement."
    "她最初穿黑衣，也许是为了悼念深深眷恋的亡夫。但现在，我觉得这已经成了她的穿衣风格。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:873
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ff66d129_1:

    # "All of her clothes are black, from her dresses to her shawls, and she pairs her smart funereal attire with accessories: earrings, brooches, and the occasional bodkin skewered through her grey hair."
    "从连衣裙到披肩，她的衣服全是黑色。庄重得如同丧服的装束，却搭着精巧的首饰：耳环、胸针，有时还有穿过灰发的发簪。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:874
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_85d38c65_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk owns a veritable jewellers’ worth of rings. I’ve heard that her late husband was rather wealthy, and he left his wife very well cared for even after his death."
    "她拥有的戒指，简直够开一家珠宝店。听说她亡夫颇有家资，去世后也给她留下了丰厚的保障。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:875
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c8662a4f_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk lives in a lovely home in Rozengracht: a three storey terrace with white-washed walls which looks a little like a wedding cake."
    "她住在罗森赫拉赫特一栋漂亮的房子里。三层联排住宅，外墙刷得雪白，看着有点像婚礼蛋糕。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:876
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_140b6ec5_1:

    # "I’ve been inside before, because Mrs van Dijk used to give me piano lessons when I was younger."
    "我以前去过。小时候，她教过我钢琴。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:877
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8ad16189_1:

    # "I was a little afraid of Mrs van Dijk then, but I thought her home was beautiful."
    "那时我有点怕她，却觉得她家漂亮极了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:878
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e059ffc7_1:

    # "It’s very light and airy, in comparison to Mrs van Dijk herself. There are landscapes all over the walls, framed in gilt, and the carpets are soft; the chaise lounges and divans a pearly white."
    "和她本人相比，那房子明亮又通透。墙上挂满镶着金框的风景画，地毯柔软，躺椅和长沙发则是珍珠般的白色。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:879
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2df60eea_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk’s bedroom, meanwhile, is a veritable treasure trove."
    "她的卧室，更是一座名副其实的宝库。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:880
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_85ebba6a_1:

    # "She showed me her collection of jewellery once, after she caught me staring at her ring-studded fingers when we were going through our scales, and I couldn’t help but gasp in awe."
    "有一次练音阶，她发现我一直盯着她戴满戒指的手，便把自己的首饰收藏拿给我看。我看得惊叹不已。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:881
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_bb9e2a68_1:

    # "I really did feel as though I’d stumbled upon a dragon’s hoard of sparkling gems, she had so many rings and necklaces and bracelets."
    "那么多戒指、项链和手镯，简直让我以为自己闯进了巨龙堆满宝石的巢穴。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:882
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b066b144_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk showed me rings in every single colour, made from all sorts of precious stones: emeralds, sapphires, rubies, and even lapis."
    "她给我看了各种颜色的戒指，上面镶着各式宝石：祖母绿、蓝宝石、红宝石，甚至还有青金石。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:883
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e584b984_1:

    # "She showed me her collection of brooches too, which were equally beautiful, and her pearl necklaces; her jewelled walking canes; the hats with the birds and feathers and flowers arranged on them."
    "还有同样漂亮的胸针、珍珠项链、嵌着宝石的手杖，以及装饰着鸟、羽毛和鲜花的帽子。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:884
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_007a0bc2_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk might be a widow, but she’s doing well for herself. She doesn’t look like a sad, pitiable figure, shuffling along in her black clothes."
    "虽然寡居，她依然把日子过得很好。她可不是那种穿着黑衣、拖着脚步、让人觉得凄凉可怜的老妇人。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:885
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_27895fcb_1:

    # "She might be small in stature (even I’m taller than she is), but there’s something commanding about her."
    "她个子很小，连我都比她高，却有一种不容忽视的威严。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:886
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c521d679_1:

    # "Her eyes are very blue and piercing, despite her advanced years, and I can’t see any signs of developing cataracts."
    "虽然上了年纪，那双蓝眼睛依旧锐利，完全看不出要长白内障的迹象。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:887
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1d56dcbf_1:

    # "She looks at the world keenly and clearly, and she always has a pithy word or two to spare."
    "她看事情清楚又敏锐，嘴里总少不了几句一针见血的话。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:888
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_879cb627_1:

    # "She isn’t the sort of woman to let herself be cowed, though she does have a short temper."
    "谁也别想唬住她。不过，她的脾气确实有点急。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:889
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_98536dc6_1:

    # "I’ve known Mrs van Dijk since I was a small girl, and she always had something of a soft spot for me. I thought she did, at least, but she looks irate now."
    "我从小就认识范戴克太太，她向来对我格外疼爱。至少，我以前是这么觉得的。可现在，她看上去气得不轻。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:899
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_3e8e90a4_1:

    # "She scowls, her blue eyes flashing like a vengeful Valkyrie, as she says..."
    "她皱着眉，蓝眼睛闪着怒火，像一位前来复仇的女武神，开口道……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:903
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a877af0e_1:

    # VD "And what do you think you’re doing? Is this some new sort of service, Nienke: throwing your customers’ food at them?"
    VD "你这是在干什么？妮恩克，把食物扔到客人身上，是店里的新服务吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:905
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8bc44e03_1:

    # VD "Perhaps you mean to expedite your serving technique, but you’re not having much luck."
    VD "或许你是想提高上菜效率，可惜，看来不怎么成功。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:907
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b2f777bc_1:

    # VD "Now, look here! You’ve ruined my skirt, you clumsy girl. What is the matter with you?"
    VD "瞧瞧！我的裙子都被你弄脏了，笨手笨脚的姑娘。你到底怎么回事？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:908
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_46f42554_1:

    # "Does she really want me to answer that question? I’m not sure where I’d begin."
    "她真的想听答案吗？我都不知道该从哪儿说起。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:910
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7121330d_1:

    # "I suppose I still feel a little groggy after being woken up so early by Engelmund, and I’m gloomy after receiving that letter from Cornelia..."
    "恩格尔蒙德一大早就把我弄醒，我到现在还有点迷糊。科妮莉娅那封信，又让我心情低落……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:911
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_3a1e58f1_1:

    # "And then, of course, there’s the matter of meeting Merel."
    "当然，还有即将见到梅蕾尔这件事。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:913
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8d1554a5_1:

    # "If I was feeling less perturbed, I don’t suppose I would’ve dropped that slice of cake on Mrs van Dijk, but I did. I ruined her skirt, and there’s not much I can do about it beyond apologising."
    "如果没这么心烦，我大概不会把蛋糕弄到她身上。可事情已经发生了，裙子也弄脏了，除了道歉，我似乎也做不了什么。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:914
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_20021e33_1:

    # "I tell her that I’m sorry, but I’m not sure if it’s helping my case. Mrs van Dijk raises an eyebrow at me, then says..."
    "我连忙说对不起，却不知道有没有用。她挑起眉毛，说道……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:915
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_bcc15515_1:

    # VD "You can apologise all you like, Nienke, but it isn’t going to wipe the crumbs off my skirt."
    VD "妮恩克，你道多少次歉，也不能让裙子上的蛋糕屑自己消失。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:917
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b95c691c_1:

    # VD "You’ve made quite the mess. Why, I have half a mind to complain to your parents!"
    VD "看看你闹的！我都想去找你爸妈说道说道了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:919
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b6c3a875_1:

    # Nienke "O-Oh, no...! Please don’t do that! They’re busy enough as it is. I don’t want to cause any more trouble..."
    Nienke "别、别……！求您别去！他们已经够忙了，我不想再添麻烦……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:921
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c731c060_1:

    # VD "Then you should have thought of that, shouldn’t you, before you started flinging slices of cake everywhere?"
    VD "那你把蛋糕甩得到处都是之前，就该先想到这一点，是不是？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:922
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d763973f_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk glances down at her lap, at the slice of poppyseed cake which is still resting on her lap."
    "她低头望着自己的腿，那块罂粟籽蛋糕还躺在上面。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:924
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_31664bd0_1:

    # VD "What am I going to do with my cake now? I can hardly eat it from my own skirt like a pig at a trough."
    VD "现在，这蛋糕让我怎么吃？难道要趴在裙子上吃，像猪趴在食槽里一样？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:926
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a20cd124_1:

    # Nienke "Y-Yes, um, I know. I would never tell you to do that. Um..."
    Nienke "是、是的，那个，我明白。我绝没有那个意思。嗯……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:928
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5ad77dff_1:

    # Nienke "I can, um, get you another slice of cake immediately..."
    Nienke "我可以，呃，马上给您换一块……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:930
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9195d47c_1:

    # Nienke "And I can take this slice away, if you don’t mind...?"
    Nienke "这一块先让我拿走，可以吗……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:931
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_813f72a2_1:

    # "I retrieve a few napkins from the table, then say..."
    "我从桌上抽了几张纸巾，问道……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:933
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f81bf5c2_1:

    # Nienke "Is it alright if I wipe it away?"
    Nienke "我帮您擦掉，可以吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:935
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6243cfda_1:

    # VD "Oh, thank goodness. And here I was, thinking you would never offer."
    VD "谢天谢地。我还以为你永远都想不到。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:937
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e92ec0a7_1:

    # VD "I can’t say I enjoy being touched more than is strictly necessary: especially not by a chit like you..."
    VD "我可不喜欢别人没事碰我，尤其是你这种小丫头……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:939
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e4d0c4a2_1:

    # "(I try not to take offence at this. Mrs van Dijk calls all young girls ‘chits’. It’s her way.)"
    "（我努力不往心里去。她管所有年轻姑娘都叫“小丫头”，一向如此。）"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:941
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e1bc97e0_1:

    # VD "But I am a paying customer, and you are the one who made this mess. I shouldn’t have to clean it up myself. Now, get this cake off me and I might be able to forgive you."
    VD "不过，我是付了钱的客人，这烂摊子又是你闯出来的，总不能让我自己收拾。快把蛋糕弄掉，我也许还能原谅你。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:943
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_0452f372_1:

    # Nienke "Why, thank you."
    Nienke "那真是谢谢您了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:944
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_fbda6a33_1:

    # "I bob a neat curtsy as I speak, in a manner I imagine a stern woman like Mrs van Dijk would appreciate."
    "我边说边规规矩矩地屈膝行了个礼。像她这么严厉的人，应该会喜欢这种礼数吧。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:946
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_28e1a08e_1:

    # Nienke "I, um, appreciate it...?"
    Nienke "我，呃，很感激……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:948
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_cd06d95a_1:

    # VD "As well you should. I am an old woman, and I have lived a long time, and I don’t suffer fools gladly."
    VD "你是该感激。我一把年纪了，活了这么久，最受不了的就是笨手笨脚的人。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:950
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_baba7244_1:

    # Nienke "I know. I really am sorry. I didn’t mean to cause such a fuss. My mind was just...{w} elsewhere."
    Nienke "我知道。真的很抱歉。我不是故意惹这么多麻烦，只是刚才……{w}在想别的事。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:952
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5f518d56_1:

    # VD "Well, I could see that!"
    VD "看得出来！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:956
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_756e0d6b_1:

    # VD "It was obvious you were away with the fairies, girl. I tried warning you before you dropped the cake and made a spectacle out of yourself — and me, too — but you didn’t listen."
    VD "姑娘，你那魂不守舍的样子，谁看不出来？蛋糕掉下去之前，我就想提醒你，免得你出丑，连带我一起。可你根本没听。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:957
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_750f62c9_1:

    # VD "That’s the problem with you youngsters. You never do. You think that old women like myself are invisible."
    VD "你们年轻人就是这个毛病，永远不肯听。像我这样的老太婆，在你们眼里简直是透明的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:959
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_644a1f67_1:

    # VD "I would call it deplorable, really, if it wasn’t so hypocritical. Loath as I am to admit it, I know I was much the same when I was your age."
    VD "真是不像话——要不是这么骂显得我太虚伪，我还真想这么说。虽然不愿承认，可我也知道，自己像你这么大时，差不多也是这副德行。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:961
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f3756dfa_1:

    # Nienke "You were?"
    Nienke "您也是？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:963
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_4789cdbf_1:

    # VD "Well, of course I was."
    VD "那当然。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:965
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8293e700_1:

    # VD "I might be an old woman now, but that wasn’t always the case."
    VD "我现在是老太婆，可不是从来都这么老。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:967
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a3de7a08_1:

    # VD "I was as young as you once, Nienke, and I was an awful know-it-all alongside it."
    VD "妮恩克，我也曾像你这么年轻，而且还特别自以为什么都懂。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:968
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7dd7cf9e_1:

    # VD "My grandparents used to say I was too headstrong, and I would get myself into trouble one of these days, but I never listened to them."
    VD "祖父母总说我太倔，迟早要闯祸，可我从来不听。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:970
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_04e28399_1:

    # VD "I thought that I knew best; that I was young and oh so modern in my outlook, while they were old and uninformed."
    VD "总觉得自己什么都明白，年轻，想法又新潮；他们则老了，什么都不懂。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:972
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_cdeda49f_1:

    # VD "I used to scorn the elderly too, as a bunch of fools: believe me, I did..."
    VD "我也曾瞧不起老人，觉得他们尽是些糊涂蛋。真的，我不骗你……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:974
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_20451339_1:

    # VD "But I’ve not had the privilege of being young for several decades now. I’ve lost my youth, though I’ve gained a treasure trove of knowledge — and with it, I can see that I wasn’t as wise as I thought I was."
    VD "可我早就不年轻了，几十年了。青春没了，倒攒下了不少见识。有了这些见识，我才明白，自己从前根本没想象中那么聪明。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:976
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2b6e57c3_1:

    # VD "I was hopelessly wet behind the ears, just like you."
    VD "和你一样，还是个乳臭未干的小丫头。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:978
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d17db538_1:

    # VD "You’re a pretty thing, Nienke, but you need to buck your ideas up. You’re still young, but you won’t be young forever. Youth’s a gift which expires far too soon — and I’m afraid you’re too old to get caught up in your fancies."
    VD "妮恩克，你是个漂亮姑娘，可也得打起精神。现在年轻，不代表永远年轻。青春这份礼物，过期得比谁都快。而且，你也早过了整天胡思乱想的年纪。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:979
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_387d5288_1:

    # VD "You’re twenty-one now, aren’t you?"
    VD "你今年二十一了吧？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:981
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1b3db07a_1:

    # Nienke "Just twenty, Mrs van Dijk. I won’t be twenty-one until next October."
    Nienke "才二十，范戴克太太。到明年十月才二十一。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:985
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f5b1f2cc_1:

    # VD "Well, you’re still an adult. You’re old enough to answer for your own mistakes. I shouldn’t coddle you, really: not when you’re no longer a child..."
    VD "那也已经是成年人了，足够为自己的错误负责。你不再是孩子，我实在不该惯着你……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:986
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_cfd7f3a8_1:

    # VD "But I know you’re a hard worker, even if you are a bit dozy, so I’ll let it slide."
    VD "不过，我知道你做事勤快，就是有点迷迷糊糊。这次就算了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:988
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5b1803ed_1:

    # VD "I won’t tattle on you to your parents, but I must ask you to pay more attention during your work."
    VD "我不会去你爸妈那里告状，不过，工作时必须多上点心。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:989
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2964e01c_1:

    # VD "You only dropped my cake, but what if you’d spilled my Darjeeling all over my lap instead?"
    VD "这次只是蛋糕。要是整杯大吉岭茶都洒在我腿上呢？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:991
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6571c179_1:

    # VD "That would have been disastrous!"
    VD "那可就不得了了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:995
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_643b3924_1:

    # "Hmm. She raises a good point. If I had spilled any tea on her, it would have caused some real problems."
    "嗯，她说得对。如果洒的是茶，那就真的麻烦了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:997
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f9099e19_1:

    # "I really don’t want to hurt Mrs van Dijk, even if she can be a bit of a bother. I wouldn’t exactly call her a ‘dear old lady’, but I do like her."
    "就算她有时有点难伺候，我也绝不想伤着她。要我叫她“慈祥的老奶奶”，我实在叫不出口，但我确实喜欢她。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:999
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_0d1c0a31_1:

    # "She was kind to me when I first moved to Alpenrose, and I didn’t know anybody. She made me feel at home, despite her funereal black, in her pastel home which looks so very much like a wedding cake."
    "刚搬来阿尔彭罗瑟、谁也不认识时，她对我很好。虽然一身肃穆的黑衣，却在那栋淡彩色、像婚礼蛋糕的房子里，让我有了家的感觉。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1000
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9040dd6d_1:

    # "She wasn’t exactly patient with me when she took me through my scales, but I know she only did it because she cared."
    "教我练音阶时，她算不上耐心，但我知道，她是关心我才这么做。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1002
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_bf9c9482_1:

    # "I guess Mrs van Dijk is a firm proponent of tough love. She’s been patronising Fleur de Lys for almost fifteen years, but that doesn’t mean she likes my mother’s food."
    "她大概笃信“严才是爱”。在百合花光顾了将近十五年，可不代表她就会夸妈妈的手艺。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1003
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9e1b80bb_1:

    # "In fact, she always complains about it."
    "事实上，她总在抱怨。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1004
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b9a7ea65_1:

    # "The poppyseed cake is always too dry or too soft, and she says that I’m awful at brewing tea. It’s either weaker than an insect’s urine or it’s much too strong."
    "罂粟籽蛋糕不是太干，就是太软。至于我泡的茶，更是一无是处：不是淡得像虫子的尿，就是浓得喝不下去。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1005
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_dee65d46_1:

    # "Mrs van Dijk can never go a single visit to Fleur de Lys without complaining about something — and, since she’s our most loyal customer, I’ve heard thousands of her complaints at this point."
    "她每次来百合花，总得挑点毛病。偏偏她又是最忠实的老顾客，所以到现在，她的抱怨我都听过几千回了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1007
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d0d555e5_1:

    # "Today, however, I think she has a perfectly valid reason to complain. I did ruin her skirt, and I could have hurt her."
    "不过今天，她完全有理由抱怨。我确实弄脏了她的裙子，甚至差点伤到她。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1008
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ebaafd17_1:

    # "I need to be more careful."
    "我得再小心些。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1010
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7e7d18e0_1:

    # "I tell Mrs van Dijk as much, once I’ve finished wiping the rest of the crumbs off her sensible dark skirt, and she sighs."
    "把她那条朴素黑裙上残留的碎屑擦干净后，我也把这话告诉了她。她叹了口气。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1012
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_89f3d959_1:

    # VD "That’s alright, dear..."
    VD "好了，亲爱的，没事了……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1014
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2b7d0564_1:

    # VD "Or, rather, it isn’t. It might very well not have been alright, but you didn’t cause me grievous bodily harm in the end. You only scattered a few crumbs."
    VD "不对，也不能这么说。原本是可能出事的，只不过最后我没受什么重伤，仅仅沾了点蛋糕屑。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1016
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_fc8b10d4_1:

    # VD "Now, what do you say you fetch me another slice of cake? I am fond of you, Nienke, but I do want what I’ve paid for. It’s in bad form to swindle an old lady."
    VD "现在，能再给我拿一块蛋糕了吗？妮恩克，我是喜欢你，可付过钱的东西，我还是要吃到的。骗老太婆的钱，可不是体面事。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1018
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_4b6fb3a3_1:

    # Nienke "O-Oh, I know...! I didn’t have any intentions of swindling you, either. I’ll get that second slice of cake for you ready right away!"
    Nienke "啊、啊，我知道……！我也没想骗您！我这就去重新拿一块蛋糕来！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1019
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6060cc87_1:

    # VD "Yes, please. See to it that you do. I will be waiting right here, so don’t feel compelled to rush..."
    VD "好，那就麻烦你了。我就在这里等着，不用着急……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1021
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7f88f599_1:

    # VD "Not too much, at least. We don’t want a second incident to happen, now, do we?"
    VD "至少，别太急。我们可不希望同样的事再来一次，对吧？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1022
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ca0f6389_1:

    # Nienke "No, we do not."
    Nienke "是，不希望。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1023
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ca4d0e12_1:

    # "I mumble under my breath."
    "我低声嘟囔。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1024
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_fadfc9af_1:

    # "I might be agreeing with Mrs van Dijk (that tends to be the easiest way to deal with her), but I don’t exactly feel enthused about it."
    "虽然顺着她的话说了——一般这样最省事——可我实在提不起什么精神。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1025
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b6ccfbb7_1:

    # "I’m already exhausted."
    "我已经累坏了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1041
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e3268c17_1:

    # Nienke "What a day..."
    Nienke "这一天过得……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1045
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_fb289829_1:

    # "I sigh as I retreat to my bedroom later that night, collapsing on my bed with a {i}thwump.{/i}"
    "夜里，我回到卧室，叹了口气，{i}扑通{/i}一声倒在床上。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1047
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6f8728c9_1:

    # "My shift at Fleur de Lys has long since ended, and I’ve already had dinner."
    "店里的工作早就结束了，晚饭也吃过了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1049
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_3459ad15_1:

    # "I whiled away the evening half-heartedly reading a book, before deciding to cast it aside and have a bath."
    "整个傍晚，我心不在焉地翻着书消磨时间，最后干脆把书丢到一边，去泡了个澡。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1050
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1e682584_1:

    # "I finished up in the tub, changed into my nightclothes, and now I’m here, staring at my ceiling."
    "洗完澡，换上睡衣，现在的我躺在这里，望着天花板。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1052
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a73873a6_1:

    # "As I stare, my gaze listless and unfixed, I find myself thinking of Merel."
    "目光涣散，没个着落，思绪又转到了梅蕾尔身上。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1053
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9f6beb77_1:

    # "I’ve not been able to get her out of my head ever since my parents told me about her — which is funny, I suppose, given I don’t know the first thing about her."
    "自从爸妈提起她，我就怎么也放不下。说来也好笑，明明我对她一无所知。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1054
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c7abc86e_1:

    # "I don’t remember what she looks like, or what she acts like..."
    "不记得她长什么样，也不记得她是怎样的人……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1056
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f3f79271_1:

    # "But she still feels significant to me."
    "却还是觉得，她对我很重要。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1058
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f4b48ef9_1:

    # "Will I remember her when I finally see her again, with a sudden spark of recognition?"
    "等真正再见到她，我会不会忽然眼前一亮，把她认出来？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1059
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c1680ab6_1:

    # "It’s impossible to say. I have no idea..."
    "谁知道呢。我毫无头绪……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1061
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7865bccd_1:

    # "But I’ve caused no shortage of mishaps today, thanks to my mind being focused so squarely on this mysterious Merel."
    "可就因为一门心思想着这个神秘的梅蕾尔，今天我已经出了不少岔子。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1063
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_4b0a39af_1:

    # "First, there was the incident with Mrs van Dijk’s poppyseed cake, and then I wound up stepping on Engelmund’s tail when I was walking upstairs."
    "先是范戴克太太那块罂粟籽蛋糕，后来上楼时，我又踩到了恩格尔蒙德的尾巴。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1064
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ef6f27dd_1:

    # "He did {i}not{/i} appreciate that (I have the scratches on my ankles to prove it), and I didn’t appreciate it very much, either."
    "他{i}非常{/i}不高兴——脚踝上的抓痕就是证据——我也一点都高兴不起来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1066
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_4058366e_1:

    # "My ankle has stopped throbbing, but he’s left some nasty gashes behind. I doubt they’ll get infected, but it’s still a concern."
    "脚踝已经不再一跳一跳地疼了，可他留下了好几道难看的伤口。应该不会感染，但还是让人担心。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1067
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9be003f9_1:

    # "It’s less of a concern, however, than my upcoming meeting with Merel."
    "不过，再担心，也比不上即将见到梅蕾尔这件事。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1069
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_58731242_1:

    # "Will I like her?"
    "我会喜欢她吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1070
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_71f6557f_1:

    # "Will she like me?"
    "她会喜欢我吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1071
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1db063b7_1:

    # "Will I remember her..."
    "我会记起她吗……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1073
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2caac98f_1:

    # "And will seeing a figure from my past, no matter how shadowy, help me remember some of the things I’ve long since forgotten?"
    "看见一个来自过去的人，哪怕记忆中只剩模糊的影子，能不能帮我想起那些早已忘却的事？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1074
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ee58a338_1:

    # "I do wonder about that..."
    "我真的很想知道……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1076
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b306114c_1:

    # "But wondering is all I really can do, curled up beneath my sheets as I am."
    "可蜷在被子里的我，除了想想，也做不了别的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1077
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_23096e0d_1:

    # "I’ll have to wait and see until she gets here."
    "只能等她来了再看。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1085
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c87ad578_1:

    # "I frown as I look about my room, my eyes half-lidded, straining in the dark."
    "我皱着眉，半眯着眼，费力地在黑暗里打量自己的房间。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1086
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7235fe9d_1:

    # "My room isn’t all that big and sometimes, when it gets late, I think I see strange shapes on the walls and the ceiling."
    "房间不大。有时到了深夜，墙上和天花板上，仿佛会浮现奇怪的形状。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1087
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_43c1f620_1:

    # "When I was a small child, I used to be especially disturbed by my wardrobe. I saw strange, shifting patterns in the whorls of the wood: ominous faces undulating in its dark grains."
    "小时候，我尤其怕衣柜。木头的纹路里，好像有诡异的图案在变动，深色木纹间，一张张不祥的脸时隐时现。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1088
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f63cf71c_1:

    # "I can’t see any wicked faces right now, but I do feel a vague sense of unease."
    "现在倒没看见什么可怕的脸，却还是隐隐不安。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1089
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_10c641ab_1:

    # "It seems almost unthinkable, given I’ve spent my years in Alpenrose a relative loner: the only elf in the village, my parents excepting..."
    "在阿尔彭罗瑟住了这么多年，我一直很孤单。除了爸妈，我是村里唯一的精灵。这种事简直难以想象……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1090
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9c5f4d0d_1:

    # "But I guess that’s going to come to an end soon."
    "可这样的日子，大概就要结束了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1091
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9206868b_1:

    # "Come next week, I’ll meet another elf: Merel Asphodel."
    "下星期，我会见到另一位精灵：梅蕾尔·阿斯福德尔。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1092
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1530684e_1:

    # "My parents swear that we’ve met before, and we used to be friends, but I can’t remember her at all."
    "爸妈信誓旦旦地说，我们以前见过，还是朋友。可我一点都不记得她。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1093
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f9211df0_1:

    # "I don’t have much to judge her by, save for my parents’ optimistic notions that we’ll get along."
    "除了爸妈乐观地认为我们一定合得来，我没有别的依据去了解她。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1094
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a77f612a_1:

    # "I’m not sure why they’re so convinced of this fact, though. My parents know me better than anybody — apart from Cornelia, I suppose — and they should be well aware of how awkward I am."
    "不过，他们为什么这么有把握？除了科妮莉娅，大概再没人比爸妈更了解我。他们应该很清楚，我和人相处有多笨拙。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1095
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b9c1d148_1:

    # "It’s rather telling that, in the fifteen or so years that I’ve lived in Alpenrose, Cornelia’s the only real ally I have."
    "在村里住了十五年左右，真正站在我这边的人，却只有科妮莉娅一个。这还不够说明问题吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1096
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_4f7a6e8c_1:

    # "Why, then, are my parents so convinced that I’ll get on with Merel?"
    "那他们为什么就笃定，我会和梅蕾尔合得来？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1097
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9dd1b89f_1:

    # "We might have known one another once, but this would have been a long time ago. She’s a stranger to me now: somebody I can’t even half-recall."
    "也许我们曾经认识，可那已是太久以前。如今，她对我而言就是个陌生人，连一点像样的印象都没有。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1106
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_20c57644_1:

    # "I try to cast my mind back, like a fisherman might cast out his net in the undulating ocean, but it’s no use. The sea of my mind remains quite empty, devoid of even the smallest of fry."
    "我努力向过去探寻，像渔夫把网撒向起伏的海面，可还是徒劳。记忆的海里空空荡荡，连一尾最小的鱼苗都没有。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1108
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_bbf473a7_1:

    # "I can’t remember Merel. That’s what I think, at least..."
    "我不记得梅蕾尔。至少，我是这么想的……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1119
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_2b4a230c_1:

    # "But, when I drift off, half-remembered snatches return to me: a handful of words and phrases which might have come from a dream..."
    "可渐渐睡去时，几片似曾相识的记忆又浮了上来。一两句话，几个词，仿佛来自梦里……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1120
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_8509f09e_1:

    # W "{i}...worry, Niene. You aren’t alone. I’ll protect you.{/i}"
    W "{i}……别怕，妮妮。你不是一个人。我会保护你。{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1121
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_1ea3688a_1:

    # W "{i}I promise.{/i}"
    W "{i}我保证。{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1122
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_79b57399_1:

    # "Who told me that, though?"
    "究竟是谁，对我说过这些话？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1123
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_20ff8ed8_1:

    # "Who was it who wound a protective arm around my shoulders, and who tried to reassure me?"
    "是谁护着我的肩膀，轻声安慰我？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1124
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_75513b81_1:

    # "I’m sure it was an elf. I don’t remember if they were a boy or a girl, but..."
    "我记得，那一定是个精灵。是男孩，还是女孩，我已经记不清了，可……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1125
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_90668bbc_1:

    # "Their name..."
    "那个人的名字……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1126
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b4759708_1:

    # "Was it..."
    "是不是……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1131
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_67429950_1:

    # W "...up. Hey, sleepyhead. Rise and shine!"
    W "……起床。喂，小懒虫，太阳晒屁股啦！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1132
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_12a694e9_1:

    # W "The sun’s high in the sky, and it’s a beautiful sunny day. You wouldn’t wanna waste it, would you? That’d be such a shame, since I’m only gonna be here for a week!"
    W "太阳都升得老高了，今天这么好的天气，可别白白浪费了呀。我总共才来一个星期，那多可惜！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1133
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_cb4d85ee_1:

    # W "You’re supposed to be showing me around here!"
    W "你还得带我到处逛逛呢！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1149
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_91697d37_2:

    # Nienke "Nn..."
    Nienke "唔……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1150
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_82cfd903_1:

    # "I wince, drawn from my slumber by an unpleasant voice humming above my ear."
    "耳边有个声音嗡嗡不停，吵得人难受。我皱起脸，从睡梦里被拉了出来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1152
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c12b7a53_1:

    # "I think the voice belongs to a woman, though it’s a little hard to tell. Their timbre is low, but their cadence positively pulses with energy."
    "听起来像个女人，不过不太好分辨。嗓音偏低，语调里却满是活力。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1153
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_051a293e_1:

    # "I can’t see their face very well, since my vision is all blurry, but they sound pretty excitable. What’s up with them, anyway...?"
    "眼前还模模糊糊的，看不清那张脸，可这人似乎兴奋得很。到底怎么回事……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1155
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_97745f67_1:

    # W "Ooh! You’re finally stirring. Was I finally able to get your attention? I hope so..."
    W "哦！终于动了。总算听见我说话了？希望是吧……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1159
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c88a1003_1:

    # W "But what’s this? You still aren’t awake!"
    W "可是，咦？怎么还没醒呀！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1160
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_47364cb4_1:

    # W "C’mon, princess. I know it’s a weekend and all, so you don’t gotta work, but you can’t spend all your time lounging about in bed, snoozing! Just think about little old me here!"
    W "来嘛，小公主。我知道今天是周末，不用工作，可也不能一直窝在床上睡大觉呀！多少也顾着点我嘛！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1161
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_51563fc0_1:

    # W "I thought you’d be excited to see me again! It’s been ages!"
    W "我还以为，再见到我，你会很开心呢！我们都多久没见啦！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1164
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_91697d37_3:

    # Nienke "Nn..."
    Nienke "唔……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1177
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_4fe4d7af_1:

    # "I wince again as something sinks into my cheek: something hard, intrusive, and unyielding."
    "有什么东西戳进我的脸颊，硬邦邦的，又烦人，又不肯挪开。我再次皱起脸。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1178
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_bc517f56_1:

    # "What is that...?"
    "这是什么……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1179
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ad5957fa_1:

    # "Under normal circumstances, Engelmund would be the one harassing me this morning, all twenty pounds of him perched on my chest..."
    "平时，大早上骚扰我的应该是恩格尔蒙德。二十磅重的一团，整个压在我胸口……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1180
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_89d31d6e_1:

    # "But I don’t think the appendage poking my cheek belongs to my beloved cat."
    "可正在戳我脸的这东西，应该不属于我亲爱的猫。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1181
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_54860742_1:

    # "I don’t think that voice belongs to him, either."
    "那声音也不像他的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1182
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5e6a90cb_1:

    # "Well, of course it doesn’t. Engelmund might be smart, but he’s not yet reached the level where he can communicate with human speech..."
    "当然不是了。恩格尔蒙德是聪明，可还没聪明到能说人话……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1183
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_fc659a82_1:

    # "And if he could, I doubt he’d talk quite like this."
    "就算他会说话，我也不觉得他会是这种口气。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1184
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6b4574bc_1:

    # "I imagine Engelmund to have a deep, sonorous sort of a voice: one that’s a little plummy. I think he’d talk like a distinguished gentleman, and I really can’t imagine him running his words together like this."
    "想象中，他的声音应该低沉洪亮，带着一点拿腔拿调的贵气。像位体面的绅士，绝不可能这么连珠炮似的说话。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1185
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_e1fc60ca_1:

    # "He’s much too classy."
    "他的格调可高多了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1186
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_157311aa_1:

    # "This isn’t Engelmund, then."
    "所以，这不是恩格尔蒙德。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1187
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c2eb5d4f_1:

    # "I mean, it obviously isn’t Engelmund. That should never have been up for consideration, largely because it’s impossible."
    "我是说，显然不是。这种事根本不该纳入考虑，主要因为它不可能发生。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1188
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_5593a822_1:

    # "I don’t know why I was even entertaining the notion. I really must be tired."
    "我为什么还认真想了一下？一定是太困了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1189
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6cfaf7b5_1:

    # "I didn’t get much sleep last night, on account of thinking about Merel, wondering whether we’ll get along, and what she’ll be like."
    "昨晚一直想着梅蕾尔，想她是怎样的人，我们能不能相处好，结果没睡多久。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1190
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_163a1ee6_1:

    # "I’ve been thinking about it so much she seems to have occupied my mind, just like some sort of colonising fungus."
    "想得太多，她就像某种蔓延的真菌，快把我的脑子占满了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1191
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_be51be02_1:

    # "I’m feeling a little nervous about meeting her, actually..."
    "说真的，一想到要见她，我就有点紧张……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1192
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_4c89bc35_1:

    # "So I guess it’s a good thing that she isn’t scheduled to come here until next Saturday."
    "幸好，她要到下星期六才会来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1193
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_9a758a6d_1:

    # "That was what my father told me, at least, but..."
    "至少，爸爸是这么说的，可……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1194
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_88ef3e4a_1:

    # W "Hey, Niene!"
    W "喂，妮妮！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1197
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_11887489_2:

    # "{i}Prod, prod.{/i}"
    "{i}戳，戳。{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1198
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_31604491_1:

    # W "Why’re your eyes still closed? I can tell that you’re awake! I might not be the sharpest tool in the shed, but I’m not an idiot!"
    W "怎么还闭着眼睛？我看得出来你醒了！我是不算特别聪明，可也不是笨蛋呀！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1199
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_02929872_1:

    # W "You ain’t sleeping..."
    W "你根本没在睡……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1200
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c1e6dac6_1:

    # W "Though you do look kinda funny, hehe."
    W "不过，你这模样还挺好玩的，嘿嘿。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1201
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_47acff66_1:

    # "Funny...? I do...?"
    "好玩……？我吗……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1202
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_f31024b0_1:

    # W "That’s right! Your lovely long hair’s all tangled, and some of it’s gone in your mouth. Ain’t that bothering you?"
    W "对呀！你那么漂亮的长头发，全都缠在一起了，还有几根进了嘴里。不难受吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1203
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_0579055b_1:

    # W "I can always pull your hair outta your mouth for you, if you want..."
    W "要不，我替你把嘴里的头发拿出来吧……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1204
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ce9ff193_1:

    # W "But it looks like you were droolin’ juuuust a little when you were sleeping too, hehe."
    W "不过，你睡觉的时候，好像还流了那——么一点口水，嘿嘿。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1207
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_11887489_3:

    # "{i}Prod, prod.{/i}"
    "{i}戳，戳。{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1208
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_05a2dcbe_1:

    # W "I don’t know if I wanna stick my fingers too close to your mouth, in case they get slobbered on."
    W "我可不太敢把手伸得离你嘴巴太近，怕沾一手口水。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1209
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_0e04c1b0_1:

    # W "You’re a pretty girl, so maybe some people would consider that a plus, but I’d rather keep my hands clean, wahahahaha!"
    W "你长得这么漂亮，有人说不定还乐意呢。不过，我还是想让手保持干净，哇哈哈哈！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1219
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_0737295f_1:

    # Nienke "Wah...?!"
    Nienke "什……？！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1223
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d16f79f4_1:

    # "These remarks are enough to finally shake me out of my sleepy stupor. My eyes snap open, and I sit up in my bed, disturbing my sheets."
    "这些话终于把我的瞌睡彻底赶跑了。我猛地睁开眼，掀动被子，从床上坐起。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1224
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_867d0803_1:

    # "I lift my head, and then..."
    "我抬起头，然后……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1235
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_a056dc96_1:

    # W "Why, hello there, Sleep Beauty! It’s nice to see you’re finally awake! I would say that it’s good to meet you..."
    W "你好呀，睡美人！可算醒啦！我本来想说，很高兴认识你……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1236
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c9540c19_1:

    # W "But that wouldn’t be quite right. We {i}have{/i} known one another for a while, though I dunno if you remember that!"
    W "不过，这么说好像不太对。我们{i}早就{/i}认识了，只是不知道你还记不记得！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1237
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_3031c1d3_1:

    # W "You were a pretty little kid when we last spoke, hehe..."
    W "上次说话时，你还是个小不点儿呢，嘿嘿……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1239
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_ead8c8df_1:

    # W "But I remember you, and I missed you! I hope you’ve been doing alright! We have so much to catch up on! {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"
    W "可我记得你，也很想你！希望你这些年过得好！我们有好多话要聊呢！{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1240
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_3ebd4dbd_1:

    # "And, when I see the woman who came to wake me, I gasp."
    "看清来叫醒我的女人，我不禁倒吸一口气。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1242
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c1667295_1:

    # "Her figure is rather impressive. I can tell that she’s much taller than I am even though she’s leaning over my bed, and I’m sitting up."
    "她的身形相当惹眼。即使她弯着腰俯在床边，我已经坐起来了，也看得出她比我高出许多。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1243
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_444cf23a_1:

    # "Her clothes are kind of skimpy and her shirt has no sleeves, exposing her arms."
    "她穿得有些清凉，无袖上衣露出了双臂。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1244
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d451c167_1:

    # "Her chest is full (maybe you could call it voluptuous?), and her fair hair is long, tied back in a long braid."
    "胸前很丰满——也许该说丰盈？——浅色长发编成一条长长的辫子，垂在身后。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1245
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_41446899_1:

    # "Her hair is very pale and her skin is dark like mine: a rich deep brown which seems to shimmer in the early morning sunlight filtering in through my window."
    "她的头发颜色极浅，皮肤却和我一样深，是浓郁的褐色。在清晨透过窗户的阳光里，仿佛微微发亮。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1247
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_7cd2f60d_1:

    # "She’s wearing shorts which are very short, and they show off a fair amount of thigh."
    "短裤短得很，露出了一大截腿。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1248
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_6610aff4_1:

    # "Her thighs ripple with well-defined muscles, just like her arms. Her shoulders aren’t particularly broad, but I bet she could pick me up and spin me around with relative ease."
    "大腿上的肌肉线条和手臂一样分明。肩膀不算特别宽，可我敢说，她轻轻松松就能把我抱起来转圈。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1249
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_00c1d702_1:

    # "She’s impressive..."
    "真是让人惊叹……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1251
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c2c215e6_1:

    # "But I find my eyes drawn, not to her muscles, but to her other prominent features."
    "可吸引我目光的，并不是那些肌肉，而是另一个醒目的特征。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1252
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_d5ed478e_1:

    # "She has ears just like mine: long, pointed ears which taper off at the ends."
    "她的耳朵和我的一样，长长的，末端收成细尖。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1253
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_025253e1_1:

    # "She must be an elf."
    "她一定是个精灵。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1255
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_dad5407a_1:

    # "Her smile is bright, and she flashes me a mouthful of white teeth as I blink at her."
    "我眨眼望着她，她则笑得灿烂，露出一口洁白的牙齿。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1256
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_281f886d_1:

    # "I shouldn’t know who she is..."
    "我本不该知道她是谁……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1257
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_b1e402c7_1:

    # "But something about her expression does feel faintly familiar. Could it be...?"
    "可那副神情，却隐隐让我觉得熟悉。难道……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1268
translate zh_CN_portable_compat start_c0d39e90_1:

    # Nienke "Merel...?"
    Nienke "梅蕾尔……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1294
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_efc812b8_1:

    # Nienke "Alright, you all have some explaining to do. What in the world is going on here?!"
    Nienke "好了，你们都得给我解释一下。这到底是怎么回事？！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1295
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_431ae519_1:

    # "That’s how I address my parents later that morning, as I stand by the breakfast table."
    "那天早上，来到早餐桌前，我就是这样质问爸妈的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1299
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_fecb2d82_1:

    # "I slam my palm against the table, making the plates and the cups and the cutlery rattle, and glare at the people assembled about it."
    "我一掌拍在桌上，震得盘子、杯子和餐具叮当作响，瞪着围坐在桌边的几个人。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1300
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_fc7956b9_1:

    # "My parents are both present, of course, because they always are. They both smile at me: my mother indulgent, my father a touch abashed."
    "爸妈当然都在，他们一向如此。两个人都对我笑着：妈妈一脸纵容，爸爸则有些不好意思。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1301
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_583947ac_1:

    # "The newest addition to our family, meanwhile, looks utterly unconcerned about my unease. She’s tearing through her pancakes already, though I’ve not sat down or picked up my cutlery yet."
    "至于这个刚加入家里的新成员，似乎根本不在乎我的不满。我还没坐下，连餐具都没碰，她就已经吃得风卷残云。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1302
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9916d961_1:

    # "Hasn’t she ever heard about waiting for everybody to be seated before she starts digging in? How rude!"
    "难道没人教过她，要等大家都坐好再开动吗？真没礼貌！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1303
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_90a4b389_1:

    # Nienke "I know that Merel was going to stay here, but I thought you said she was going to get here next week! What gives?!"
    Nienke "我知道梅蕾尔要来住，可你们不是说下星期才来吗！这是怎么回事？！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1305
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_def41689_1:

    # Emiel "Well, about that..."
    Emiel "嗯，这个嘛……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1306
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_ca55aec6_1:

    # "My father smiles as Merel continues to devour her breakfast...{w} though not even that is visceral enough to describe what Merel’s actually doing."
    "爸爸陪着笑，梅蕾尔则继续吞食早餐……{w}不，连“吞食”都不足以形容她现在的吃相。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1314
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_8bd0f6f8_1:

    # "Merel’s actually shovelling her pancakes into her mouth as though she’s afraid they might stand up of their own accord and run away."
    "她正拼命把煎饼往嘴里塞，好像生怕煎饼突然长腿，自己跑掉似的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1315
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b8fe1dbc_1:

    # "Normally, I would say that such paranoia is baseless and unfounded..."
    "平时，我会说这种担心纯属无稽之谈……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1316
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a873cfcd_1:

    # "But, given everything which has happened this morning already, I wouldn’t even be surprised."
    "可今天早上都发生这么多事了，真变成那样，我恐怕也不会惊讶。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1317
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_34e3e99c_1:

    # "My life feels like it’s been tipped upside-down on its axis! Up is down and down is up! What the heck’s going on?!?!"
    "我的生活简直整个倒转过来了！上变成下，下变成上！到底搞什么啊？！？！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1318
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_f8a1572d_1:

    # Emiel "I wasn’t lying to you, Nienke, dear, when I said that Merel would be coming to stay with us next Sunday. That’s what I believed too, when I received the letter."
    Emiel "宝贝，我说梅蕾尔下星期日才来，不是在骗你。我收到信的时候，也真是这么理解的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1319
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_7c8e8b59_1:

    # Emiel "I really, truly thought that she would visit us later..."
    Emiel "我真的以为，她还要过几天才来……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1320
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_ff7be7d0_1:

    # Emiel "But it seems I misinterpreted her message."
    Emiel "不过，看来是我误会了信里的意思。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1321
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e8195acb_1:

    # Emiel "She, um... Wound up coming here a lot earlier than I anticipated."
    Emiel "她，呃……比我想的早到了不少。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1322
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_525e9a15_1:

    # "My father looks at Merel, who’s still shovelling pancakes inside her mouth. She has a glob of gooey apple sauce stuck to her lower lip, but she makes no effort to wipe it away."
    "爸爸看向梅蕾尔，她还在不停往嘴里塞煎饼。下唇沾着一团黏糊糊的苹果酱，却连擦都不擦。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1323
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_c6e42a1a_1:

    # "She’s been sat down at the table for all of two minutes, and she’s already eaten her way through three pancakes. It would be impressive if it wasn’t so disturbing."
    "坐下才两分钟，她已经吃完三张煎饼了。要不是看着有点吓人，倒真值得佩服。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1324
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e4190ce5_1:

    # "How can she fit that much food inside her? Does she have hollow legs?"
    "她怎么装得下这么多食物？腿里难道也是空的？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1325
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_f55aee97_1:

    # "If I was more scientifically minded, perhaps I’d be tempted to dissect her to discover her secrets..."
    "我要是热衷科学，没准真想把她解剖了，研究一下其中的奥秘……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1326
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d7b196b1_1:

    # "But I’ve never been all that interested in biology. I was always more interested in history and geography — and literature too, of course."
    "不过，我从来不怎么喜欢生物。还是对历史和地理更感兴趣，当然，还有文学。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1327
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_58d7df8e_1:

    # "I didn’t spend all of my childhood reading books for nothing."
    "小时候读的那么多书，总不是白读的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1336
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_eb6bf3f5_1:

    # "I’ll have to take dissecting Merel off the table (for now, at least), but her behaviour is still curious."
    "解剖梅蕾尔暂时就免了——至少现在免了——但她的举动还是让人摸不着头脑。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1337
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_be4aa522_1:

    # Nienke "And why did you come here so early? Don’t you think it’s a little strange that her mother wrote to ask if she could visit, only for her to show up on our doorstep without giving us any time to respond?"
    Nienke "那你为什么来得这么早？她妈妈才写信问能不能过来，我们还没来得及回复，她就已经站在家门口了。你们不觉得有点奇怪吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1339
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a4ef33e0_1:

    # Nienke "It seems a bit presumptuous..."
    Nienke "似乎有点太自作主张了……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1349
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_59b0bd26_1:

    # Merel "But I {i}did{/i} give you time to respond! I sent my letter at the start of last week!"
    Merel "可我{i}给过{/i}你们时间呀！信是上星期初寄的！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1350
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9ec95f25_1:

    # Merel "I figured you would’ve had plenty of time to read it, then reply to it — and my mother said I was gonna come here on Sunday, too!"
    Merel "我以为你们早就看完，有足够时间回信了。而且，妈妈也写明了，我星期日会来！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1351
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5e2f6b77_1:

    # Merel "We were very upfront about it!"
    Merel "我们说得很清楚呀！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1355
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b1e68411_1:

    # Emiel "Last week, hmm...?"
    Emiel "上星期……嗯？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1356
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_616c7612_1:

    # "My father frowns, resting one hand beneath his chin. There’s a small pause, and then..."
    "爸爸皱起眉，一手托着下巴。安静了片刻，然后……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1357
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d6e9cfd9_1:

    # Emiel "Aah. So, when you said you were coming to stay here on Sunday, you meant—"
    Emiel "啊。所以，你说星期日过来，是指——"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1360
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_f10a49a7_1:

    # Merel "This Sunday, yeah! I did give you a whole week’s warnin’!"
    Merel "这个星期日呀！我可是提前整整一周通知的！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1361
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2d9d5546_1:

    # Emiel "I see. The delay in receiving your letter must have caused some confusion."
    Emiel "原来如此。一定是信件延误，才闹出了误会。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1363
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0b9ec724_1:

    # Merel "There was a delay...?"
    Merel "信延误了……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1364
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e2b7e689_1:

    # Elowen "That’s right, dear. We only received your letter yesterday."
    Elowen "是啊，宝贝。我们昨天才收到。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1366
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9e7c4185_1:

    # Merel "Oh, geez. It’s no wonder you both looked so surprised when I showed up! I’m sorry for appearin’ so suddenly, and throwing everything outta whack!"
    Merel "哎呀，难怪我一出现，你们都那么吃惊！抱歉，来得这么突然，把大家都弄乱套了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1368
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_49624fa6_1:

    # Merel "I swear, I thought you’d receive the letter much sooner! I figured, since I didn’t hear back, you were alright with it..."
    Merel "真的，我以为你们早就收到了！一直没回信，我还当你们同意了……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1370
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2f09413c_1:

    # Merel "But I guess I should’ve waited for your reply...{w} and maaaaybe my mother should’ve put a date on that letter. ‘This Sunday’ sounds kind of vague, now that I think about it..."
    Merel "不过，看来我还是该等到回复再来……{w}妈妈大——概也该在信里写个日期。现在一想，“这个星期日”确实有点含糊……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1371
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9c0ce082_1:

    # Emiel "Well, what’s done is done."
    Emiel "好了，既然来了，就来了吧。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1372
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0f0e778f_1:

    # Emiel "You’re already here, Merel, and I’m hardly going to send you back to Mors Paravail. That wouldn’t be very hospitable!"
    Emiel "梅蕾尔，你人都在这儿了，我总不能把你赶回莫尔斯·帕拉维尔。那也太不懂待客之道了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1374
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2ae27e18_1:

    # Merel "Are you sure?"
    Merel "真的没关系吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1375
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_574c83eb_1:

    # Emiel "I’m positive. I did miss you, Merel. It’s been a while since I last saw you, and I was wondering how you’d been. It’s great to see you doing so well. Isn’t that right, Elowen?"
    Emiel "当然没关系。我也很想你。好久没见，一直惦记你过得怎么样。现在看你这么好，真让人高兴。是不是，艾洛温？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1377
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3136014d_1:

    # Elowen "Oh, yes! You look to be in good spirits, hehe~ It’s nice to see you, even if you are here a bit early."
    Elowen "当然！看你这么有精神，呵呵，真好。来早一点也没什么，见到你就开心。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1378
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a9a61ebe_1:

    # Elowen "I know I have no qualms with it. What about you, Nienke?"
    Elowen "我当然没有意见。妮恩克，你呢？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1380
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e8cb521e_1:

    # Nienke "Why ask me? It’s not like I have any say in who stays here. It’s your house, not mine."
    Nienke "问我干什么？谁来住，我又说了不算。这是你们的家，不是我的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1382
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5f363d9e_1:

    # "That’s one of the unfortunate realities of living with my parents. I’m an adult, but they’re the ones who have the final say in everything."
    "和父母住在一起，就是有这种无奈。我是成年了，可什么事最后都还是他们说了算。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1384
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b336ead2_1:

    # "I don’t know why my mother is even bothering to solicit me for my opinion. I guess she just wants me to feel involved, but it seems like a pointless gesture."
    "妈妈又何必特地问我的意见？大概是想让我觉得自己也有参与吧，可我觉得，这举动毫无意义。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1386
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_419ef17f_1:

    # "{i}Sigh.{/i}"
    "{i}唉。{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1388
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_ec1260f6_1:

    # Elowen "Well, that is true. It is mine and Emiel’s decision to make, at the end of the day..."
    Elowen "嗯，你说得没错。归根结底，是我和埃米尔决定……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1389
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_66f4cebf_1:

    # Elowen "But I want to hear how you feel about this too, dear. After all, Merel will be staying in your bedroom for the next week!"
    Elowen "不过，宝贝，妈妈也想知道你的感受。毕竟，接下来这一周，梅蕾尔要住在你的房间里！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1391
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_758f1f0a_1:

    # Nienke "Urgh. Are you still trying to push that?"
    Nienke "唉。你还没放弃这个打算吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1392
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_25b09c1b_1:

    # Elowen "That’s right. We had this discussion yesterday. There’s nowhere else to put her, so she’ll have to stay in your room."
    Elowen "当然。昨天就说好了，没有其他地方安排她，只能住你的房间。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1393
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9fb8c221_1:

    # Elowen "There’s nothing else for it."
    Elowen "也没别的办法了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1395
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e2348278_1:

    # Nienke "But I don’t have much space as it is: especially when Engelmund spends so much time in my bedroom. There’s barely enough room for me, let alone anybody else!"
    Nienke "可我的房间本来就不大，恩格尔蒙德又老待在里面。连我自己都快没地方了，哪里还挤得下别人！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1396
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4c27ae57_1:

    # Elowen "I know, dear, and I do appreciate that. It’ll be a bit of a tight squeeze, but please, try to be reasonable."
    Elowen "宝贝，我知道，也理解你。是会挤一点，但你也体谅一下，好吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1398
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_c923c71e_1:

    # "Hmph. That’s easy for my mother to say. She’s not the one who’s being forced to put up a stranger for a week."
    "哼。妈妈说得倒轻巧。被迫收留陌生人一星期的又不是她。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1400
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9c6ebbce_1:

    # "{i}I’m{/i} the one whose privacy is being eroded here! I think I have a right to be annoyed, but it’s clear my mother doesn’t agree."
    "私人空间被侵占的人可是{i}我{/i}！我觉得自己完全有理由不高兴，可显然，妈妈不这么想。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1401
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b9635209_1:

    # Elowen "There’s nowhere else for Merel to go. The house is too small. She has to stay in your room, unless you want her to sleep on the kitchen floor?"
    Elowen "梅蕾尔没有别的地方住，家里太小了。除非你想让她睡厨房地板，不然就只能住你房间。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1402
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_bb980d4d_1:

    # Emiel "Oh, no! We can’t have that! Bastian would never forgive me if I put his daughter in the kitchen like a scullery maid!"
    Emiel "哎呀，那可不行！要是把巴斯蒂安的女儿像洗碗女佣一样安排在厨房，他可饶不了我！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1403
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_f32efecb_1:

    # Emiel "We have to give her a proper room, at least. It wouldn’t be fair otherwise!"
    Emiel "至少得让她住个正经房间，不然也太委屈她了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1405
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_11503412_1:

    # "Well, I can’t argue with that."
    "嗯，这我确实没法反驳。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1407
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_43b4f8f0_1:

    # "The bottom floor of our home is occupied with the café, which is my parents’ pride and joy. It’s relatively spacious, and all of the rooms beneath us exist for the comfort and the use of our customers."
    "房子楼下是爸妈引以为傲的咖啡馆，相对宽敞。下面的所有房间，都是为了让客人方便、舒适而准备的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1408
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e49e8078_1:

    # "My parents and I live on the floor above the café, in a small collection of rooms. I guess you could say our living quarters are snug, but it can be a bit of a tight squeeze with three people."
    "我们一家三口住在楼上几间小屋里。说是小巧温馨也行，可三个人已经有点挤了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1410
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_c2b35942_1:

    # "Four people, however, might be unmanageable."
    "四个人的话，恐怕就应付不过来了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1412
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3bac6bd7_1:

    # "There’s no spare room for Merel to go, unless we want to stick her in my father’s teeny-tiny study which is even smaller than the kitchen, so..."
    "除非把梅蕾尔塞进爸爸那间比厨房还小的书房，不然真没有空屋子给她。所以……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1414
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_eafae1a1_1:

    # Nienke "...Oh, alright. I’ll try to put up with it. I don’t want to be too difficult..."
    Nienke "……好吧。我尽量忍一忍，也不想太难说话……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1416
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_599edb3d_1:

    # Nienke "But don’t start making a nuisance out of yourself, alright?"
    Nienke "不过，你可别给我添乱，听见了吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1417
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_edd6b1ff_1:

    # Nienke "You’ll be in my room, so I’d like it if you could obey my rules. I don’t want you causing any problems."
    Nienke "住在我的房间，就请遵守我的规矩。我不希望出什么麻烦。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1420
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2d7dded2_1:

    # Merel "What? Nienke! Why would I {i}ever{/i} cause you any problems? You’re my friend!"
    Merel "什么？妮恩克！我{i}怎么可能{/i}给你添麻烦？你可是我的朋友！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1422
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_cfcb25e8_1:

    # Nienke "You can say that as much as you like, but I still don’t remember you. Isn’t it a bit soon to claim that we’re friends?"
    Nienke "你说多少次都一样，我还是不记得你。现在就说我们是朋友，是不是太早了？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1424
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_fe93af8a_1:

    # Merel "Hey! That’s mean! We’ve known one another since we were little girls! Can’t you throw me a bone here?"
    Merel "喂，好伤人！我们小时候就认识了呀！多少通融一下嘛！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1426
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d002b1de_1:

    # "Hmmm. I don’t think that Merel’s lying to me about our former friendship, but..."
    "嗯……我不觉得她在骗我，我们以前应该确实是朋友。可是……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1428
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_c82995a6_1:

    # Nienke "You might remember me as a child, but I’m afraid I don’t remember you. I can’t, therefore, call you my friend."
    Nienke "你也许还记得小时候的我，可我已经不记得你了。所以，现在我没法把你当成朋友。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1430
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_478edfa5_1:

    # Nienke "It would seem a bit presumptuous on your part, and this is all moving too quickly."
    Nienke "你这么说，有点一厢情愿。而且，一切都太快了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1432
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b543b935_1:

    # Nienke "I don’t make friends that easily. We need to talk a bit more first."
    Nienke "我没那么容易交朋友。至少，得先多聊聊。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1433
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_656587b9_1:

    # "I do wonder, as I rebuff Merel’s friendly advances, whether I’m being a bit too harsh."
    "拒绝她伸来的友谊之手时，我也忍不住想，自己是不是太苛刻了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1435
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_677c9735_1:

    # "I might not recall Merel, but she does recall me. I don’t think it’s wrong of her to think of me as a friend if we have a history..."
    "我不记得她，可她记得我。如果我们确有过去，她还把我当朋友，也没什么错……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1437
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_7ae1fe40_1:

    # "But I don’t remember this so-called history, and I don’t want her to think that her feelings are reciprocal."
    "可那些所谓的过去，我全都忘了。我不想让她误以为，我也和她抱着同样的感情。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1438
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a7aaafea_1:

    # "I’d like a little bit of space."
    "我想留一点距离。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1442
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b655570f_1:

    # Merel "...Well, I understand that. To you, I probably look like some random stranger. I dunno if I’d wanna be my friend either, if I were in your shoes..."
    Merel "……嗯，我明白。在你眼里，我大概就是个莫名其妙的陌生人。换作是你，我也不一定想跟自己做朋友……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1444
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_756d005b_1:

    # Merel "But I can work with that! You don’t need to think of me as a friend, but I still think of you as one!"
    Merel "不过，没关系！你现在不用把我当朋友，我还是把你当朋友呀！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1446
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e475ad04_1:

    # Merel "I can remember all of the times we had together, and all of the fun games we used to play!"
    Merel "我们一起度过的日子，一起玩过的游戏，我都记得！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1447
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_97e9d6dd_1:

    # Merel "I remember that you were important to me, too. You still are. I wouldn’t’ve come all the way to Alpenrose if you weren’t!"
    Merel "我也记得，你对我很重要。现在也一样。不然，我也不会大老远跑来阿尔彭罗瑟！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1448
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_df686ecb_1:

    # Merel "I care about you, Niene, even if you don’t care about me..."
    Merel "我在乎你，妮妮。哪怕你并不在乎我……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1450
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4f37b9b2_1:

    # Merel "So, no matter what happens, I’ll always think of you as a friend!"
    Merel "所以，无论发生什么，我都会把你当朋友！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1452
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e8c1344a_1:

    # Nienke "Is that so?"
    Nienke "是吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1454
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0dda0756_1:

    # Merel "Yeah, that’s right! I hope that ain’t too much of an inconvenience?"
    Merel "对呀！希望不会让你太困扰？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1456
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b9aa59c7_4:

    # Nienke "Well..."
    Nienke "嗯……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1458
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_bc7a7eeb_1:

    # "It does feel a bit peculiar, actually, having this girl I scarcely know declare so determinedly that we’re friends. From my perspective, she’s being a bit aggressive..."
    "一个几乎不认识的女孩，坚决宣称我们是朋友，这感觉确实很奇怪。在我看来，她有些咄咄逼人……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1460
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a740a92d_1:

    # "But, from hers, she’s probably acting the way she always used to around me."
    "可对她而言，这大概只是她从前和我相处的样子。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1462
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_1c407d09_1:

    # "It feels like we’re on a bit of an uneven footing here, given the divide in our memories, but..."
    "我们的记忆有一道缺口，仿佛连立足的地方都不在同一边。不过……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1464
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_590e2ba2_1:

    # Nienke "Well, okay. If you feel this strongly about me, I can allow you to think of me as a friend."
    Nienke "好吧。既然你这么坚持，我可以允许你把我当朋友。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1467
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_38f97d0e_1:

    # Merel "Yay! That’s exactly what I wanted to hear!"
    Merel "太好了！我就等这句话呢！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1469
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5b1ecae4_1:

    # Merel "Thank you, Niene, for being so nice! I’m glad you’ll let me think of you as a friend, even if I look like a total weirdo to you!"
    Merel "谢谢你，妮妮，你真好！就算在你眼里我是个怪人，你还愿意让我把你当朋友，真开心！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1471
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b0f403a3_1:

    # Merel "I’ll do my best so you’ll think of me as a friend, too! I’m gonna try real, real hard during the next week!"
    Merel "我也会努力，让你愿意把我当朋友！接下来这一星期，我会很努力、很努力的！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1473
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_22d3ff04_1:

    # Merel "In the end, you’ll be beggin’ to be my friend! I’ll bridge the gap between us, and then it’ll be like the last fifteen years never even happened!"
    Merel "到最后，你肯定会求着和我做朋友！我会把我们之间的距离填上，到时候，就像这十五年根本没分开过！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1475
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_279c0582_1:

    # "Hmmm. I’m not too sure about that myself. I’m not very fond of loud, overly enthusiastic people (they remind me too much of the boys from primary school who used to tease me) and I would prefer to keep my distance."
    "嗯……我可没这么有把握。我不太喜欢吵闹又热情过头的人——那会让我想起小学里欺负我的男孩——还是更愿意保持距离。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1479
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_770669f3_1:

    # "Merel doesn’t seem like the sort of person I would willingly befriend. She doesn’t seem very much like me at all."
    "梅蕾尔不像我会主动结交的人。她看起来和我完全不同。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1480
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_dbc4d6c5_1:

    # "I can’t remember the first thing about her, but..."
    "关于她，我还是什么都想不起来，不过……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1482
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_59945e17_1:

    # Nienke "...Hehe."
    Nienke "……呵呵。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1483
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3bc0cf99_1:

    # "Her enthusiasm {i}is{/i} rather charming."
    "她这份热情，{i}确实{/i}有点讨人喜欢。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1485
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_dd02e363_1:

    # Nienke "Well, it’s nice to know you’re taking this so seriously..."
    Nienke "嗯，知道你这么认真，我还是挺高兴的……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1487
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_98e86779_1:

    # Nienke "But can you stop with the pet name?"
    Nienke "不过，能不能别再叫我昵称了？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1490
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5fd54c53_1:

    # Merel "Huh?"
    Merel "咦？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1491
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0c19f862_1:

    # "Merel blinks. She frowns, then says..."
    "梅蕾尔眨了眨眼，皱起眉头，问道……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1492
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0a9e2f42_1:

    # Merel "Is there somethin’ wrong with the way I’ve been addressin’ you?"
    Merel "我叫你的方式，有什么不对吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1494
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_1ede5621_1:

    # Nienke "I’ll say. You keep calling me ‘Niene’."
    Nienke "当然有。你一直叫我“妮妮”。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1498
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d8ac7246_1:

    # Merel "And?"
    Merel "然后呢？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1499
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e411e2ef_1:

    # "Merel tilts her head to one side, blinking."
    "她歪着头，又眨了眨眼。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1500
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4f7282c3_1:

    # Merel "Why would that be an issue? I always called you that!"
    Merel "这有什么问题？我以前一直这么叫呀！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1501
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_bfec13a2_1:

    # Nienke "Maybe you did, but I don't remember it. I don’t remember you. The only person who calls me Niene is Cornelia. She’s my best friend, while you’re little more than a stranger."
    Nienke "也许吧，可我不记得。我不记得你。现在只有科妮莉娅这么叫我，她是我最好的朋友，而你对我来说，基本上只是陌生人。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1502
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a8318200_1:

    # Nienke "For as long as you’ll be living here, I want you to call me Nienke."
    Nienke "住在这里的这段时间，请你叫我妮恩克。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1504
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5717e3d5_1:

    # Merel "Wha...?"
    Merel "什……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1505
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_734cccbc_1:

    # "Merel deflates at this, her shoulders slumping. She pouts, then says..."
    "梅蕾尔一下泄了气，肩膀耷拉下来。她撅着嘴，说……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1507
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_25da516c_1:

    # Merel "That’s so distant, though! You're makin’ me sound like a stranger here!"
    Merel "可这也太生分了！你把我说得像个陌生人似的！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1509
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_934bc3e7_1:

    # Nienke "Because you are, more or less. If we spend more time together, maybe you can call me Niene, but until then, it will be Nienke. Do you understand?"
    Nienke "因为差不多就是如此。以后相处久了，你也许可以叫我妮妮。不过在那之前，请叫妮恩克。明白吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1513
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9600b0ae_1:

    # Merel "I get it, yeah, but that doesn’t mean I have to like it. It’s so harsh..."
    Merel "明白是明白，可不代表我得喜欢。也太无情了……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1515
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_91cfcf72_1:

    # Merel "But okay."
    Merel "不过，好吧。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1516
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2358d13c_1:

    # "Merel eventually capitulates, after a small pause."
    "停顿片刻，她终于让了步。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1518
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0d41805e_1:

    # Merel "I’ll make sure to call you Nienke — at least, until you change your mind."
    Merel "我会记得叫你妮恩克的，至少，在你改变主意之前。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1519
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_07b24c8f_1:

    # Merel "It’s kinda sad, but I’m sure you’ll see sense soon enough. I mean, we weren’t best friends for nothin’!"
    Merel "有点难过，不过你肯定很快就会想通。毕竟，我们以前可不是白当了那么久的好朋友！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1521
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d723c2d3_1:

    # Merel "This’ll be a cinch!"
    Merel "肯定小事一桩！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1525
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_48de46bd_1:

    # Nienke "Heh."
    Nienke "呵。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1526
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_494c62d6_1:

    # "Faintly, I smile."
    "我淡淡地笑了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1527
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4d5ba871_1:

    # "Merel might be pretty aggressive in her affection, but I appreciate she's no quitter."
    "她的亲近或许太过强势，可至少，她不是轻易放弃的人。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1528
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_ccd8b633_1:

    # "There's something to be admired about that."
    "这一点，倒值得欣赏。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1529
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_38b3b295_1:

    # "Maybe she really {i}is{/i} serious about me. I don't get it, but..."
    "也许她对我{i}真的{/i}很认真。虽然我不明白，但……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1530
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d1e7c6a6_1:

    # Nienke "Okay. I'll hold you to that. I just hope that your best efforts won’t be in vain. I’m not sure if you’re aware of this, but I’m notoriously hard to win over."
    Nienke "好，那我记住了。但愿你这番努力不会白费。也许你还不知道，我可是出了名的难讨好。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1546
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e27c2111_1:

    # Merel "Oooh! Now I’m seeing it properly, your bedroom is really cute, Niene — er, Nienke! It’s so cosy!"
    Merel "哦！现在仔细一看，你的房间真可爱，妮妮——呃，妮恩克！好温馨！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1551
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4450ace5_1:

    # Nienke "Hmph..."
    Nienke "哼……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1552
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_1299f2ae_1:

    # "I pout, my arms folded stiffly across my chest, as Merel looks about my bedroom."
    "梅蕾尔四下打量我的卧室，我则绷着身子，双臂抱在胸前，撅起嘴。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1560
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5a78abeb_1:

    # "My room is squashed up to the right-hand side of the house, and it sits right beneath the sloping part of the eaves, where the roof is at its lowest."
    "我的房间挤在房子最右边，正好位于倾斜的屋檐下面，也就是屋顶最低的地方。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1561
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_ec86df2a_1:

    # "Even I find my room claustrophobic from time to time, and I’m teeny-tiny: so much so Cornelia always used to joke about it."
    "连我都偶尔觉得憋闷，可我明明小得很，小到科妮莉娅总爱拿这事开玩笑。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1562
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_f127e8de_1:

    # Cornelia "{i}That’ll be why you hate cross country so much! You must be afraid of being bowled over by a breeze, Niene — or picked up by an eagle and taken back to its nest!{/i}"
    Cornelia "{i}难怪你那么讨厌越野跑！妮妮，你一定是怕被风吹倒，或是被老鹰叼回窝里去吧！{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1563
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2e178187_1:

    # "Cornelia would always make little quips like this, and then she’d start giggling as though she’d said something incredibly clever."
    "她总爱这样打趣，然后自己笑个不停，仿佛说了什么特别机灵的话。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1564
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_1ebbbffc_1:

    # "I used to roll my eyes, but I never got too upset. I was used to her jibes — and anyway, she meant them in good faith."
    "我会翻白眼，不过从没真的生气。我早习惯她的调侃了，何况，她也没有恶意。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1565
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_923d164c_1:

    # "She wasn’t mean-spirited about it, at least: not like Ivonne and her friends."
    "至少，和伊冯娜以及她那帮朋友不一样。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1566
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_28136707_1:

    # "I’m not so little, of course, that I’m in danger of being blown about by the breeze. That’s a bit of an exaggeration..."
    "当然，我还没小到会被微风刮跑。那也太夸张了……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1567
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_61e49364_1:

    # "But not by too much."
    "不过，也没夸张太多。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1576
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_176481e2_1:

    # "I’m small now, and I was even smaller as a kid, which is probably why my parents thought it was alright to stick me in such a cramped room with such a low roof."
    "现在我就很小，小时候更小。爸妈大概才觉得，把我塞进这间屋顶低矮、狭小逼仄的屋子，也没什么。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1578
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_35da39ae_1:

    # "They probably thought I’d get used to it. I doubt they thought I would grow into it, given there’s not much space to do any growing."
    "他们大概觉得，住着住着就习惯了。总不至于是等我长大，把房间填满吧？这里连长大的空间都不多。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1579
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e2fd7f57_1:

    # "In fact, I’ve sometimes wondered whether my room is to blame for my lack of growth."
    "事实上，我有时怀疑，自己长不高，都怪这间房。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1581
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_efcbdb1c_1:

    # "Did my body, realising that there’s always a ceiling only a few centimetres away from my head at any one time, make the conscious decision not to get any taller?"
    "会不会是身体发现，头顶永远离天花板只有几厘米，干脆主动决定，不往上长了？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1583
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0b71311a_1:

    # "It might be like plants. If you put them in a secluded area, away from the sunlight, it can stop them from getting bigger."
    "没准就像植物。把它放在照不到阳光的角落里，就会妨碍生长。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1585
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_def4312c_1:

    # "I should know, since we did a little science experiment back in primary school. It’s one of the lessons from primary school I still remember clearly, despite never being that interested in science."
    "这我还是知道的，因为小学做过一个小实验。虽然对科学没什么兴趣，那却是少数我至今记得清清楚楚的课。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1586
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_45127572_1:

    # "We were all given some sunflower seeds, and we were tasked with planting them, watering them, and looking after them."
    "老师给了我们每人几颗向日葵种子，让我们种下、浇水，照顾它们。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1588
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_672be94b_1:

    # "We had to put our sunflowers somewhere in the classroom, wherever we thought it would grow best."
    "花盆要放在教室里，我们自己认为最适合生长的地方。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1590
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4bb35be9_1:

    # "Naturally, Cornelia nudged all of the boys aside with her pointy elbows, and she was able to plop her flowerpot right in the centre of the windowsill."
    "科妮莉娅自然是用尖尖的胳膊肘把男孩们挤开，直接把花盆摆到了窗台正中央。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1591
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2546022e_1:

    # "Her sunflower soaked up all of the golden sunshine, and it would up being one of the biggest."
    "她的向日葵晒足了金灿灿的阳光，最后长得数一数二地高大。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1593
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_6926155a_1:

    # "My plantpot, meanwhile, kept getting knocked over ‘accidentally’ by the other kids."
    "至于我的花盆，却总被别的孩子“不小心”撞倒。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1594
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e95a1568_1:

    # "They were so rough with it I got tired of replanting my poor sunflower and sticking the pot back on the windowsill."
    "他们那么粗暴，我一次又一次把可怜的向日葵重新种好、放回窗台，最后实在倦了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1595
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4a4c2e71_1:

    # "I wound up putting my sunflower inside the dark storage cupboard instead, and it didn’t exactly thrive."
    "于是，我把花盆放进黑漆漆的储物柜里。它自然没能茁壮成长。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1597
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_fca882b0_1:

    # "In fact, it wilted."
    "事实上，它枯萎了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1599
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_55dd2d8a_1:

    # "I feel a little like that sunflower as I look around my room..."
    "环顾这间房，我觉得自己有点像那株向日葵……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1601
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_6120b4b8_1:

    # "Though it isn’t dark and dingy. There’s quite a large window, at least, which looks out onto the street."
    "不过，这里并不阴暗。至少有一扇挺大的窗户，能望见街道。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1602
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_00125783_1:

    # "My room is very light and white in general: mostly ivory colours, with a bit of baby blue here and there."
    "房间总体明亮洁白，大多是象牙白，间或点缀着一点浅蓝。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1604
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_6acda179_1:

    # "My bed sheets are white, and so is my dresser."
    "床单是白的，梳妆台也是白的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1605
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b624824a_1:

    # "I have an old wardrobe which takes up a lot of space, where I keep all of my clothes, and there are plants dotted about here and there: on the windowsill (not that there’s much space), and my bedside table."
    "一只旧衣柜占了很大地方，里面装着我所有的衣服。房间里还零星摆着植物，在窗台上——虽然地方不多——也在床头柜上。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1606
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_64f07b13_1:

    # "I even have some circular terrariums suspended from the ceiling."
    "甚至还有几个圆形的玻璃生态球，从天花板上吊下来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1607
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_293aef33_1:

    # "I think I inherited my fondness of jarred, bottled objects from my father. He’s a big fan of bottled ships, and he builds them for fun."
    "我对瓶瓶罐罐里小东西的喜爱，大概遗传自爸爸。他很喜欢瓶中船，也爱亲手做着玩。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1609
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_f193954f_1:

    # "He whiles away the time in his office upstairs, putting these teeny-tiny miniature ships together inside these bottles with his glasses balanced on the tip of his nose."
    "他会在楼上的书房里，把眼镜架在鼻尖，将小小的船模拼进瓶子里，悠闲地打发时间。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1610
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9b8958f4_1:

    # "My father has pretty steady hands, but he sometimes capsizes his boats when he’s constructing them. He never seems to mind this, though."
    "他的手很稳，不过制作时偶尔也会把船弄翻。可他似乎从不在意。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1612
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_cf60e821_1:

    # "My dad is pretty laid-back. That’s one of the reasons why I like him so much."
    "爸爸性子很随和。这也是我这么喜欢他的原因之一。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1614
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_dfad4711_1:

    # "People say I’m like my father, because we’re both artistic souls, but he’s a lot more relaxed than I am."
    "别人说我像爸爸，都有点艺术气质，可他比我放松多了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1615
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_6e79362c_1:

    # "I wish I could be less highly strung."
    "我也希望自己别总这么绷着。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1617
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_287ad8ea_1:

    # "That’s one of the reasons why I’ve tried to turn my bedroom into such a cosy haven, where I can retreat to escape from the hustle and bustle of the rest of the world."
    "所以，我才努力把卧室布置成温馨的避风港，能躲进来，远离外面的纷纷扰扰。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1618
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_13462525_1:

    # "My bed is strewn with various cute pillows and stuffed toys, including a little flopsy rabbit with a pale blue bow twined about the neck that Cornelia won for me at a local fair."
    "床上堆着各式可爱的抱枕和毛绒玩具。其中有只软趴趴的小兔子，脖子系着淡蓝色蝴蝶结，是科妮莉娅在本地集市上赢来送我的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1620
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_8019e557_1:

    # "I keep my terrariums and potted cacti and succulents displayed about my room whenever I have space, and I have ivy growing up my walls, too."
    "只要有空地方，我就会摆上玻璃生态瓶、仙人掌和多肉。墙上还有常春藤攀着。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1621
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a824f257_1:

    # "The ivy is all fake, unlike the cacti and the succulents, but I think it gives my room a refreshing pop of colour. There’s something peaceful about it."
    "常春藤是假的，不像仙人掌和多肉那样是真植物，不过那一抹绿色依旧清新，看着很宁静。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1623
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_83aec493_1:

    # "I have a collection of little jars too, which I keep lined up on my bedside table: jars all full of glimmery, glittering powder."
    "床头柜上还排着一小排罐子，里面装满闪闪发亮的粉末。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1624
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d0680045_1:

    # "These jars are some of my prized possessions, and they’re pretty eye-catching despite being so small."
    "它们都是我的宝贝，虽然小，却很惹眼。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1634
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3d709a8e_1:

    # "Merel’s looking at the jars curiously, leaning forwards. She cocks her head, then says..."
    "梅蕾尔好奇地凑近那些小罐子，歪着头问……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1636
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_7eb57f00_1:

    # Merel "What’s inside all of these little glass bottles, anyway? Is it glitter?"
    Merel "这些小玻璃瓶里装的是什么？闪粉吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1638
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_de5a3410_1:

    # Nienke "Partially. It’s a mixture of stuff, but it’s mostly coloured sand."
    Nienke "有一点。混了几种东西，不过主要是彩砂。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1640
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b590c683_1:

    # Merel "Ooh! I see."
    Merel "哦！这样啊。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1642
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_852d0805_1:

    # Merel "It’s pretty. Where do you get it from?"
    Merel "真漂亮。你在哪儿买的？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1644
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_cab0e057_1:

    # Nienke "Craft shops, mostly. I used to play around with it as a child, and I guess I never could bring myself to throw it away..."
    Nienke "主要是在手工店。小时候常拿来玩，后来就一直舍不得扔……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1645
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_66b8ecf9_1:

    # "Kind of like Cornelia, I guess, and her sticker books."
    "大概就像科妮莉娅舍不得她的贴纸册一样。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1646
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_61856a56_1:

    # "I’m a little worried that Merel might poke fun at me over this, but her lip doesn’t curl. Instead, she smiles reassuringly as she says..."
    "我有点担心梅蕾尔会拿这事笑我，可她并没有露出讥笑的神情，反而安慰似的朝我笑了笑，说……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1648
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9e24faf1_1:

    # Merel "That’s pretty cool, hehe. I like stuff like this too, which is all delicate and pretty..."
    Merel "挺好的呀，嘿嘿。我也喜欢这种精致漂亮的小东西……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1650
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_64b4d491_1:

    # Merel "But I dunno if there’d be much point in me havin’ a bunch of dainty jars like this in my room."
    Merel "不过，我房间里要摆一堆这么娇气的小罐子，好像也没什么用。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1652
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2a1daf1e_1:

    # Merel "It’s so dark in Mors Paravail, I wouldn’t be able to appreciate them properly. I don’t think they’d shimmer right — and besides, I’m so clumsy, I’d probably knock everything over!"
    Merel "莫尔斯·帕拉维尔太暗了，都没法好好欣赏，估计也闪不起来。而且，我这么笨手笨脚，说不定一不小心全碰倒了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1654
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5aee7b70_1:

    # "Hmm. I appreciate how upfront Merel’s being, but this statement doesn’t exactly fill me with confidence."
    "嗯。她坦诚是好事，可这番话实在没法让我放心。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1656
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_33972cdb_1:

    # Nienke "Well, I would appreciate it if you could mind my things. I have quite a lot of delicate things on the shelves, and I’ve been collecting this stuff for years."
    Nienke "那还是请你小心一点。架子上不少东西都很脆弱，我收集了好多年。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1658
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_ffabeb99_1:

    # Nienke "Don’t break anything. In fact—"
    Nienke "别弄坏任何东西。还有——"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1659
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_658d458c_1:

    # "I suddenly append, my voice sharp, as Merel reaches out for a little snowglobe on my bedside table."
    "她伸手去拿床头柜上的一个小水晶球，我立刻补了一句，声音也严厉起来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1661
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_62c1b5dd_1:

    # Nienke "—maybe you shouldn’t touch anything either, just to be on the safe side."
    Nienke "——保险起见，最好什么也别碰。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1663
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_6f450709_1:

    # Merel "Right..."
    Merel "好吧……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1665
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_731aa7ef_1:

    # "Merel draws her hand away from the snowglobe (it was a gift from Cornelia), as though burned. She smiles at me bashfully, running a hand through her hair, and says..."
    "梅蕾尔像被烫到似的，缩回了伸向水晶球的手——那是科妮莉娅送的。她不好意思地笑着，抬手捋了捋头发，说……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1666
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_18bef71b_1:

    # Merel "Of course! I should know better than to go poking around at your things, Niene — um, Nienke."
    Merel "当然！我不该乱动你的东西，妮妮——呃，妮恩克。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1670
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_23c12952_1:

    # Merel "I’m sorry. It was thoughtless of me — but I am kinda curious. I’ve never been in a room this girly before."
    Merel "对不起，是我没想周到。不过，我真的有点好奇，从没进过这么少女的房间。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1672
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_168d33ff_1:

    # Merel "There’s so many bits and pieces everywhere ,and it’s all so light and bright, too. It’s adorable!"
    Merel "到处都是小玩意儿，又明亮又清新，太可爱了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1674
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5157c8b0_1:

    # Merel "I love all of the stuffed animals, and all of your hats..."
    Merel "这些毛绒玩具我都好喜欢，还有你的帽子……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1676
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0555ac5b_1:

    # Merel "Oh, and the little gardens, too! Did you make these yourself?"
    Merel "啊，还有这些小花园！都是你自己做的吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1678
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_6c016a04_1:

    # Nienke "Mostly, yes. You should mind them, though. They’re quite delicate."
    Nienke "大部分是。不过要小心，很容易弄坏。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1680
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_7835981a_1:

    # Merel "They look like it, yeah. They’re all so neatly arranged. This one here is beautiful, with all of the little flowers. What are they...?"
    Merel "看得出来，摆得真整齐。这个真漂亮，有好多小花。都是什么花呀……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1682
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2b78019b_1:

    # Nienke "Primroses, mostly, and the small white flowers are daisies."
    Nienke "主要是报春花。那些白色小花是雏菊。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1684
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a5f73553_1:

    # Merel "Daisies, hmm? My mother always says that they’re weeds, but they look so nice in your little garden. How do you preserve them?"
    Merel "雏菊啊？妈妈总说那是杂草，可放在你的小花园里真好看。怎么保存它们呢？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1686
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_cbb4c306_1:

    # Nienke "I dry them out, so it takes longer for them to waste away. I do need to replace the flowers inside them every once in a while, of course, but I don’t mind that. I actually like keeping my hands busy."
    Nienke "我会先做成干花，这样能多放一段时间。当然，里面的花还是得隔一阵换一次。不过我不介意，反而挺喜欢动手做点东西。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1688
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_21ab7d32_1:

    # Merel "I can tell! Your room tells me that you’re a creative girl."
    Merel "看得出来！光看房间，就知道你是个有创意的姑娘。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1690
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e85951c6_1:

    # Merel "I’m glad you’ve found so many things to do now you’re living in Alpenrose. Do you like it here, then?"
    Merel "搬来阿尔彭罗瑟后，能找到这么多事做，真替你开心。你喜欢这里吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1692
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_19d230ac_1:

    # Nienke "It’s...{w} alright, I guess."
    Nienke "……{w}还好吧。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1693
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_85b8c7c6_1:

    # "I reply, a little muted."
    "我的回答有些低落。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1695
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_73041b0a_1:

    # "I don’t hate this village, but it’s been feeling a bit dull and drab in Cornelia’s absence."
    "我不讨厌村子。可科妮莉娅不在，连这里也变得有点灰暗乏味。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1697
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_fce36690_1:

    # "I can’t deny that I’ve been missing her..."
    "不能否认，我很想她……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1699
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_f2f39ec5_1:

    # "But I can’t exactly tell Merel that. I hardly know her. I’m not about to start pouring my secrets into the hands of a stranger."
    "可这些没法告诉梅蕾尔。我和她又不熟，不打算把心事一股脑交给陌生人。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1700
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e2c07ffa_1:

    # "I clear my throat, swallowing down my remorse over Cornelia, then say..."
    "我清清嗓子，把关于科妮莉娅的失落咽回去，说……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1702
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_82301b64_1:

    # Nienke "But it would be better, I think, if I had a little more room to myself."
    Nienke "不过，要是我自己的地方能再宽敞些，就更好了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1704
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d94e7656_1:

    # Nienke "My bedroom was small even before I knew you were going to be staying here. There’s so little room, I don’t know what to do..."
    Nienke "还不知道你要来住之前，房间就已经很小了。现在这么挤，我真不知道怎么办……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1706
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3728605f_1:

    # Merel "What? Oh, that’s fine! I know it’s probably a bit inconvenient, me comin’ here and all, but you don’t need to do anythin’ special for me!"
    Merel "什么？啊，没关系呀！我知道突然过来是有点添麻烦，不过不用特地为我准备什么！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1710
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_17b19273_1:

    # Merel "I ain’t fussy about where I sleep. I mean, I’m an elf from Mors Paravail. We’re a hardy sort, hehe."
    Merel "睡哪儿我都不挑。我可是莫尔斯·帕拉维尔来的精灵，结实着呢，嘿嘿。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1711
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_caff6af9_1:

    # Merel "My mother says we ain’t nothing like the fancy-schmancy town elves who think they’re better’n everyone..."
    Merel "妈妈说，我们可不像城里那些讲究这讲究那、总觉得高人一等的精灵……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1713
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0822a8e2_1:

    # Merel "Um, no offence meant?"
    Merel "呃，没有冒犯你的意思？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1714
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_814ae357_1:

    # "Some offence {i}was{/i} taken, actually, but I don’t say anything about it. What would be the point?"
    "其实{i}已经{/i}有点被冒犯了。不过，我没说。说了又有什么用？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1715
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_7b703739_1:

    # Merel "Anyhow! I’m used to sleeping in some uncomfortable circumstances, so you ain’t gotta worry about settin’ me up a separate bed or anything!"
    Merel "总之！不舒服的地方我也睡惯了，不用担心给我另铺一张床什么的！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1717
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b18d5005_1:

    # Nienke "I beg your pardon?"
    Nienke "你说什么？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1718
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_47e14653_1:

    # "I was planning to make Merel a nest for her on the floor with some spare pillows and sheets (we don’t have a spare mattress), but doesn’t she want that?"
    "我原本打算拿备用枕头和床单，在地上给她铺个窝——我们没有多余的床垫——难道她连这个都不要？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1720
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4e0b34ee_1:

    # Nienke "You aren’t going to sleep on the floorboards, are you, without anything to cover you?"
    Nienke "你该不会准备什么也不盖，直接睡地板吧？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1722
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_c72e8e9d_1:

    # Merel "D’you want me to?"
    Merel "你想让我那样睡吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1724
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9cfe8e89_1:

    # Merel "That miiiiight be a little hardcore, even for me. I’m afraid I’d wake up with a bad back."
    Merel "那可就有——点太狠了，连我也吃不消。怕是醒来腰都要断。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1726
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_657064f3_1:

    # Merel "I don’t wanna wind up with bruises all over by the end of this trip, so I reckon I can just share your bed!"
    Merel "我可不想这一趟下来，浑身都是瘀青。所以，和你挤一张床就好啦！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1732
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_808ff63b_1:

    # "Merel declares, making a beeline for it. She takes a seat on the side of my bed, disturbing a few of my plushies, including the cute flopsy bunny that Cornelia won for me, and says..."
    "她一边宣布，一边直奔我的床，坐在床沿上，挤乱了几个毛绒玩具，包括科妮莉娅赢给我的垂耳兔。她又问……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1734
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_7418ce32_1:

    # Merel "How does that sound? D’you mind?"
    Merel "怎么样？你介意吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1739
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_8109138a_1:

    # Nienke "Um."
    Nienke "呃。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1740
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_c19dcc98_1:

    # "I look at Merel flatly, my arms folded."
    "我抱着胳膊，面无表情地看着她。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1741
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2006fac6_1:

    # "I think I know what she said, but it’s still hard for me to wrap my head around."
    "她说的每个字我应该都听懂了，可合在一起，实在难以理解。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1743
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_931665dd_1:

    # "How can one upstart elf be so audacious?!"
    "哪来的精灵，怎么能这么厚脸皮？！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1748
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5e17ea92_1:

    # Merel "Oh? Is somethin’ wrong?"
    Merel "哦？有啥问题吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1749
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9bac228f_1:

    # Nienke "Yes, somethin’ — I mean, some{i}thing{/i}’s wrong! Something’s very, {i}very{/i} wrong!"
    Nienke "当然有啥——我是说，当然有{i}问题{/i}！问题还很大，{i}非常{/i}大！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1751
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3db6988a_1:

    # Nienke "I can’t just let you share my bed!"
    Nienke "我怎么能让你跟我睡一张床！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1753
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_861009f6_1:

    # Merel "Whaaat? Why not?"
    Merel "为什么呀——？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1755
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_ebfcee6f_1:

    # Nienke "For one thing, it’s my bed, not yours! It’s where {i}I{/i} sleep — and for another, I hardly know you. We’re still strangers!"
    Nienke "首先，这是我的床，不是你的！是{i}我{/i}睡觉的地方！其次，我根本不了解你，我们还是陌生人！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1757
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_cebd75f8_1:

    # Merel "What? That’s not true! We do know one another! We used to hang out all of the time when we were kids!"
    Merel "什么？才不是！我们认识呀！小时候，我们整天都在一起玩！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1759
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_6aea79d2_1:

    # Nienke "Yes, you keep saying that, but I don’t remember you!"
    Nienke "是，你一直这么说，可我不记得你了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1761
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_053306c2_1:

    # Nienke "I just don’t think I’d feel comfortable sharing a bed with you. It feels much too soon!"
    Nienke "和你睡一张床，我会不自在。这也太快了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1762
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3a7d70fd_1:

    # "I think I’m being pretty reasonable, but..."
    "我觉得这要求相当合理，可……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1764
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5cef1426_1:

    # Merel "Aw, c’mon, Nienke! Don’t be so grouchy!"
    Merel "哎呀，妮恩克，别板着脸嘛！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1765
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_52b01d1d_1:

    # "Merel pouts, then slings an arm over my shoulder."
    "梅蕾尔撅起嘴，顺手把胳膊搭在我肩上。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1766
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_7b8019d4_1:

    # Merel "There ain’t nothin’ wrong with me! I’m just an elf, same as you!"
    Merel "我又没什么问题！和你一样，都是精灵嘛！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1770
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_441dcf2f_1:

    # Merel "We’ve got more in common than we haven’t, and there ain’t nothin’ inherently intimate about sharing a bed! People do it all the time over in Mors Paravail!"
    Merel "我们的共同点比不同点多多了，睡一张床也不一定就有什么亲密的意思！莫尔斯·帕拉维尔大家都这么睡！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1771
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a6ddee27_1:

    # Merel "There ain’t all that much space there, and it can get pretty cold: especially during the winter."
    Merel "那里地方不大，还挺冷，尤其是冬天。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1773
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9a22c1f1_1:

    # Merel "We always snuggle up when the cold weather sets in: siblings and parents and even friends!"
    Merel "天气一冷，我们就挤在一起。兄弟姐妹、爸妈，甚至朋友，都会这样！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1774
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0d2d3c9b_1:

    # Merel "I’m so used to sleeping with my granny, and I’ve been worrying I won’t be able to get any shut-eye if I have to sleep here on my own!"
    Merel "我早就习惯和奶奶一起睡了。这次出来，还担心一个人睡会不会睡不着呢！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1776
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_372bd5d0_1:

    # Merel "Won’t you let me join you in the bed? Please, Nienke? Please, please, pretty please? Help a fellow long-ear out, why don’t’cha?"
    Merel "让我跟你一起睡，好不好？求你了，妮恩克！求你求你，行行好嘛！帮帮同是长耳朵的同胞呗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1778
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0a467c18_1:

    # Nienke "Y-You..."
    Nienke "你、你……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1780
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_16171150_1:

    # "I tense beneath Merel’s arm, which is still slung casually over my shoulder: too casually, as though she takes my company for granted — and maybe she does."
    "她的胳膊还随随便便搭在我肩上，我全身都绷紧了。随便得过头，像理所当然地认定我会陪着她。也许她确实是这么想的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1782
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a94d042d_1:

    # "She seems to think that, because we’re both elves, I have some sort of karmic duty to make exceptions towards her, and to be her friend."
    "她似乎觉得，既然同为精灵，我就天生有义务对她网开一面，和她做朋友。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1783
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_830c67b4_1:

    # "It’s like she believes she’s owed my companionship and my closeness, all because we’re elves (or ‘long-ears’, as she put it), but..."
    "好像就因为我们都是精灵——或者按她的话说，是“长耳朵”——我就欠她一份陪伴和亲近。可是……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1785
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_f42292f9_1:

    # Nienke "Stop it! You’re being ridiculous!"
    Nienke "够了！你简直莫名其妙！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1787
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_965fd37d_1:

    # "I turn my back on Merel, my arms folded. My hair whips about me, while Merel laughs lightly in the background."
    "我抱紧胳膊，转过身背对着她，长发甩到身后。梅蕾尔在后面轻轻笑了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1789
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_6f88d660_1:

    # Merel "Ha! Tough crowd, eh? I figured you’d be willin’ to play nice, at least, ’cause we’re both elves..."
    Merel "哈，真难讨好呀？我还想着，都是精灵，你至少会给点面子嘛……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1791
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_94c54add_1:

    # Merel "And your bed ain’t {i}that{/i} small, Nienke!"
    Merel "而且，妮恩克，你的床也没{i}那么{/i}小呀！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1793
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_06df0893_1:

    # Merel "Won’t you be willin’ to move a few of your stuffed animals? There should be space enough for both of us then, if you’re willin’ to make it?"
    Merel "挪开几个毛绒玩具，不行吗？只要你愿意腾腾地方，肯定够我们两个人睡！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1795
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_27488d3a_1:

    # "She’s...{w} not wrong about that, I guess. My bed isn’t all that small: it just looks like it is, on account of all of the plushies I have piled up on it."
    "这倒……{w}也没说错。床本身不算很小，只是堆了太多毛绒玩具，才显得这么窄。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1797
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_04c1fd79_1:

    # "If I moved them, there probably would be enough room for Merel to join me, but..."
    "把它们搬开，大概确实能让她也睡上来。可是……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1799
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_637f0246_1:

    # Nienke "I-I don’t see why I should have to accommodate you. Elves might sleep together in Mors Paravail, but you aren’t there anymore! You’re in my parents’ house in Alpenrose, and this is {i}my{/i} bedroom!"
    Nienke "我、我凭什么要迁就你？莫尔斯·帕拉维尔的精灵也许习惯一起睡，可这里不是那里！这里是阿尔彭罗瑟，是我爸妈的家，这间是{i}我的{/i}卧室！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1800
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_48fc403b_1:

    # Nienke "You’re a guest, and you’re scarcely even an acquaintance. I don’t see why I should have to make space for you when I only knew you were coming here yesterday!"
    Nienke "你是客人，连认识都算不上。我昨天才知道你要来，为什么现在就非得给你腾地方？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1802
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4f492bfd_1:

    # Nienke "You’re being way too pushy!"
    Nienke "你也太强人所难了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1804
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2f2b1758_1:

    # Merel "Pushy, am I...?"
    Merel "我强人所难了……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1809
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_37e9f029_1:

    # "I don’t expect this to really rankle Merel, but she actually seems a bit put out. She frowns, then says..."
    "本以为这话不会真的打击到她，可她竟显得有点受伤。她皱起眉头，说……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1810
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_53ecdda0_1:

    # Merel "Hmm. I guess you might have a point. I know I can come on pretty strong, but I was just tryin’ to be friendly."
    Merel "嗯，也许你说得对。我知道自己有时热情过头，可我只是想和你亲近一点。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1812
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_f56c6f18_1:

    # Merel "I really wanted to try gettin’ on with you, Nienke. I was lookin’ forward to being all buddy-buddy with you."
    Merel "我是真的想和你好好相处，妮恩克。还盼着我们能亲亲热热的，像从前一样。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1814
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4485bffe_1:

    # Merel "I thought it might be fun..."
    Merel "我觉得，那一定很开心……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1819
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b75489ba_1:

    # Merel "But maybe I took things too far."
    Merel "不过，也许是我太过分了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1821
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9bd9c94f_1:

    # Merel "You don’t hate me now, do you?"
    Merel "你现在不会讨厌我了吧？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1823
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_830ae5bf_1:

    # Nienke "N-No, um... I-I don’t hate you. It’s just..."
    Nienke "没、没有，那个……我、我不讨厌你。只是……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1825
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4ea33ac8_1:

    # "Urgh. Talk about awkward."
    "唉。太尴尬了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1827
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_19deea45_1:

    # Nienke "This is...{w} a lot to get my head around."
    Nienke "这一下……{w}让我接受这么多，我转不过来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1829
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_8e6896bc_1:

    # Nienke "I-I mean, you might be used to living in a community, but I’m used to being alone. I don’t know how it is for dark elves, but I prefer having a bit of privacy..."
    Nienke "我、我是说，你也许习惯和大家一起生活，可我习惯了独处。暗精灵那边是什么样，我不知道，但我更喜欢有一点自己的空间……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1831
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_129c2922_1:

    # Merel "Privacy?"
    Merel "自己的空间？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1833
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2280dc88_1:

    # "Merel inclines her head, her nose wrinkled, as though ‘privacy’ is a wholly foreign concept to her."
    "梅蕾尔歪着头，皱起鼻子，仿佛这对她来说是个完全陌生的概念。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1835
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_dcd7e066_1:

    # Merel "I guess I get that, and I know this is gonna be a hassle for you, but I don’t know if there are any alternatives."
    Merel "我大概明白，也知道这样会给你添麻烦。可好像没有别的办法了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1836
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d5f88fb8_1:

    # Merel "There ain’t really anywhere else for me to go, unless you want to set up a nest for me on the floor, but wouldn’t that be a pain on its own?"
    Merel "也没别的地方能睡呀。除非你给我打地铺，可那不也挺麻烦的吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1837
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_96e3440d_1:

    # Merel "It’d be way easier to just let me share the bed with you. All you’d have to do is move a few stuffed toys. Then, we can snuggle up together under the sheets."
    Merel "直接让我一起睡床，省事多了。你只要挪开几个毛绒玩具，我们就能盖着被子，暖暖和和地睡啦。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1839
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_15ab326c_1:

    # Merel "It’ll be like one big girly sleepover! I’ve always dreamed of experiencing something like that, hehe."
    Merel "就像女孩子们的睡衣派对！我一直梦想着能体验一回呢，嘿嘿。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1841
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5e66915d_1:

    # "Hmm. Well, I guess having a big, girly sleepover doesn’t sound too bad. I’ve had several sleepovers with Cornelia before: typically at her house, since it’s bigger than mine."
    "嗯，睡衣派对听起来倒不坏。以前我和科妮莉娅也一起过过好多次夜，通常在她家，因为她家更大。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1845
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_01cf86a4_1:

    # "There’s barely enough space for me and Engelmund in my room, without adding Merel into the mix. I’m afraid there isn’t going to be enough room, no matter how Merel tries to talk me over, but..."
    "我的房间光住我和恩格尔蒙德就够挤了，还要塞进梅蕾尔。无论她怎么劝，我都担心地方不够，可……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1847
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_09137088_1:

    # Merel "Really, really!"
    Merel "真的，真的！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1849
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4bb849ba_1:

    # Merel "I don’t wanna put you out, Nienke. You don’t need to make up a whole other bed for me. I reckon that’d be way more trouble than it’s worth."
    Merel "妮恩克，我不想给你添麻烦。不用专门再铺一张床，我觉得那才是瞎折腾。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1850
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_1a267e22_1:

    # Merel "I don’t wanna cause any problems—"
    Merel "我不想惹麻烦——"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1852
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3e0f2ef5_1:

    # "It’s too late for that. She’s {i}already{/i} causing problems!"
    "晚了。你{i}已经{/i}在惹麻烦了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1854
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_abbc4e47_1:

    # Merel "—so let’s just do this. It’s the easiest route to take, right?"
    Merel "——所以就这样吧。这样最简单，不是吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1858
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0b6de38e_1:

    # Merel "We can sleep together under the same sheets, an’ we’ll both be nice and warm!"
    Merel "我们盖一条被子一起睡，两个人都暖和！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1859
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b1bc2ad8_1:

    # Merel "I don’t need to spend the night shiverin’ on the floor, and you don’t need to risk steppin’ on me if you wake up in the night to use the bathroom, or to get a drink. It’ll be win-win!"
    Merel "我不用在地上冻一夜，你半夜起来上厕所或喝水，也不怕踩到我。两全其美！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1860
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e6129ad3_1:

    # Merel "’Sides, you said it yourself. Your room’s small, so there’s not much room. You can’t really give up a load of floor space for little old me, can you?"
    Merel "再说了，你自己也说房间小嘛。总不能为了我这小小一个人，占掉一大片地板吧？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1862
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_995c1227_1:

    # "‘Little old me’, she calls herself. That’s funny."
    "“小小一个人”。她还真好意思说。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1864
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_fadad55d_1:

    # "There’s nothing ‘little’ about Merel at all. She’s a good head taller than I am, and she’s muscular alongside it. If she wanted, she could probably pick me up and throw me straight through the window."
    "梅蕾尔哪里“小”了？她足足比我高一头，还一身肌肉。只要愿意，说不定能把我拎起来，直接从窗户扔出去。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1865
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_55afb303_1:

    # "I’m going to hope that Merel doesn’t do that (I don’t think it would be a good way to treat your hostess), but you can never be too careful."
    "希望她别这么做——这么对待主人，可不算有礼貌——不过，小心点总没错。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1867
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_19477403_1:

    # "I don’t know Merel all that well..."
    "我对她还很陌生……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1869
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_eed1afb2_1:

    # "But I want to believe she doesn’t mean any ill will."
    "可我还是想相信，她没有恶意。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1871
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_6dccedc8_1:

    # "She seems friendly enough, at least, even if she has thrown my routine all out of order by arriving here much too early."
    "至少，看上去挺友善。虽然来得太早，把我日常的安排全打乱了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1873
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d936f4b5_1:

    # Merel "Please, Nienke! Please, please, please! I have always wanted to share a bed with a girl my age!"
    Merel "求你了，妮恩克！求你求你求你！我一直想和同龄的女孩子睡同一张床！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1875
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5321f74a_1:

    # Merel "Mors Paravail is one thing, but this room’s like something from a dream! I’d love to sleep in a bed this light and fluffy. It’s like one big pancake — or maybe a soufflé!"
    Merel "莫尔斯·帕拉维尔是一回事，可这间房简直像梦里的一样！我也想睡这么轻软蓬松的床，像一整张大煎饼——也许是舒芙蕾！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1876
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_bfeb3534_1:

    # Merel "Won’t you let me join you?"
    Merel "让我一起睡，好不好？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1878
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b9aa59c7_5:

    # Nienke "Well..."
    Nienke "嗯……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1879
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e69401e4_1:

    # "I waver. I’m not entirely sold on this suggestion, but..."
    "我动摇了。虽然还没有完全被说服，可……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1881
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_004af9c8_1:

    # Nienke "Are you sure you don’t mind sleeping in the same bed as me?"
    Nienke "你确定，不介意和我睡同一张床？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1884
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_dd7c06ef_1:

    # Merel "Yes, I’m sure!"
    Merel "确定！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1886
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_91540794_1:

    # Nienke "And you won’t squirm about, or complain that there’s not enough space?"
    Nienke "也不会乱动，不会嫌地方不够？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1889
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_8580afb1_1:

    # Merel "I would never! I’ll be on my very best behaviour, Nienke, I promise!"
    Merel "绝对不会！妮恩克，我一定乖乖的，我保证！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1891
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2dd9e02a_1:

    # Nienke "Hmm..."
    Nienke "嗯……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1895
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a24e14cd_1:

    # "I press my lips together ponderously. I’m still not entirely convinced, but..."
    "我抿着嘴，犹豫不决，还是没法完全放心。不过……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1897
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d53c862e_1:

    # Nienke "...Alright. I suppose it would be easier to let you sleep in the bed, rather than on the floor. It’ll spare me a little bit of time, at least..."
    Nienke "……好吧。让你睡床，好像确实比打地铺方便。至少还能省点时间……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1899
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_8ffe050d_1:

    # Nienke "But you have to promise to behave yourself."
    Nienke "不过，你必须保证规矩一点。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1904
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3eb75ac9_1:

    # Merel "Of course I will! I’ll be sure to give you some space, Nienke — or as much space as I can give you, I guess, while we’ll both be in the same bed. Your bed ain’t all that big, but I think we can make up some space."
    Merel "当然！我会给你留空间的，妮恩克。嗯，两个人睡同一张床，能留多少就留多少吧。床是不算很大，但挤一挤总有地方。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1906
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_80360f3f_1:

    # Merel "Do you mind if I move the plushies, Nienke?"
    Merel "那我把玩偶挪开，你不介意吧，妮恩克？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1908
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_22b16a6d_1:

    # "{i}Yes, I do! I mind a lot, actually. Leave my plushies alone! The bunny was a gift from Cornelia!{/i}"
    "{i}介意！我非常介意！别碰我的毛绒玩具！那只兔子是科妮莉娅送的！{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1910
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d05b3ecd_1:

    # "That’s what I’d like to tell Merel, but I can’t see the point in it. Being too defensive would only invite more questions — and anyway, Merel doesn’t even know who Cornelia is."
    "我很想这么说，可想想也没用。反应过头只会招来更多追问，何况，梅蕾尔根本不知道科妮莉娅是谁。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1912
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_65062407_1:

    # "I’m not in the mood to get stuck into my complicated feelings about my childhood friend, who abandoned me and this village to go to Utrecht, so I’ll not mention it."
    "关于那个丢下我、丢下村子，跑去乌得勒支的儿时好友，我的心情有多复杂，我现在实在不想解释。所以，还是不提了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1913
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_045bd969_1:

    # Nienke "...Yes, it’s fine. Just be careful with my things, alright? Some of these plushies are precious to me."
    Nienke "……嗯，没关系。不过请小心一点，好吗？有几个玩偶对我很重要。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1915
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_cac56100_1:

    # Merel "Aye, aye, Captain!"
    Merel "遵命，船长！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1916
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_f54ca957_1:

    # "Merel beams and gives me a salute."
    "梅蕾尔笑容灿烂，朝我敬了个礼。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1920
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e73e9dd2_1:

    # Merel "I’ll be really, really careful. That’s what they all called me, y’know, back at home: capable Merel of the clever hands! You’ll not meet any elves who’re as good at shooting a bow and arrow as I am!"
    Merel "我会特别、特别小心的！你知道吗，在老家，大家都叫我心灵手巧的梅蕾尔！论射箭，你找不到比我更厉害的精灵！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1922
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_eaab16e6_1:

    # Nienke "Well, I don’t doubt that, if only because I don’t remember meeting any other dark elves before..."
    Nienke "这一点我倒不怀疑，毕竟，我不记得自己还见过其他暗精灵……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1924
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0d7ef382_1:

    # Nienke "But I don’t see what that has to do with you staying in my room."
    Nienke "不过，这和你住我的房间有什么关系？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1926
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e1143bbd_1:

    # Merel "It doesn’t, really..."
    Merel "嗯，其实没什么关系……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1928
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9eb59bda_1:

    # "That’s what I thought."
    "我就知道。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1930
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3b06b5b2_1:

    # Merel "...but I thought it might reassure you to know how careful I am! I’m not gonna drop any of your things, Nienke, I promise!"
    Merel "……不过，让你知道我手有多稳，应该能放心点吧！妮恩克，我保证，绝不会把你的东西摔了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1932
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_21b579eb_1:

    # Nienke "Well, I would hope not..."
    Nienke "最好是这样……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1940
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_52237703_1:

    # "I sigh as Merel starts to shift my belongings. She sure didn’t waste much time..."
    "我叹了口气，看着她动手搬我的东西。还真是一点时间都不耽误……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1941
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0da57e39_1:

    # "But, then again, she didn’t waste much time peering at all of my terrariums, or my collection of shining sand either."
    "不过，她刚才看我的玻璃花园和闪光彩砂时，也一样迫不及待。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1943
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_90067357_1:

    # "I don’t know if Merel really understands the concept of personal space — and, if she does, she doesn’t appreciate it."
    "我真怀疑，她到底懂不懂什么叫私人空间。就算懂，大概也不在乎。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1945
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b74af19e_1:

    # "I’m afraid that this is going to be unbearable..."
    "这下怕是有得受了……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1947
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0fb5bdab_1:

    # "But she’ll only be living with us for a week. After that, she’ll go back to Mors Paravail, and I won’t need to see her again."
    "不过，也只住一星期。之后她就回莫尔斯·帕拉维尔，我再也不用见她。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1949
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_63bc12f6_1:

    # "It should be fine. I can manage one week, right?"
    "应该没事的。一个星期，总熬得过去吧？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1951
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9e74fd0a_1:

    # "I watch from a distance, sitting at my vanity table, while Merel unpacks."
    "我坐在梳妆台前，远远看着梅蕾尔收拾行李。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1952
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_71f5012c_1:

    # "She didn’t bring all that much with her, thank goodness, so she only has a few clothes and a hairbrush. She didn’t even bring any toiletries, or a towel."
    "谢天谢地，她带的东西不多，只有几件衣服和一把梳子。连洗漱用品和毛巾都没带。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1962
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3ed2e53b_1:

    # "I ask her about this, and Merel smiles and says..."
    "我问起这事，她笑着说……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1964
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_744c2a79_1:

    # Merel "I thought I could borrow yours. You don’t mind, do you, Nienke?"
    Merel "我想着借你的就行。妮恩克，你不介意吧？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1966
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2f80dc95_1:

    # "Well, of course she thought she could borrow mine. That’s just the sort of person Merel is: grabby and greedy. What a joke."
    "当然，她当然想着借我的。她就是这种人，什么都想拿，什么便宜都想占。真可笑。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1968
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_7c109d34_1:

    # Nienke "I wouldn’t say that I don’t mind..."
    Nienke "要说不介意，也谈不上……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1970
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4e8c30a3_1:

    # Nienke "But sure. You can borrow some of my things for as long as you’re here. I can’t exactly let you go without a towel..."
    Nienke "不过，好吧。住在这里时，可以借你一些东西。总不能连毛巾都不让你用……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1973
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_490c214d_1:

    # Merel "Yay! Thank you, Nienke {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"
    Merel "太好了！谢谢你，妮恩克！{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1975
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_04ab7107_1:

    # Merel "I knew that I could rely on you!"
    Merel "我就知道，你最靠得住了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1977
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a1ca211c_1:

    # Nienke "Yeah, yeah..."
    Nienke "好，好……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1979
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_dd711e5e_1:

    # "I reply to Merel’s enthusiasm with a roll of my eyes. I don’t want to seem too invested myself. It’s not like I care about her opinion or anything."
    "面对她的热情，我只翻了个白眼。不想显得自己也太上心。我又不是在意她怎么看我。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1984
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9d27d886_1:

    # "In any case, Merel finishes unpacking pretty quickly. She stashes her belongings away inside the drawer of my bedside table, stands, then beams at me and says..."
    "总之，她很快就收拾好了。把东西塞进我的床头柜抽屉，站起来，冲我灿烂地笑着说……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1986
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_8f0740fd_1:

    # Merel "Now, why don’t you show me around a little?"
    Merel "那现在，带我逛逛怎么样？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1988
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_483180b3_1:

    # Nienke "Around the house, you mean?"
    Nienke "你是说，看看家里？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1990
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_6c132952_1:

    # Merel "Well, you {i}could{/i} do that, but I get the feeling I’ve seen mostly everything already."
    Merel "家里也{i}可以{/i}呀，不过感觉我已经看得差不多了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1994
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a4a3fa7c_1:

    # Merel "No, I was thinkin’ it’d be nice to see a bit more of Alpenrose, and maybe the fields around it. Do you mind?"
    Merel "我是想，再看看阿尔彭罗瑟，还有附近的田野。你愿意吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:1996
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b9aa59c7_6:

    # Nienke "Well..."
    Nienke "嗯……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2004
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4b14433f_1:

    # "I frown. I’m not sure if I really want to go traipsing around: especially not with Merel."
    "我皱起眉。不确定自己想不想到处走，尤其是和梅蕾尔一起。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2006
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2e831d8b_1:

    # "I used to draw curious stares whenever I wandered about the village, when I first came here, because of my pointed ears. People would stop and stare at me, wondering who I was and where I’d come from."
    "刚来这里时，每次在村里走动，我的尖耳朵都会引来好奇的目光。人们停下脚步盯着我，琢磨我是谁，又是从哪里来的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2008
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_ccdf1676_1:

    # "These curious stares began to taper away when I grew older, and the villagers of Alpenrose grew more accustomed to me."
    "后来，我慢慢长大，村民也渐渐习惯了我，好奇的目光才少下来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2009
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_207497b4_1:

    # "They knew that I was Elowen and Emiel’s daughter and I stopped being an object of interest."
    "他们知道，我是艾洛温和埃米尔的女儿，便不再觉得稀奇。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2011
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_10861ad5_1:

    # "As time elapsed, I became a regular fixture of Alpenrose. Nobody seemed to much care who I was or what I did..."
    "时间久了，我成了村里熟悉的一个身影。似乎没人在意我是谁，又在做什么……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2012
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_086cf4d8_1:

    # "Apart from the kids at school, that is, who used to tease me for the crime of merely existing."
    "当然，学校的孩子们除外。我只是存在着，就足够成为他们欺负我的理由。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2013
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_8989218f_1:

    # "That wasn’t much fun, perpetually having my things taken from me..."
    "自己的东西不断被抢走，那可不是什么愉快的经历……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2015
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_30ce3159_1:

    # "But I digress."
    "不过，我又想远了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2017
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_6cf99cf5_1:

    # "The people of Alpenrose might’ve gotten used to me, but I’m not sure how they’ll react to Merel."
    "村民也许习惯了我，可看见梅蕾尔，他们又会怎样？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2018
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_6d28e646_1:

    # "If the reactions of my peers back in primary school are anything to go by, I’m not sure if I want to find out, either."
    "想想小学同学以前的反应，我实在不想去验证。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2019
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4223ce3b_1:

    # "I think it would be easiest if we both remained indoors, away from prying eyes. It’s been a while since anybody gawped at me, and I’d like to keep it like that."
    "两个人都待在屋里，避开探究的视线，大概最省心。已经很久没人盯着我看了，我希望继续如此。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2021
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_cfd61ff3_1:

    # "I don’t want to be treated like an animal in a zoo..."
    "我不想被当成动物园里的动物……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2023
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_745d16de_1:

    # "But Merel is looking at me expectantly, and I know I can’t suggest that she stays inside during her entire visit."
    "可梅蕾尔正满怀期待地看着我。我知道，不能让她整个假期都窝在家里。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2024
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_af6de2b6_1:

    # "I don’t want to tell her she should stay indoors like a prisoner, solely because her presence might make other people feel uncomfortable."
    "总不能只因为别人可能看她不自在，就把她像囚犯一样关在屋里。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2025
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_717e5ae2_1:

    # "She hasn’t done anything wrong, even if she did ask me to move a bunch of my stuffed animals."
    "她又没做错什么。虽然，她确实让我挪走了一堆毛绒玩具。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2027
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0630786e_1:

    # "I’m still a little sore about that, but..."
    "这事我还有点耿耿于怀，不过……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2037
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_089df743_1:

    # Nienke "...Oh, alright. We can take a look around the village, but don’t expect too much. There’s not all that much to see."
    Nienke "……好吧。可以到村里逛逛，不过别抱太大期待。真没什么可看的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2039
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_649c8cf0_1:

    # Merel "You say that, but I’m still looking forward to it. I’m sure it’s more interesting than Mors Paravail."
    Merel "你这么说，我还是很期待呀。肯定比莫尔斯·帕拉维尔有意思。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2041
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a1f4e72e_1:

    # Merel "Half of that was underground, and the half which wasn’t was inside a cave. It was always so dark and dingy."
    Merel "那里一半在地下，另一半虽然不在地下，也在山洞里。总是又黑又暗的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2043
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0c5f40b9_1:

    # Merel "It’s a novel experience simply being able to look up and see the sky!"
    Merel "光是抬头就能看见天空，对我来说都很新鲜！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2045
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_75385735_1:

    # Nienke "Well, if a visible sky is the only criteria you want filled to have an interesting experience, then you should be alright."
    Nienke "嗯，如果你的要求只是看得见天，那这里应该够你觉得有意思了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2047
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b002c04d_1:

    # Nienke "I don’t think there’s anything all that special about the skies around here..."
    Nienke "不过，我不觉得这里的天空有什么特别……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2049
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_956fb63e_1:

    # Merel "You wouldn’t! You’re used to them!"
    Merel "你当然不觉得，你早就看惯了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2051
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_32cc631d_1:

    # Nienke "But there’s no harm in looking, I suppose."
    Nienke "但看看也没什么坏处吧。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2059
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_37cda407_1:

    # "That’s what I say, at least, though I do have a few doubts."
    "嘴上这么说，心里却仍有几分疑虑。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2060
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_7ce30708_1:

    # "I’m worried there might, indeed, be harm in looking: especially if we happen to run into Hendrik..."
    "我担心，出去看看或许还真有坏处。尤其是碰上亨德里克的话……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2062
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_c1ff2cb9_1:

    # "But it’s been a while since I crossed paths with those two. I’m sure everything will be fine."
    "不过，我已经有阵子没碰见那两个人了。应该不会有事。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2071
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b144740b_1:

    # "That’s what I try to tell myself as I tramp downstairs with Merel."
    "和梅蕾尔一起下楼时，我努力这么劝自己。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2072
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_05048906_1:

    # "I slide my shoes on at the back door (Merel follows suit), and then we head off, though I call over my shoulder at my parents to let them know where we’re going."
    "我在后门穿上鞋，梅蕾尔也跟着照做。出门前，我还回头朝爸妈喊了一声，告诉他们我们要去哪儿。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2073
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_eddfed7d_1:

    # "I feel like I shouldn’t need to bother with such affairs, but it’s the principle of the thing. I don’t want either of my parents fussing about me, even if I {i}am{/i} already twenty."
    "虽然觉得没必要连这点小事都报备，可这是规矩。我不想让爸妈担心，就算我{i}已经{/i}二十岁了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2074
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2295c612_1:

    # "My parents are such worrywarts."
    "他们实在太爱操心了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2085
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_6a79c4c7_1:

    # "I lead Merel briefly around Alpenrose, not that there’s all that much of Alpenrose to show her."
    "我带梅蕾尔在阿尔彭罗瑟简单转了一圈。其实也没多少地方可逛。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2086
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_76e229da_1:

    # "There’s the plaza, which is probably the most bustling part of the village, with the fountain in the middle, fringed on all sides by shops."
    "村里最热闹的地方大概就是广场了，中央有座喷泉，四周围着一圈店铺。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2087
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d6da32fa_1:

    # "Then, there are the shopping streets themselves, though there’s really only one main one, which leads away from the plaza."
    "再就是商店街。说是商店街，其实主要就一条，从广场向外延伸。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2088
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b41ec5d8_1:

    # "This street has the most important shops: the butcher’s and the greengrocer’s and the haberdasher’s and the post office."
    "最要紧的几家店都在这条街上：肉铺、蔬果店、针线杂货店，还有邮局。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2089
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d1ea482c_1:

    # "There’s a couple of other spindly, spidery side streets which branch off from the plaza in other directions, but the shops which line these streets are a little less practical."
    "广场还伸出几条细细弯弯的岔路，像蜘蛛腿一样通向别处。那里的店铺就没这么实用了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2090
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_7c5780d8_1:

    # "There’s the ancient antiques shop with the old mahogany dressers and drawers, and then there’s the second-hand bookshop run by the van der Lindens."
    "有家年头很久的古董店，摆着老旧的红木梳妆台和抽屉柜；还有范德林登一家开的二手书店。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2091
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_c927e273_1:

    # "There’s also this peculiar little shop which seems to sell occultic items: skulls and candlesticks and more skulls and old grimoires."
    "另有一家古怪的小店，卖的似乎都是些神秘学用品：骷髅头、烛台、更多的骷髅头，还有古老的魔法书。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2092
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_8eec4c73_1:

    # "I don’t really see the point in having a shop dedicated to such items when Alpenrose’s population is largely Christian, but the shop seems to be doing decent business."
    "阿尔彭罗瑟的居民大多信基督教，我不太明白在这里专卖这种东西有什么意义。不过，那家店的生意似乎还不错。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2093
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9877b1e7_1:

    # "It’s still open, at least, which is more than can be said for the various cafés which pop up like daisies, only to die."
    "至少它还开着呢。那些咖啡馆可就不一定了，像雏菊一样冒出头来，转眼又谢了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2094
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b4d6f9df_1:

    # "Speaking of cafés, there’s a handful of them. Small though Alpenrose is, Fleur de Lys isn’t the only café around."
    "说起咖啡馆，这里倒有好几家。阿尔彭罗瑟虽小，也不是只有我们家的百合花。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2095
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_70ed1cd9_1:

    # "There’s an old-fashioned tearoom — even more old-fashioned than Fleur de Lys — near the library called Sophie’s Atelier, and there’s another, more modern café by the art gallery called Astrolabe."
    "图书馆附近有家叫苏菲画室的老派茶室，比百合花还要老派。美术馆旁边则有家比较时新的咖啡馆，叫星盘。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2096
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0a3b3ac7_1:

    # "I’ve never been all that interested in Sophie’s Atelier (the titular Sophie is a stern, grumpy woman who doesn’t look like she’s ever once stepped foot in anything as artsy as an atelier), but I am a little interested in Astrolabe."
    "我对苏菲画室一直没什么兴趣——店主苏菲板着脸，脾气又差，看着完全不像踏足过画室这种艺术场所的人。不过，星盘倒让我有点好奇。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2097
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e567c044_1:

    # "Astrolabe is a relatively new shop which opened for business about two years ago."
    "星盘算是家新店，开业才两年左右。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2098
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4aa7a1f7_1:

    # "I’ve only ever been able to peek in through the windows, but even then, I’ve not been able to see very much because of the thick, heavy curtains."
    "我只隔着窗户往里面偷看过。偏偏窗帘又厚又重，看不见多少东西。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2099
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_cab1ced3_1:

    # "I’ve been able to see glimpses inside, though, to the dark walls which are painted all over with stars."
    "偶尔能瞥见一点里面的样子：深色的墙上画满了星星。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2100
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_350dad8f_1:

    # "I’d love to go inside and sample their desserts (apparently, they have an extensive amount of sweets on the menu), but I don’t dare."
    "我很想进去尝尝他们的甜点——听说菜单上的甜食种类特别多——可惜不敢。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2101
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_91e79d18_1:

    # "My parents are rather territorial, and I’m afraid they’d feel betrayed if they knew their own daughter had been fraternising with the enemy."
    "爸妈对自家地盘看得很紧。要是知道亲生女儿居然跑去跟敌人打交道，恐怕会觉得遭到了背叛。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2102
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3f81d8b9_1:

    # "I don’t want to upset my parents, so it’s best to keep my distance."
    "我不想惹他们伤心，还是保持距离为妙。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2103
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b90ce947_1:

    # "I keep pretending that I don’t want anything to do with Astrolabe, but like an unfaithful husband, my eyes still wander!"
    "所以我一直装作对星盘毫无兴趣，眼睛却像个不忠的丈夫一样，总忍不住往那边瞟！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2104
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_8c74efe4_1:

    # "I try to bustle Merel past Astrolabe, in any case, for fear she’ll want to duck inside. It seems like her kind of shop: much more so than the van der Lindens’s dusty bookshop."
    "总之，经过星盘时，我赶紧催梅蕾尔往前走，生怕她想进去。这店看着就合她的胃口，肯定比范德林登家灰扑扑的书店更合适。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2105
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_35cbc910_1:

    # "I show Merel all of the sights there are to see in Alpenrose and, to my relief..."
    "阿尔彭罗瑟能看的地方，我全带梅蕾尔看了个遍。让我松了口气的是……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2117
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_83f5e9a7_1:

    # Merel "Ooh, wow! This place is so cute! The buildings are all precious, and look at all the cobblestones!"
    Merel "哇，好可爱！这里的房子都好漂亮，还有这些石板路！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2118
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0694819f_1:

    # Merel "It’s like something from a fairytale. How could you think I wouldn’t like it here?!"
    Merel "简直像童话里走出来的一样。你怎么会觉得我不喜欢这里啊？！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2120
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_f8e5607c_1:

    # Nienke "Well, I don’t know what you like. I hardly know you — and don’t make so much noise, please. People are looking at us."
    Nienke "我又不知道你喜欢什么。我们都还不熟……还有，拜托你小点声。大家都在看我们。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2122
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_6ea79d82_1:

    # Merel "And? What’s wrong with that? If they want to look, let ’em!"
    Merel "所以呢？有什么关系？想看就让他们看呗！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2124
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_68adc289_1:

    # Nienke "What’s wrong with that, Merel, is that it’s embarrassing! I don’t want to be the centre of attention!"
    Nienke "关系就是很丢脸啊，梅蕾尔！我可不想让所有人都盯着我！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2126
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2f1d67bb_1:

    # Merel "You aren’t, though. Everybody here should know who you are already. If they’re staring at anybody, it’ll be me. I know I stand out a little, hehe!"
    Merel "可他们没在看你呀。这里的人应该早就认识你了。真要看，也是在看我。我知道自己有那么一点显眼，嘿嘿！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2128
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_1c3f18f8_1:

    # "I look at Merel, unamused, my lips pressed together. I scan her from tip to toe, taking in her pointed ears; her long, fair hair; her muscular arms and her toned, exposed stomach."
    "我抿着嘴，没好气地把梅蕾尔从头到脚打量了一遍。尖尖的耳朵，浅色的长发，结实的手臂，还有露在外面、线条分明的小腹。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2130
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_149efa3d_1:

    # "Then, I sigh."
    "然后，我叹了口气。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2132
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4aacfc3e_1:

    # Nienke "I think you stand out more than a little. It doesn’t really help that you’re so tall..."
    Nienke "我觉得可不止一点。谁让你长得那么高……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2134
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_54e48206_1:

    # "Or that her chest is so pronounced. It’s quite impressive, really."
    "胸部也那么突出。说真的，相当壮观。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2136
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_af015afe_1:

    # "Everything about Merel’s appearance is impressive. I can imagine a lot of women being envious of her good looks..."
    "梅蕾尔浑身上下都很惹眼。肯定有不少女孩子羡慕她这副好相貌……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2139
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_31319a81_1:

    # "N-Not that I care or anything. I’ve long since come to terms with my modest stature, and it suits me just fine!"
    "我、我倒没什么好在意的。我早就接受自己的小个子了，觉得这样也挺好！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2141
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3da8a730_1:

    # Merel "Well, yeah. I know I make quite the impression based on how huge I am. The elf ears aren’t gonna be doin’ me any favours either..."
    Merel "也是。我这么大一只，确实挺扎眼的。再加上这对精灵耳朵，想低调也难……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2143
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_34a2e07d_1:

    # Merel "But y’know, people would stare at me regardless, no matter what I do or say, ’cause of how I look. I don’t think there’s any changin’ that."
    Merel "不过你想啊，我长成这样，不管说什么、做什么，大家都会盯着我看。这也没办法改变吧。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2145
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_ed9c43f1_1:

    # Merel "People are always drawn to things they don’t understand. I’m unusual, so they’ll stare. It’s simple."
    Merel "人总会注意自己不了解的东西。我不常见，他们就多看几眼。就这么简单。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2147
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0a827bca_1:

    # Merel "I don’t see the point in changin’ up how I act any, to make these people happy. They’d look regardless, so I might as well be my usual charming self. Is there an issue with that?"
    Merel "为了讨他们高兴就改变自己，我觉得没意思。反正他们照样会看，那我还不如做平时那个讨人喜欢的自己呢。有什么问题吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2149
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_29e28431_1:

    # Nienke "Maybe you don’t have an issue with it, but..."
    Nienke "你可能觉得没问题，可是……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2157
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_c7712c34_1:

    # "I wince as I catch sight of a familiar face coming down the street."
    "街那头走来一张熟悉的面孔，我顿时僵了一下。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2158
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_c2b55162_1:

    # "Is that Hendrik?"
    "那是亨德里克？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2159
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_80f130f4_1:

    # "He used to give me no shortage of trouble back in school, before I enrolled in the lyceum. He spearheaded the concentrated campaign against me, and as far as bullies went, he was definitely the most vicious."
    "升入中学之前，他没少在学校找我的麻烦。那群人专门针对我，就是他带的头。论起欺负人的恶劣程度，他绝对排第一。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2160
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b32fb6b1_1:

    # "He could be pretty inventive with his punishments, too. Once, he put a pulped-up tomato in my desk, and he convinced me it was the bloodied remnants of a dead rat."
    "整人的花样还特别多。有一次，他把捣烂的番茄塞进我的课桌，硬是让我信了那是一只血肉模糊的死老鼠。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2161
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_57304c1b_1:

    # "In retrospect, I’m not sure how he was able to convince me of that — it was only a tomato, after all — but, in my defence, I was only seven years old."
    "现在想想，我都不知道自己怎么会信。明明就是个番茄嘛。不过也不能全怪我，那时我才七岁。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2162
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_ee91f855_1:

    # "I’ve not spoken to Hendrik in ages, and I don’t want to start now."
    "我已经很久没跟亨德里克说过话了，现在也不想。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2163
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_602a5132_1:

    # "He might have changed in the decade since I was last subjected to his company, but I don’t want to find out."
    "距离上次被迫跟他待在一起，已经过去十年。也许他变了，可我不想去验证。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2174
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3f1affb8_1:

    # "I grab hold of Merel’s hand so hard she squeaks, then say..."
    "我猛地攥住梅蕾尔的手，攥得她惊叫一声，接着开口……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2175
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_aeda1396_1:

    # Nienke "Hey. You said you wanted to look at the fields around Alpenrose, too?"
    Nienke "对了，你是不是还想看看阿尔彭罗瑟周围的田野？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2177
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_88caf8f9_1:

    # Merel "O-Oh, um... Yes, that’s right. I was thinkin’ it looked very lush an’ green around here when I was on the train. I’d like to explore — but why’re you clutching my hand like that, Nienke? Could it be..."
    Merel "啊，嗯……对呀。在火车上我就觉得，这一带绿油油的，长得真好。我是想四处逛逛……不过妮恩克，你干吗把我的手抓这么紧？难道说……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2178
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_29259112_1:

    # "Merel’s eyes light up. She beams at me, then says..."
    "梅蕾尔眼睛一亮，冲我灿烂地笑起来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2180
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_00e47151_1:

    # Merel "Do you like me?!"
    Merel "你喜欢我？！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2182
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_388117ca_1:

    # Nienke "Don’t get carried away."
    Nienke "少自作多情了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2184
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_eba5a632_1:

    # Nienke "I’m just showing you the way, so you don’t get lost. The streets around here are narrow, and they turn a lot. If you let go of my hand, we might not be able to find one another again."
    Nienke "我只是给你带路，免得你走丢。这里的街又窄，拐弯又多。你要是松手，我们说不定就找不到对方了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2186
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d71be6ac_1:

    # Merel "I find that a liiiiittle hard to believe, since this village is so small..."
    Merel "这话有那——么一点难信呢，村子明明这么小……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2188
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3ddbd97c_1:

    # Merel "But alright. I don’t mind playing along if it’ll make you sleep better at night."
    Merel "不过行吧。你要是这样就能睡个安稳觉，我也不介意配合一下。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2190
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5916adcb_1:

    # Merel "That’ll benefit me too, actually, if you’re able to get some proper shut-eye. If you start shifting around beneath the sheets, you might wind up kicking me. I want both of us to be comfortable!"
    Merel "说起来，你睡得好，对我也有好处。要是你在被窝里翻来覆去，说不定会踢到我。我希望我们俩都睡得舒服嘛！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2192
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5be83458_1:

    # Nienke "Sure. Whatever you say..."
    Nienke "好好好，你说什么就是什么……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2193
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2bf106e9_1:

    # "My reply is half-hearted, probably because I’m only half paying attention. I’m still a little shaken about that close call."
    "我答得心不在焉，大概因为只分了一半心思听。刚才那一下实在太险，我还有点惊魂未定。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2194
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e0bfcdee_1:

    # "If Hendrik could see me and Merel holding hands, I bet he’d have a field day."
    "要是被亨德里克看见我跟梅蕾尔手牵手，还不知道要拿我们取笑多久。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2203
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_8e9a0efe_1:

    # "Speaking of fields, I’m able to navigate Merel out of the confines of the village without too much trouble."
    "好在，我没费多大劲就把梅蕾尔带出了村子，来到田野间。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2204
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_fda997ea_1:

    # "We get to Alpenrose’s outskirts in a pretty circuitous way, taking all of the narrowed backstreets and cobblestoned alleys."
    "一路专挑狭窄的后街和铺着石头的小巷，兜了个大圈子，才到了阿尔彭罗瑟的边缘。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2205
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_12fb43b3_1:

    # "I don’t often have cause to leave Alpenrose, but when I do, I’m always taken by how pretty the surrounding area is."
    "我平时很少有事需要离开村子，可每次出来，都会被周围的景色打动。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2206
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_90b12fe6_1:

    # "Alpenrose is fringed on all sides by gently undulating hills. These hills are fairly shallow, softly sloping, and they’re studded with various flowers: pale pink primroses and pastel blue cornflowers."
    "阿尔彭罗瑟四周是起伏柔和的小丘。山坡低缓，点缀着各色花朵：浅粉的报春花，淡蓝的矢车菊。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2207
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_872f5150_1:

    # "There’s a river over yonder, which ebbs and flows quietly as it winds about the hills, and there’s a whole bunch of green fields which stretch as far as the eye can see."
    "远处有条河，绕着山丘静静流淌。碧绿的田野一片接着一片，望不到尽头。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2208
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3cadebe9_1:

    # "In the distance, meanwhile, there are several windmills: old structures which creak."
    "更远的地方，还立着几座老风车，吱呀作响。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2209
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_78d8a114_1:

    # "I watch as the sails of the mills turn slowly, as they have ever since I arrived in Alpenrose."
    "我望着缓缓转动的风车翼。从我来到阿尔彭罗瑟起，它们就一直这样转着。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2210
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_6273d458_1:

    # "I’ve been feeling tense all day, but coming out here is relaxing."
    "绷紧了一整天的心，到了这里才渐渐放松。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2211
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_7be7db1e_1:

    # "My shoulders slump in relief as I unhook my fingers from about Merel’s own."
    "我松开梅蕾尔的手，肩膀也终于不再紧绷。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2212
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_8a5477d1_1:

    # "There’s no need to keep clutching her. We’ve finally escaped the confines of the village, and it’s only now that I realise how stifling I was starting to find it."
    "不用再死死抓着她了。我们总算走出了村子，到这时我才发现，自己之前竟被困得有些喘不过气。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2213
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_253db6a2_1:

    # "I suppose I’ve become so accustomed to spending my time in Alpenrose, never leaving, that the sheer smallness of the village never really registered."
    "大概是早已习惯待在阿尔彭罗瑟，哪里也不去，所以从来没真正意识到，这个村子究竟有多小。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2214
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_1c3c0eb9_1:

    # "It’s only now I’m away from the village, and I can see all of these hills and fields, that I can see how restrictive my home really is."
    "如今站在外面，看见眼前的山丘和田野，才发现家里的天地有多么狭窄。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2215
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_71a91b64_1:

    # "It’s no wonder Cornelia wanted to get away from all of this."
    "难怪科妮莉娅想离开。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2219
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_849fe38f_1:

    # "Alpenrose is beautiful, but there’s only so much a person can do here."
    "阿尔彭罗瑟很美，可在这里能做的事，就只有那么多。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2220
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_96fa53ba_1:

    # "I feel like I was able to show Merel almost all of the sights in under fifteen minutes."
    "我好像连十五分钟都没花，就带梅蕾尔看完了几乎所有值得一看的地方。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2221
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_1ab2432b_1:

    # "Isn’t that kind of depressing...?"
    "这不是有点悲哀吗……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2222
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3367f569_1:

    # "I’m experiencing a curious couple of emotions — despondency and a general delight in my surroundings — when..."
    "心里有些沮丧，却又为眼前的景色欣喜。正当这两种奇妙的情绪交织在一起时……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2234
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_28e4c50d_1:

    # Merel "Wow..."
    Merel "哇……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2235
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_ec08c2c7_1:

    # "Merel gasps as she glances about. She looks at the flower-studded hills, then says..."
    "梅蕾尔环顾四周，发出一声惊叹。她望着开满花的小丘，说……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2236
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_448bf7d3_1:

    # Merel "I knew this place would be pretty as I saw it from the train, but it looks even nicer close up!"
    Merel "在火车上就知道这里很美，没想到凑近看更好看！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2241
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_bd096bc1_1:

    # Merel "The sky is so big and blue, and the grass is all so green, too! I didn’t even know that the world was this beautiful!"
    Merel "天又宽又蓝，草也绿得不得了！我都不知道，原来这世界这么漂亮！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2247
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0ccfed24_1:

    # "Merel sighs, then sinks down onto the ground."
    "梅蕾尔感叹着，在地上坐了下来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2248
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_507f38e5_1:

    # "She stretches, as if she means to welcome to sun, then says..."
    "她舒展开身体，像是在迎接阳光。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2250
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_c5f79e2d_1:

    # Merel "This place really is different from Mors Paravail! It’s like a whole other world!"
    Merel "这里跟莫尔斯·帕拉维尔真不一样！简直是另一个世界！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2252
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0c04d661_1:

    # Nienke "And what is Mors Paravail like, then?"
    Nienke "那莫尔斯·帕拉维尔是什么样的？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2254
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_48061d2a_1:

    # Merel "Don’t you remember? You were there for, like, the first five years of your life. Didn’t it make an impression?"
    Merel "你不记得啦？你出生后的头五年都住在那里吧。一点印象也没有？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2256
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_354cb8bc_1:

    # Nienke "Maybe it would have, if I’d lived there more recently..."
    Nienke "如果是最近才住过，或许还能记得……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2258
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_1268b28b_1:

    # Nienke "But I’ve lived most of my life in Alpenrose — and anyway, the majority of people can’t recall what happened to them when they were babies."
    Nienke "可我大半辈子都在阿尔彭罗瑟。再说，大多数人也不记得自己还是小宝宝时的事吧。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2263
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_50273bf7_1:

    # "I take a seat next to Merel as I mumble this, and she laughs good-naturedly in response."
    "我嘟囔着，在梅蕾尔身边坐下。她听了，爽朗地笑起来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2265
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_fbd087d6_1:

    # Merel "Wahaha! Well, good point."
    Merel "哇哈哈！也是，你说得对。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2267
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a1772095_1:

    # Merel "I guess I won’t try’n press the issue then. I guess I’m bein’ unfair..."
    Merel "那我就不追问啦。是我有点强人所难了……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2269
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_c5dcd6c7_1:

    # Merel "But, if you wanna know about Mors Paravail, it’s not much to look at. It’s pretty drab and dismal, since most of it is underground. It’s pretty cold an’ dark, and it gets pretty damp."
    Merel "不过，你要问莫尔斯·帕拉维尔是什么样，那儿其实没什么好看的。大部分都在地下，灰暗又沉闷，又冷又黑，还挺潮湿。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2270
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_7450e01d_1:

    # Merel "We do go out from time to time, of course, to wander around the fields an’ take a look at the stars, but at night we return underground to sleep."
    Merel "当然，我们偶尔也会出去，在田野里逛逛，看看星星。到了晚上，就回地下睡觉。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2272
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b3576b7b_1:

    # Merel "I’m kinda used to it, I guess, since it’s all I’ve ever known..."
    Merel "我从小只见过那种生活，大概已经习惯了吧……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2274
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_194c272b_1:

    # Merel "But I think Alpenrose is much, much prettier!"
    Merel "但我觉得阿尔彭罗瑟漂亮多了，真的！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2276
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3d49a5d3_1:

    # Nienke "Hmm. I suppose that makes sense, though this {i}is{/i} a little strange."
    Nienke "嗯，也能理解。不过，{i}确实{/i}有点奇怪。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2280
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a29a021a_1:

    # Merel "What is?"
    Merel "什么奇怪？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2281
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4a1b0f1d_1:

    # Nienke "When you say all of this stuff, it does sound... vaguely familiar, I suppose. I can recall snatches of it, but it doesn’t quite feel real."
    Nienke "听你说这些，我好像……隐约有点印象。能想起零零碎碎的片段，却又觉得不太真实。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2283
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_707eb394_1:

    # Nienke "It’s almost like something from a dream. It’s hard to believe I really lived there..."
    Nienke "像做过的梦一样。真难相信，我居然在那里住过……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2285
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_55441a37_1:

    # Merel "Well, you did — and your family was real close with mine!"
    Merel "可你就是住过呀！而且你家跟我家关系可好了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2287
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_ca9736f6_1:

    # Nienke "Yes, my parents did mention that. My father told me about your father, and how they used to go stargazing together. He called him Bastian...?"
    Nienke "嗯，爸妈提过。爸爸说起过你爸爸，还有他们一起看星星的事。你爸爸叫巴斯蒂安……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2289
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4f975589_1:

    # Merel "You mean the bastion of knowledge?"
    Merel "就是那辆满载知识的“巴士”？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2290
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_51c34d7c_1:

    # "Merel grins."
    "梅蕾尔咧嘴一笑。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2292
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d95a9647_1:

    # Merel "My old man’s a bit of a know-it-all. I’m afraid I might’ve inherited that from him myself, wahaha..."
    Merel "我爸是有点万事通的毛病。不好意思，我可能也随他，哇哈哈……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2294
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_69107125_1:

    # Merel "But it wasn’t just our dads who were friends, silly. We were super close too, like this."
    Merel "不过，小傻瓜，不光咱们爸爸是朋友。我们俩也特别好，就像这样。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2295
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_36827c63_1:

    # "Merel holds up her right hand for demonstration, her fingers crossed."
    "梅蕾尔举起右手，把两根手指紧紧交叠在一起，示意给我看。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2297
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_6ffcf51b_1:

    # "She grins, flashing me a mouthful of pearly whites, and says..."
    "她笑着露出一口白牙，问……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2298
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_4fb80a84_1:

    # Merel "Do you still not remember me, Nienke?"
    Merel "妮恩克，你还是不记得我吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2302
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_b9aa59c7_7:

    # Nienke "Well..."
    Nienke "这个……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2303
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_7dbff100_1:

    # "I frown, dropping my gaze down to my lap."
    "我蹙起眉，垂眼望向膝头。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2304
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a941523f_1:

    # "I feel like I should know this. There’s a nagging memory at the back of my mind, dull and persistent like a toothache..."
    "我觉得自己应该记得。脑海深处仿佛有什么一直挥之不去，像隐隐的牙痛，一阵阵地磨人……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2306
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e61490dd_1:

    # "But, though I try nudging it, nothing comes to mind."
    "可无论怎么试着去碰触，都想不起具体的东西。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2308
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_eafc8369_1:

    # "I bite the inside of my cheek, feeling guilty, and mumble..."
    "我咬着脸颊内侧，有些内疚地低声说……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2309
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0133df9a_1:

    # Nienke "Sorry, but no. I’m trying, but I really don’t remember."
    Nienke "对不起，还是不记得。我有努力想，可真的想不起来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2311
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a2accabf_1:

    # Merel "I thought that might be the case. I’d hoped, if we spent some time together, it’d all come back to you..."
    Merel "我猜也是。我还以为，多待一会儿，你就能全想起来呢……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2315
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0cf241be_1:

    # Merel "But never mind! I’m sure you’ll remember eventually. It’s not like you were that little when we last saw one another..."
    Merel "不过没关系！总有一天会记起来的。上次见面时，你也不算那么小了……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2316
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d6794a81_1:

    # Merel "Though I guess you’ve always been on the small side! That, at least, hasn’t changed!"
    Merel "虽然你的个子一直小小的！至少这点没变！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2320
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_706cb7f3_1:

    # Nienke "H-Hey...!"
    Nienke "喂、喂……！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2322
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_46b66013_1:

    # "I scowl at Merel, my eyes narrowed, as she rests her palm on the top of my head. I feel her ruffling my hair, and none too gently, so I squirm."
    "我眯起眼瞪她，她却把手掌往我头上一放，毫不温柔地揉乱了我的头发，弄得我扭来扭去。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2323
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_487f2692_1:

    # "I throw off her hand (why is she so touchy-feely, anyway? Is that how all the elves in Mors Paravail act?) and shuffle back on the grass, pouting."
    "我甩开她的手——这人怎么这么爱动手动脚？莫尔斯·帕拉维尔的精灵都这样吗？——噘着嘴，在草地上往后挪了挪。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2325
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_8417d24d_1:

    # Nienke "D-Don’t call me small! I’m really not {i}that{/i} small!"
    Nienke "别、别说我小！我才没有{i}那么{/i}小！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2327
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_51237698_1:

    # Merel "Oh? Sure you’re not, hehe. I {i}do{/i} apologise, milady."
    Merel "哦？好好好，当然没有，嘿嘿。小姐，是我失礼了，{i}实在{/i}抱歉。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2331
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5abc7ff1_1:

    # Nienke "I’m really not! St-Stop teasing me! I might have been one of the smallest in my class, but I’m only a few centimetres smaller than the average!"
    Nienke "本来就没有！别、别逗我了！我在班上是算矮的，但也就比平均身高矮几厘米而已！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2333
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_cce977b5_1:

    # Nienke "I don’t think there’s anything unusual about the way I look..."
    Nienke "我的样子又没什么奇怪的……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2335
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_8e274e2f_1:

    # "Other than my ears, of course. Hendrik and his gang bullied me a lot about those, but nobody ever really bullied me about my height."
    "当然，耳朵除外。亨德里克那伙人没少拿耳朵欺负我，可真没谁嘲笑过我的身高。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2336
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_55047ed4_1:

    # "In fact, I was always led to believe that it was charming for women to be smaller than average. That’s what Cornelia always used to tell me."
    "其实，我一直觉得女孩子个子小一点才可爱。科妮莉娅从前总这么告诉我。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2338
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e5eb81cb_1:

    # Nienke "Plus, some guys like short women. We’re in high demand, I’ll have you know."
    Nienke "而且，有些男生就喜欢个子矮的女生。告诉你，我们可是很抢手的。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2340
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_f84df65e_1:

    # Merel "Oh? Is that so?"
    Merel "哦？是吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2342
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_8d4c828b_1:

    # Nienke "Yes, it is so. Why would I lie about that? Short girls are popular! It’s because we look dainty!"
    Nienke "就是啊。我干吗骗你？小个子女生很受欢迎的！因为看起来娇小可人！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2346
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_04904770_1:

    # Merel "Hehe. Well, I never. I can’t say I was aware of this..."
    Merel "嘿嘿，那我可真长见识了。我还真不知道呢……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2348
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_ba3b525c_1:

    # Merel "But I guess I’ve never really cared what men like."
    Merel "不过，我好像也从没在意过男人喜欢什么。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2350
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_46c4fc0a_1:

    # Nienke "You haven’t...?"
    Nienke "从来没有……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2352
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_47d553a5_1:

    # Merel "Nope! I really couldn’t care less about men: not elvish men {i}or{/i} human men. They’re not my type."
    Merel "没有！不管精灵男人{i}还是{/i}人类男人，我都一点兴趣也没有。我不喜欢那一类。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2354
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_f27e580c_1:

    # "Not her type, hmm? That’s interesting. I wonder..."
    "不喜欢那一类？这倒有意思。难道……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2360
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_59b3e1cb_1:

    # Merel "Well, never mind! I dunno about you, Nienke, but I’m gettin’ kinda hungry. D’you wanna go back to your parents’ now? I’m lookin’ forward to dinner, wahaha!"
    Merel "好啦，不说这个！妮恩克，我不知道你饿不饿，反正我有点饿了。要不要回你家去？我等不及吃晚饭了，哇哈哈！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2362
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_69125667_1:

    # Nienke "Oh, um..."
    Nienke "啊，嗯……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2364
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2da05f62_1:

    # "I blink, nonplussed. I didn’t expect Merel to change the subject so quickly, and it leaves me feeling a bit out of sorts."
    "我愣愣地眨了眨眼。没想到梅蕾尔话题转得这么快，一时有点跟不上。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2366
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3734d098_1:

    # "I get the feeling that Merel’s trying to brush what she just said under the proverbial rug..."
    "总觉得她想把刚才那句话轻轻揭过去，当作没说过……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2371
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_ec427f18_1:

    # "But maybe that’s for the best. I don’t think I should really start probing Merel to discover her tastes."
    "不过，也许这样最好。我好像也不该追根究底，打探她到底喜欢什么人。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2372
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_64dbb997_1:

    # "I don’t think I know her well enough for that."
    "毕竟还没熟到那个份上。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2377
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_dd5f7343_1:

    # "I nod, then get to my own feet. I brush down the front of my dress, trying to free it from any stray blades of grass and clods of dirt, as I say..."
    "我点点头，站起身，拍了拍裙子前面，掸掉沾上的草叶和泥土，说……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2378
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_1f1d64e5_1:

    # Nienke "Alright. Then sounds good to me. Let’s head back...?"
    Nienke "好啊，也行。那就回去吧……？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2380
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_1c24c74f_1:

    # Merel "Great! I can hardly wait to see what your mother’s prepared, wahaha~ I’m so hungry, I could eat a horse!"
    Merel "太好了！真想赶快看看你妈妈做了什么，哇哈哈～我饿得能吃下一匹马！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2382
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a5cc3673_1:

    # Nienke "A whole one?"
    Nienke "整匹？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2384
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_94ff4969_1:

    # "I’m sure Merel’s just exaggerating, but she {i}is{/i} rather muscular. I almost wouldn’t be surprised if she could consume an entire equine, given her physique."
    "她肯定是在夸张，可她{i}确实{/i}挺壮实。看这体格，就算真能吃下一整匹马，我好像也不会太惊讶。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2385
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2516979f_1:

    # "She certainly had no qualms with demolishing five of my mother’s apple pancakes at breakfast."
    "毕竟早上那五张苹果煎饼，她吃得可是毫无压力。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2387
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_48d9a39a_1:

    # Merel "Well, maybe not..."
    Merel "那倒未必……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2389
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a5b11f86_1:

    # Merel "But I did do a lot of travellin’ today, and I {i}am{/i} pretty peckish. If the rest of your mother’s cooking is as good as her pancakes, then I think I’m in for a real treat!"
    Merel "不过今天坐车跑了这么远，我{i}确实{/i}饿啦。要是你妈妈别的菜也跟煎饼一样好吃，那我可有口福了！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2391
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_165cc5ed_1:

    # Merel "Now, let’s get goin’!"
    Merel "走吧走吧！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2393
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_bc249974_1:

    # Nienke "Sure, sure. I’m coming..."
    Nienke "好啦好啦，这就来……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2394
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_2e43eadf_1:

    # "I head along behind Merel, sighing as I do so."
    "我叹着气，跟在梅蕾尔身后。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2398
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_724b60d4_1:

    # "I don’t want to begrudge Merel for having too much energy, but geez. Will I really be able to deal with this girl?"
    "她精力旺盛，我倒也不想为这个埋怨她。可真是的，我应付得来这姑娘吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2399
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_9bf0b884_1:

    # "The end of the week can’t come quickly enough."
    "这一周，还是快点结束吧。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2412
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_ab079190_1:

    # "Later that night..."
    "当天深夜……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2426
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5d8f21e9_1:

    # Merel "Nn, mm... Haa... Zzzz..."
    Merel "嗯，唔……哈啊……呼噜噜……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2427
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_730bcb10_1:

    # Nienke "Hey, Merel. Can you be quiet, please?"
    Nienke "喂，梅蕾尔。麻烦你安静一点好吗？"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2432
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_f708f161_1:

    # "{i}Nudge, nudge.{/i}"
    "{i}推了推。{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2433
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_7fca99f1_1:

    # Merel "Mm, mmph... Zz..."
    Merel "唔，唔嗯……呼……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2434
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_ab69eeca_1:

    # Nienke "Merel, please. I’m trying to sleep!"
    Nienke "梅蕾尔，拜托了。我想睡觉！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2439
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_11887489_1:

    # "{i}Prod, prod.{/i}"
    "{i}戳了戳。{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2440
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_663c5d1d_1:

    # Merel "Nnn, mm.... Zzz..."
    Merel "嗯——唔……呼噜噜……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2441
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_1056a626_1:

    # Nienke "Hey, Merel!"
    Nienke "喂，梅蕾尔！"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2446
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_f2e70f68_1:

    # "{i}Shake, shake.{/i}"
    "{i}晃了晃。{/i}"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2447
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_bc1a80bb_1:

    # Nienke "Stop making so much noise, please. I’ll never be able to go to sleep like that."
    Nienke "别再出声了，拜托。你这样，我根本睡不着。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2448
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_109c3647_1:

    # "I give Merel another shove, hoping that this might shut her up, but..."
    "我又推了她一下，盼着这回能让她闭嘴。可是……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2449
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_77915a97_1:

    # Merel "Nn... Zzzz..."
    Merel "嗯……呼噜噜……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2450
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a111f396_1:

    # "She’s still snoring. Geez."
    "她还在打呼噜。真是够了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2451
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_3830ec92_1:

    # "She’s making such a racket, I’m afraid I’ll never be able to go to bed at this rate, and she’s also taking up a lot of space."
    "这么吵下去，我怕是一晚上都别想睡了。而且她还占了好大一块地方。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2452
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_d2d333af_1:

    # "She’s practically sprawled across the bed, and her legs are arranged in such a way that she keeps nudging me with her foot beneath the sheets."
    "她几乎横着摊在床上，腿也摆得乱七八糟，被子底下老有只脚来碰我。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2453
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_57676696_1:

    # "My mother always tuts when she sees the state of my bed, and she asks me how I can sleep with all of those stuffed toys getting in the way."
    "妈妈每次看见我的床都要啧啧两声，问我塞这么多毛绒玩具，挡手挡脚的，到底怎么睡得着。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2454
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_e8b87a75_1:

    # "My stuffed toys take up far less space than Merel does, however — and they make much less noise, too."
    "可我的毛绒玩具比梅蕾尔占的地方小多了，也安静多了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2455
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_0da72e43_1:

    # "Merel might’ve been excited about the idea of having a girly sleepover, just the two of us beneath the sheets..."
    "也许梅蕾尔很期待这种只有我们俩、同盖一床被子的女孩睡衣派对……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2456
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a26cd065_1:

    # Merel "Nn, mm... Haa..."
    Merel "嗯，唔……哈啊……"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2457
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_f00e8a12_1:

    # "But I can’t say I appreciate the idea."
    "可我实在喜欢不起来。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2458
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_02a9bd7a_1:

    # "In fact, I think it sucks."
    "简直糟透了。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2459
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_5a86c5af_1:

    # "I’m afraid I won’t be able to get any sleep at all, all thanks to this stupid elf who’s never heard the meaning of personal space."
    "托这位根本不懂私人空间为何物的笨蛋精灵的福，今晚我恐怕一觉也睡不成。"

# game/chapter1.rpyc:2460
translate zh_CN_portable_compat cont_a2b130a6_1:

    # "How hard is it not to drape herself across the bed like a starfish? I know this isn’t the first time I’ve said this, but what’s her problem?!"
    "不要像海星一样摊满整张床，有那么难吗？虽然这句话我已经说过了，可她到底什么毛病啊？！"

